tion\": 7.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"with my foot then my hand and then drop\",\r\n        \"start\": 54.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"with the opposite foot\",\r\n        \"start\": 57.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 9.16\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"foot hand down okay so this is yeah a\",\r\n        \"start\": 61.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.479\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"great way of\",\r\n        \"start\": 66.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.56\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"incorporating the speed step into an\",\r\n        \"start\": 68.159,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.401\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"exit keeping the speed going from The\",\r\n        \"start\": 71.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Vault and not having to do the full\",\r\n        \"start\": 74.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Vault on the exit so you don\'t have to\",\r\n        \"start\": 77.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.199\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"do the full cat pass or Dash Vault or\",\r\n        \"start\": 80.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"whatever it is that you\'re doing uh the\",\r\n        \"start\": 83.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.961\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"speed step can be a really good exit for\",\r\n        \"start\": 85.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.239\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"another vault\",\r\n        \"start\": 88.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.359\r\n    }\r\n]'),(20049,55157,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(20050,55157,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:14,000\r\nthe speed step can also be used as an\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,000\r\nexit to another Vault and it\'s actually\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000\r\nreally handy 