n18\r\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\ndrops down into the step F let\'s give it\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000\r\na go there there and drop so that would\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:62,000 --> 00:01:08,000\r\nbe the speed step coming downwards with\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:65,000 --> 00:01:08,000\r\na downwards action\r\n\r\n'),(20589,55161,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(20590,55161,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJXchqrtfZXJ1jxzCaeObrVhJmON\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735839896,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The speed step technique introduced in this discussion is particularly effective for downward motions. It emphasizes avoiding the typical step vault method, which can lead to unsafe impacts on hands and face. Instead, a one-foot jump and landing strategy is recommended to mitigate the risks, especially when dealing with significant drops.nnWhen executing the speed step, the focus is on ensuring that the leg absorbs the impact of the drop, while the hand transitions safely to secure a stable landing. This method not only aids in maintaining balance but also helps in controlling the descent. Key points include navigating obstacles like branches while ensuring the entire maneuver is executed smoothly.nnOverall, the speed step provides a structured approach to safely descending from heights. By using this technique, individuals can effectively manage the risks associated with downward movements and enhance their agility in complex environments.nnKey points:n1. The speed step technique is essential for safely navigating downward motions.n2. It replaces the traditional step vault to reduce impact risks.n3. Proper execution involves leg impact absorption and controlled hand placement for stability.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 800,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 206,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1006,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"_PoxU769MhDUISXKhwy0OywQNT5.DAzsxu2fudKHP4c-1735839900-1.0.1.1-fKj7x_mhE_ERL2YRZe7iy0KTTaE8Y8KlQEORNE3B4Zs3UPoqIWuPPoZQ_i8ejlZzpDZBwe0ScPch_T9djElUHg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735841700,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"irsbaFtC0aD4g1SE..AJxccpA_NrNEfOf0KqiAn7SpM-1735839900979-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(20591,55161,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(20592,55161,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The speed step technique introduced in this discussion is particularly effective for downward motions. It emphasizes avoiding the typical step vault method, which can lead to unsafe impacts on hands and face. Instead, a one-foot jump and landing strategy is recommended to mitigate the risks, especially when dealing with significant drops.\r\n\r\nWhen executing the speed step, the focus is on ensuring that the leg absorbs the impact of the drop, while the hand transitions safely to secure a stable landing. This method not only aids in maintaining balance but also helps in controlling the descent. Key points include navigating obstacles like branches while ensuring the entire maneuver is executed smoothly.\r\n\r\nOverall, the speed step provides a structured approach to safely descending from heights. By using this technique, individuals can effectively manage the risks associated with downward movements and enhance their agility in complex environments.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The speed step technique is essential for safely navigating downward motions.\r\n2. It replaces the traditional step vault to reduce impact risks.\r\n3. Proper execution involves leg impact absorption and controlled hand placement for stability.'),(20593,55161,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(20594,55161,'svg_id',''),(20595,55161,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(20596,55161,'svg_colour',''),(20597,55161,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(20598,55161,'extra_variables',''),(20599,55161,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(20600,55161,'notes',''),(20601,55161,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(20602,55161,'enable_youtube_api',''),(20603,55161,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(20604,55161,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(20605,55161,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(20606,55161,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(20607,55161,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(20608,55161,'e