\n\r\n22\r\n00:00:69,000 --> 00:01:14,000\r\nbail position um to catch yourself you\r\n\r\n23\r\n00:00:73,000 --> 00:01:17,000\r\nknow really you wouldn\'t want to do that\r\n\r\n24\r\n00:00:74,000 --> 00:01:20,000\r\nbut um yeah this is something that is\r\n\r\n25\r\n00:00:77,000 --> 00:01:22,000\r\ngoing to focus on fear and uh really\r\n\r\n26\r\n00:00:81,000 --> 00:01:24,000\r\ntakes a lot of practice and you should\r\n\r\n27\r\n00:00:82,000 --> 00:01:27,000\r\nonly be doing it if you\'re very\r\n\r\n28\r\n00:00:84,000 --> 00:01:31,000\r\ncomfortable with your Precision jumps um\r\n\r\n29\r\n00:00:88,000 --> 00:01:34,000\r\nso yeah let\'s give that a go um so from\r\n\r\n30\r\n00:00:91,000 --> 00:01:34,000\r\nhere\r\n\r\n31\r\n00:00:100,000 --> 00:01:48,000\r\nuh there we go so that is the um\r\n\r\n32\r\n00:00:106,000 --> 00:01:51,000\r\nperpendicular height wall jump uh if\r\n\r\n33\r\n00:00:109,000 --> 00:01:53,000\r\nyou\'re um capable and you feel\r\n\r\n34\r\n00:00:111,000 --> 00:01:57,000\r\ncomfortable and you can overcome the\r\n\r\n35\r\n00:00:113,000 --> 00:01:58,000\r\nfear then give that a go\r\n\r\n'),(21363,55168,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(21364,55168,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AkulTKxjTx5LCmkWvddoEKJt7mqu6\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744655,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"Practicing jumping techniques, especially those involving high perpendicular walls with a drop on the other side, presents both physical and psychological challenges. This type of jump demands that an individual feels comfortable in a narrow stance to execute a leap effectively. The need for precision during the take-off becomes crucial as both feet cannot be placed wide apart, thus allowing one to focus on controlled jumps either from two feet together or one foot.nnThe fear associated with jumping from heights, particularly over edges with significant drops, necessitates a strong foundation in precision jumping. The practice involves not only a focus on the physical aspect of the jump but also overcoming mental barriers related to the height and drop. A proper bail position is essential for safety during falls, should the jump not be executed successfully, emphasizing the risk involved in these maneuvers.nnIncorporating this jump into training routines should only be done if one has a solid grasp on precision jumping techniques. As mastering this skill takes time and repeated practice, it’s important to only attempt these challenging jumps when comfortable with both the physical requirements and overcoming fear. Thus, taking a gradual approach to learning and perfecting the jump ensures a safer and more effective training experience.nnKey Points:n1. Jumping from high perpendicular walls requires precision and comfort in narrow stances.n2. Overcoming psychological fear is critical for successful execution of high jumps.n3. Practicing these jumps should be reserved for those already adept in precision jumping techniques.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1291,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 290,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1581,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"UnF7eqNw8SKb2PF8vKrbNID8M1U4B4Kw2WBoOf.VtLI-1735744662-1.0.1.1-2o6.TTt.H.PAE6cYGL3oV.Qpm_Q0FBoSAdGi8Y.JU4SdZU7RKUBOnVXYlVvn4q1Ajy3JxZskzjzBOAUxNTb6wA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746462,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"By2ZUwC8.63Mg7SnYtH6FtbxnjftgOv8GKT1hjO8AG8-1735744662540-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(21365,55168,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(21366,55168,'video_transcript_chatgpt','Practicing jumping techniques, especially those involving high perpendicular walls with a drop on the other side, presents both physical and psychological challenges. This type of jump demands that an individual feels comfortable in a narrow stance to execute a leap effectively. The need for precision during the take-off becomes crucial as both feet cannot be placed wide apart, thus allowing one to focus on controlled jumps either from two feet together or one foot.\r\n\r\nThe fear associated with jumping from heights, particularly over edges with significant drops, necessitates a strong foundation in precision jumping. The practice involves not only a focus on the physical aspect of the jump but also overcoming mental barriers related to the height and drop. A proper bail position is essential for safety during falls, should the jump not be executed successfully, emphasizing the risk involved in these maneuvers.\r\n\r\nIncorporating this jump into training routines should only be done if one has a solid grasp on precision jumping techniques. As mastering this skill takes time and repeated practice, it’s important to only attempt these challenging jumps when comfortable with both the physical requirements and overcoming fear. Thus, taking a gradual approach to learning and perfecting the jump ensures a safer and more effective training experience.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Jumping from high perpendicular walls requires precision and comfort in narrow stances.\r\n2. Overcoming psychological fear is critical for successful execution of high jumps.\r\n3. Practicing these jumps should be reserved for those already adept in precision jumping techniques.'),(21367,55168,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(21368,55168,'svg_id',''),(21369,55168,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(21370,55168,'svg_colour',''),(21371,55168,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(21372,55168,'extra_variables',''),(21373,55168,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(21374,55168,'notes',''),(21375,55168,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(21376,55168,'enable_youtube_api',''),(21377,55168,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(21378,55168,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(21379,55168,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(21380,55168,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(21381,55168,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(21382,55168,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(21383,55168,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(21384,55168,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(21385,55168,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(21386,55168,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(21387,55168,'_enable_