building fluidity and efficiency in movements. Utilizing the momentum gained from the cat leap can enhance the climb-up process, making it swifter and easier. This involves a correct landing posture, where the legs and arms are engaged effectively to push off and rise to the next level, benefitting from the elastic rebound effect of the legs.nnDemonstrating these techniques, key actions are suggested: ensuring a proper landing position during the arm jump, followed by a coordinated push upward to achieve the climb. Reiteration of practice aims at refining these skills to improve overall performance in parkour.nnKey Points:n1. Mastering the cat leap and arm jump is crucial for effective parkour climbing techniques.n2. Practicing these movements enhances fluidity and efficiency when overcoming obstacles, especially vertical ones.n3. Utilizing momentum and proper landing techniques during the arm jump aids in a smoother transition into climbing up.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1410,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 281,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1691,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"0sFif2C5DYv214dsCYkXwhxa5Z0peCBt3QA2NCB5m34-1735745286-1.0.1.1-A.hd00Dg9JJAn6Eiuk0n107WB_FcTps22HWioiUCbYnhpgyjj9vzmEQ6mbv8OyCe4pQW5bloPqTVCUiYnbbrLA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735747086,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"YAHUDWRsc8tWCa9q7nWuUsgzB5q21m82m4GgqTiZTpU-1735745286579-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(23130,55186,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(23131,55186,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion emphasizes the significance of mastering the cat leap and arm jump techniques in parkour, as these are essential movements for successfully climbing walls and overcoming obstacles. Beginning with an understanding of the arm jump, the focus is on the execution and how this combination allows for seamless climbing transitions when approaching vertical surfaces like walls or ledges. It\'s highlighted that these skills are crucial for when conventional climbing space is absent, such as on a narrow window sill.\r\n\r\nPracticing the arm jump in conjunction with the climb-up is portrayed as vital for building fluidity and efficiency in movements. Utilizing the momentum gained from the cat leap can enhance the climb-up process, making it swifter and easier. This involves a correct landing posture, where the legs and arms are engaged effectively to push off and rise to the next level, benefitting from the elastic rebound effect of the legs.\r\n\r\nDemonstrating these techniques, key actions are suggested: ensuring a proper landing position during the arm jump, followed by a coordinated push upward to achieve the climb. Reiteration of practice aims at refining these skills to improve overall performance in parkour.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Mastering the cat leap and arm jump is crucial for effective parkour climbing techniques.\r\n2. Practicing these movements enhances fluidity and efficiency when overcoming obstacles, especially vertical ones.\r\n3. Utilizing momentum and proper landing techniques during the arm jump aids in a smoother transition into climbing up.'),(23132,55186,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(23133,55186,'svg_id',''),(23134,55186,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(23135,55186,'svg_colour',''),(23136,55186,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(23137,55186,'extra_variables',''),(23138,55186,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(23139,55186,'notes',''),(23140,55186,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(23141,55186,'enable_youtube_api',''),(23142,55186,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(23143,55186,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(23144,55186,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(23145,55186,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(23146,55186,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(23147,55186,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(23148,55186,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(23149,55186,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(23150,55186,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(23151,55186,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(23152,55186,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(23153,55186,'enable_transcript',''),(23154,55186,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(23155,55186,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(23156,55186,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(23157,55186,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound