ps, and arms positioned correctly during landing. Finally, the overall advice encourages gradual progression and enjoyment while practicing running jumps to help athletes improve their skills and confidence.nn**Key Points:**n1. A running jump utilizes momentum for greater height and distance but demands strict attention to technique to minimize injury risks.n2. Athletes should focus on foot placement during takeoff rather than the landing destination to ensure accuracy and safety.n3. Proper technique involves coordinated body positioning and should be practiced gradually for skill improvement and enjoyment.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2195,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 307,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2502,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"8ED23s0yxRpihXPtVCpgBKAF7sLJYSIDbeHgLX4Qivk-1735745022-1.0.1.1-uKHUvWzleXKBnPT_BcUhB2T02.i_udn5Xa3g1B7KVEieGhdhxPAK7g1V0JpKD_QSSJHw2YKRMWdc5ektvlmeaQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746822,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"f5.waDhPNYE4gzQ3H8JfVw3Kbaif_ARTFdEAbislMRw-1735745022164-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(23762,55192,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(23763,55192,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion focuses on the technique and advantages of performing a running jump compared to a standing jump. A running jump allows the jumper to utilize momentum generated from the running speed, which minimizes the power needed to achieve the same distances as in a standing jump. This added momentum means that athletes can achieve greater heights and distances, but it also introduces an increased need for precision in technique, as the impact force on landing is greater.\r\n\r\nKey aspects of executing a running jump include maintaining proper gaze and foot placement during takeoff. It\'s crucial to focus on where the foot lands rather than the target destination ahead. Many athletes make the mistake of looking at their landing spot too early, reducing their accuracy on foot placement and heightening their risk of injury. Therefore, gaining control over the foot\'s positioning before jumping is essential for a successful landing.\r\n\r\nThe execution of a running jump requires certain techniques to ensure safety and effectiveness. Adequate preparation involves practicing the coordination between legs and a driving motion upwards, while keeping proper posture—bent knees, hips, and arms positioned correctly during landing. Finally, the overall advice encourages gradual progression and enjoyment while practicing running jumps to help athletes improve their skills and confidence.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. A running jump utilizes momentum for greater height and distance but demands strict attention to technique to minimize injury risks.\r\n2. Athletes should focus on foot placement during takeoff rather than the landing destination to ensure accuracy and safety.\r\n3. Proper technique involves coordinated body positioning and should be practiced gradually for skill improvement and enjoyment.'),(23764,55192,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(23765,55192,'svg_id',''),(23766,55192,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(23767,55192,'svg_colour',''),(23768,55192,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(23769,55192,'extra_variables',''),(23770,55192,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(23771,55192,'notes',''),(23772,55192,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(23773,55192,'enable_youtube_api',''),(23774,55192,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(23775,55192,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(23776,55192,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(23777,55192,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(23778,55192,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(23779,55192,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(23780,55192,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(23781,55192,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(23782,55192,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(23783,55192,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(23784,55192,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(23785,55192,'enable_transcript',''),(23786,55192,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(23787,55192,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(23788,55192,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(23789,55192,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(23790,55192,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(23791,55192,'rank_math_