together to get max\",\r\n        \"start\": 47.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.119\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"power when you do the running\",\r\n        \"start\": 50.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"jump you want to focus on the takeoff\",\r\n        \"start\": 54.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.241\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Point rather than The Landing I see this\",\r\n        \"start\": 58.44,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"too much that people are running along\",\r\n        \"start\": 62.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.44\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and they\'re looking at the Landing\",\r\n        \"start\": 64.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.119\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"rather than the takeoff point and the\",\r\n        \"start\": 66.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.12\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"takeoff misses or you go too far and\",\r\n        \"start\": 69.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"this is where the problem lies not\",\r\n        \"start\": 73.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"there focus on this first make sure your\",\r\n        \"start\": 77.119,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"foot is landed first full speed foot on\",\r\n        \"start\": 79.88,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"then look up then look at the target of\",\r\n        \"start\": 84,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.64\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"where you\'re going to land you\'re going\",\r\n        \"start\": 86.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to have enough time to figure out how to\",\r\n        \"start\": 87.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.799\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"land as you have ta