10,000\r\nokay so the box drop is we\'ve been doing\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000\r\nthe box jumps you can do a box jump but\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000\r\nnow it\'s to a drop on the other side um\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000\r\nit\'s a normal box jump yeah you\'re now\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000\r\njust having to take the impact on the\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000\r\nother side as well um be careful of your\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000\r\nsurfaces and yeah it\'s uh find a\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000\r\nscenario where you can do it it\'s\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:37,000\r\nusually to something where um you can\'t\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000\r\nsee the landing but yeah let\'s give it a\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000\r\ngo here we go\r\n\r\n'),(25609,55210,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(25610,55210,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AkukgkoFAJqmKwYg5uucKz5mu7EXV\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744606,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The discussion revolves around the concept of box jumps evolving into drop jumps. Initially, box jumps involve leaping onto a box, but the new focus shifts towards performing a box jump and landing on the opposite side of the box. This transition adds a greater challenge, as it requires not only the jump but also the ability to absorb impact when landing.nnSafety and appropriate surface selection are emphasized throughout the explanation. Participants are advised to be cautious about their landing areas, as uneven or unsuitable surfaces could increase the risk of injury. It is also suggested that practitioners find environments where the landing area isn\'t clearly visible, which might further enhance the difficulty of the exercise.nnThe instruction culminates with an invitation to try the technique in a practical setting. This hands-on approach allows individuals to experience the modified box jump firsthand, reinforcing the importance of both technique and the ability to manage impact upon landing.nnKey Points:n1. Box jumps are evolving to include drop jumps, requiring athletes to manage their landing impact.n2. Safety precautions, such as selecting appropriate surfaces, are crucial for preventing injuries.n3. Practical application and experience with the exercise are encouraged to master the technique.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 442,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 230,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 672,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"aKBqWQJawrj.FGIaaA6KJuCXqe9iIObXKqxBJeumU6Y-1735744611-1.0.1.1-3I.4ej7S1HhnIXcJNud.boCDHSknVYfIpuOSchWUv7kipHoPuWipS5PoM8moKIjUAC7ANZGKbzLWdeeLt1Riyw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746411,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"YkNBUVSpLuo3_3F67.p6XXV_YD5Xbq1HIKqYPyJgLNc-1735744611323-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(25611,55210,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(25612,55210,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion revolves around the concept of box jumps evolving into drop jumps. Initially, box jumps involve leaping onto a box, but the new focus shifts towards performing a box jump and landing on the opposite side of the box. This transition adds a greater challenge, as it requires not only the jump but also the ability to absorb impact when landing.\r\n\r\nSafety and appropriate surface selection are emphasized throughout the explanation. Participants are advised to be cautious about their landing areas, as uneven or unsuitable surfaces could increase the risk of injury. It is also suggested that practitioners find environments where the landing area isn\'t clearly visible, which might further enhance the difficulty of the exercise.\r\n\r\nThe instruction culminates with an invitation to try the technique in a practical setting. This hands-on approach allows individuals to experience the modified box jump firsthand, reinforcing the importance of both technique and the ability to manage impact upon landing.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Box jumps are evolving to include drop jumps, requiring athletes to manage their landing impact.\r\n2. Safety precautions, such as selecting appropriate surfaces, are crucial for preventing injuries.\r\n3. Practical application and experience with the exercise are encouraged to master the technique.'),(25613,55210,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(25614,55210,'svg_id',''),(25615,55210,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(25616,55210,'svg_colour',''),(25617,55210,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(25618,55210,'extra_variables',''),(25619,55210,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(25620,55210,'notes',''),(25621,55210,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(25622,55210,'enable_youtube_api',''),(25623,55210,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(25624,55210,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(25625,55210,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(25626,55210,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(25627,55210,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(25628,55210,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(25629,55210,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(25630,55210,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(25631,55210,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(25632,55210,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(25633,55210,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(25634,55210,'enable_transcript',''),(25635,55210,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(25636,55210,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(25637,55210,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(25638,55210,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(25639,55210,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(25640,55210,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(25641,55210,'video_filename','Jumping-BoxJumps/Tutorial-jumping-box_jumps-9-box-drops.mp4'),(25642,55210,'_video_filename','field_677cead91f698'),(25643,55210,'portrait_thumbnail_image','Jumping-BoxJumps/screenshots/Tutorial-jumping-box_jumps-9-box-drops_3_4.png'),(25644,55210,'_portrait_thumbnail_image',''