                  \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The process of successfully executing a high jump involves various critical techniques, beginning with the take-off. The individual first explains that they will reach for a lamp instead of a wall during the jump. This action allows for the upward momentum to be maintained while providing a secure grip, enabling them to push away safely and execute a proper landing.nnWhen hanging from the lamp post, the jumper should focus on pushing off effectively. As they descend, it’s crucial to mindfully locate the landing spot to ensure a safe and correct placement of the feet upon landing. Specifically, the individual emphasizes the importance of landing on the balls of the feet to avoid injury and maintain balance.nnFurthermore, the jumper needs to be vigilant about the nature of the landing surface. Uneven terrain or obstacles can greatly affect the landing, so careful consideration is necessary. They advise targeting a safe, flat area and avoiding precarious spots, such as the edge of a step, to prevent any mishaps during the landing process.nnKey points:n1. Proper grip and upward momentum are essential for executing a high jump successfully.n2. Focus on safe and precise landing techniques to avoid injury.n3. Assess the landing surface to choose the best spot for a secure landing.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 932,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 245,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1177,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"JNZhv_6eMwS_gWB3tk3UNCCVw6NoFtYwWDTBOxHTDbc-1735745070-1.0.1.1-91yltQsbZc431kqT8h.2MNs0Jt5jqAWDVTIZ4V0frV9Th7LfIHRlCEgcnN5bol48JIk6CZNrNexSbDpI9BfFNQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746870,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"TRNtKMAmrdsMIiLSZXOJfm4gdOCX2HEKDfdvG.cvkpY-1735745070137-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(27275,55227,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(27276,55227,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The process of successfully executing a high jump involves various critical techniques, beginning with the take-off. The individual first explains that they will reach for a lamp instead of a wall during the jump. This action allows for the upward momentum to be maintained while providing a secure grip, enabling them to push away safely and execute a proper landing.\r\n\r\nWhen hanging from the lamp post, the jumper should focus on pushing off effectively. As they descend, it’s crucial to mindfully locate the landing spot to ensure a safe and correct placement of the feet upon landing. Specifically, the individual emphasizes the importance of landing on the balls of the feet to avoid injury and maintain balance.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, the jumper needs to be vigilant about the nature of the landing surface. Uneven terrain or obstacles can greatly affect the landing, so careful consideration is necessary. They advise targeting a safe, flat area and avoiding precarious spots, such as the edge of a step, to prevent any mishaps during the landing process.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Proper grip and upward momentum are essential for executing a high jump successfully.\r\n2. Focus on safe and precise landing techniques to avoid injury.\r\n3. Assess the landing surface to choose the best spot for a secure landing.'),(27277,55227,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(27278,55227,'svg_id',''),(27279,55227,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(27280,55227,'svg_colour',''),(27281,55227,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(27282,55227,'extra_variables',''),(27283,55227,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(27284,55227,'notes',''),(27285,55227,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(27286,55227,'enable_youtube_api',''),(27287,55227,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(27288,55227,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(27289,55227,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(27290,55227,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(27291,55227,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(27292,55227,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(27293,55227,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(27294,55227,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(27295,55227,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(27296,55227,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(27297,55227,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(27298,55227,'enable_transcript',''),(27299,55227,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(27300,55227,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(27301,55227,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(27302,55227,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the follow