01:106,000\r\nit all completely uh yeah practice that\r\n\r\n56\r\n00:00:163,000 --> 00:01:109,000\r\non a low wall build up and uh make sure\r\n\r\n57\r\n00:00:166,000 --> 00:01:109,000\r\nyou try it on concrete\r\n\r\n'),(27696,55231,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(27697,55231,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-Akurn8Fokvr7q4MHxIB3j0B6BRYrv\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735745047,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The discussion revolves around the importance of mastering the roll in parkour, emphasizing that it plays a vital role in impact dispersion during falls. The technique is crucial because the human body cannot withstand high-impact landings directly; a proper roll redirects the downward force and minimizes injury. Starting with low walls and progressing to more challenging surfaces can help individuals get accustomed to this technique, and practicing on grass initially may soften the learning curve.nnPracticing the roll requires a mindset shift, moving from trying to resist falls to allowing oneself to flow into the roll. The traditional approach to executing a roll involves dropping and curving sideways. Although there are various methods to perform this action, focusing on the traditional roll is recommended for beginners. It’s necessary to feel comfortable with the motion before attempting it on harder surfaces like concrete, which is essential for real parkour applications.nnThe necessity of practicing on concrete is underscored, as failing to do so may result in harm if one attempts to execute a roll from a height without being prepared. To effectively demonstrate the technique, an example of dropping from a height and flowing into a roll was offered. The main objective is to disperse impact gradually while ensuring continuous movement, which allows for the body\'s momentum to carry through the roll. Consistent practice on lower structures helps build confidence and skill before tackling more challenging environments.nnKey Points:n1. The roll is crucial in parkour for dispersing impact forces during falls, allowing the body to handle drops safely.n2. Beginners should start practicing the roll on low walls and gradually move to harder surfaces, ensuring proficiency before attempting more difficult rolls.n3. Practicing on concrete is essential for effective parkour, as a lack of familiarity with the roll on such surfaces can lead to injuries.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2075,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 351,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2426,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Gi_3LnX5ljxM4E2PMGHBuRSjQJwzLLwqxR6z5xf.5IM-1735745052-1.0.1.1-3jz4gUuHrIAgyC20nJacd78FVVJbYW4u0sGUtvdrjbvvdudEvV4TFbZGA8_bNCc7fRmMoo1Fy2.jUKtcWOOsCQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746852,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"KoYe_a1bFJ.4efW1VPGMoj0bLzvYBBCSRM_jzs9RjGA-1735745052096-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(27698,55231,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(27699,55231,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion revolves around the importance of mastering the roll in parkour, emphasizing that it plays a vital role in impact dispersion during falls. The technique is crucial because the human body cannot withstand high-impact landings directly; a proper roll redirects the downward force and minimizes injury. Starting with low walls and progressing to more challenging surfaces can help individuals get accustomed to this technique, and practicing on grass initially may soften the learning curve.\r\n\r\nPracticing the roll requires a mindset shift, moving from trying to resist falls to allowing oneself to flow into the roll. The traditional approach to executing a roll involves dropping and curving sideways. Although there are various methods to perform this action, focusing on the traditional roll is recommended for beginners. It’s necessary to feel comfortable with the motion before attempting it on harder surfaces like concrete, which is essential for real parkour applications.\r\n\r\nThe necessity of practicing on concrete is underscored, as failing to do so may result in harm if one attempts to execute a roll from a height without being prepared. To effectively demonstrate the technique, an example of dropping from a height and flowing into a roll was offered. The main objective is to disperse impact gradually while ensuring continuous movement, which allows for the body\'s momentum to carry through the roll. Consistent practice on lower structures helps build confidence and skill before tackling more challenging environments.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The roll is crucial in parkour for dispersing impact forces during falls, allowing the body to handle drops safely.\r\n2. Beginners should start practicing the roll on low walls and gradually move to harder surfaces, ensuring proficiency before attempting more difficult rolls.\r\n3. Practicing on concrete is essential for effective parkour, as a lack of familiarity with the roll on such surfaces can lead to injuries.'),(27700,55231,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(27701,55231,'svg_id',''),(27702,55231,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(27703,55231,'svg_colour',''),(27704,55231,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(27705,55231,'extra_variables',''),(27706,55231,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(27707,55231,'notes',''),(27708,55231,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(27709,55231,'enable_youtube_api',''),(27710,55231,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(27711,55231,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(27712,55231,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(27713,55231,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(27714,55231,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(27715,55231,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(27716,55231,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(27717,55231,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(27718,55231,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(27719,55231,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(27720,55231,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(27721,55231,'enable_transcript',''),(27722,55231,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(27723,55231,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(27724,55231,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(27725,5523