han distance. It’s essential for the performer to reach out at full height to successfully grab onto a ledge or surface.nnPracticing technical aspects of the jump enhances proficiency. This includes mastering the technique of one-handed grabs, which can be crucial for maintaining grip if the jump isn\'t successful. A solid understanding of executing a one-handed dead hang can serve as a valuable skill for handling unexpected slips during the jump.nnPerforming the upward cat leap demands dedication and skill, and it can lead to elevated performances if done correctly. If a jumper manages to secure a grip with one hand, they can increase their chances of climbing further. However, the challenge lies in achieving the necessary upward trajectory rather than a horizontal leap.nnKey Points:n1. The upward cat leap requires significant upward force and precision to reach surfaces higher than head height.n2. Technical training, especially in one-handed grabs, is critical for success and safety during the jump.n3. Mastering this maneuver can enhance performance and lead to greater climbing capabilities when executed well.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1044,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 251,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1295,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"9BBoQvXR6F08nu772k.nyA5tQ9vY2SfxCw1pS7dq_EM-1735744429-1.0.1.1-0zlzafKH1PM4XzPCI5H.teyuQlNqMS5fVjXnwC3CZqZ2v3ZyYScGt5CKR9G7_G8PAURyUx9qVAeBKfNLdL0fog\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746229,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"NKGoDvu8TqMx93XXcUiURsBfL0nXBZcdc28373Fhr8A-1735744429802-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(29944,55254,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(29945,55254,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The upward cat leap, often referred to as an arm jump, is a challenging maneuver that involves jumping over a gap that exceeds head height. This requires significant upward force, as the trajectory of the jump is focused on height rather than distance. It’s essential for the performer to reach out at full height to successfully grab onto a ledge or surface.\r\n\r\nPracticing technical aspects of the jump enhances proficiency. This includes mastering the technique of one-handed grabs, which can be crucial for maintaining grip if the jump isn\'t successful. A solid understanding of executing a one-handed dead hang can serve as a valuable skill for handling unexpected slips during the jump.\r\n\r\nPerforming the upward cat leap demands dedication and skill, and it can lead to elevated performances if done correctly. If a jumper manages to secure a grip with one hand, they can increase their chances of climbing further. However, the challenge lies in achieving the necessary upward trajectory rather than a horizontal leap.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The upward cat leap requires significant upward force and precision to reach surfaces higher than head height.\r\n2. Technical training, especially in one-handed grabs, is critical for success and safety during the jump.\r\n3. Mastering this maneuver can enhance performance and lead to greater climbing capabilities when executed well.'),(29946,55254,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(29947,55254,'svg_id',''),(29948,55254,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(29949,55254,'svg_colour',''),(29950,55254,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(29951,55254,'extra_variables',''),(29952,55254,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(29953,55254,'notes',''),(29954,55254,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(29955,55254,'enable_youtube_api',''),(29956,55254,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(29957,55254,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(29958,55254,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(29959,55254,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(29960,55254,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(29961,55254,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(29962,55254,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(29963,55254,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(29964,55254,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(29965,55254,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(29966,55254,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(29967,55254,'enable_transcript',''),(29968,55254,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(29969,55254,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(29970,55254,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(29971,55254,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(299