rkour\">https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour</a><br />\r\n🔸 contact@localhost:8443</p>'),(31909,55270,'_video_youtube_data_description_filtered','field_672253e91cdc8'),(31910,55270,'video_chatgpt_response','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": \"{n  \"id\": \"chatcmpl-Ab9vkTeyUKoHAR37c78Lqm8HIoR59\",n  \"object\": \"chat.completion\",n  \"created\": 1733419672,n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",n  \"choices\": [n    {n      \"index\": 0,n      \"message\": {n        \"role\": \"assistant\",n        \"content\": \"London Parkour is dedicated to teaching practical movement skills and transforming individuals\' ability to think, move, and feel through the art of parkour. Their website, localhost:8443, serves as a hub for tutorials, resources, and inspiration related to parkour practice. The channel encourages newcomers and enthusiasts alike to explore the dynamic world of parkour by subscribing to their YouTube channel for informative content.nnThe organization emphasizes community engagement and offers a variety of tutorials and resources tailored for learners of all levels. Their social media presence on platforms like Instagram and YouTube helps to foster a supportive environment where practitioners can connect, share experiences, and refine their skills. London Parkour aims to make parkour accessible and enjoyable for everyone while promoting a healthy lifestyle and positive mindset.nnThe overarching goal of London Parkour is not just to teach movements but to instill a sense of confidence and creativity in practitioners. By emphasizing the physical and mental benefits of parkour, they hope to inspire individuals to embrace challenge and discover new ways to engage with their environment. With a focus on transformation and personal growth, London Parkour welcomes everyone to join and explore the exciting possibilities within this unique discipline.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n 