ouTube channel for informative content.\r\n\r\nThe organization emphasizes community engagement and offers a variety of tutorials and resources tailored for learners of all levels. Their social media presence on platforms like Instagram and YouTube helps to foster a supportive environment where practitioners can connect, share experiences, and refine their skills. London Parkour aims to make parkour accessible and enjoyable for everyone while promoting a healthy lifestyle and positive mindset.\r\n\r\nThe overarching goal of London Parkour is not just to teach movements but to instill a sense of confidence and creativity in practitioners. By emphasizing the physical and mental benefits of parkour, they hope to inspire individuals to embrace challenge and discover new ways to engage with their environment. With a focus on transformation and personal growth, London Parkour welcomes everyone to join and explore the exciting possibilities within this unique discipline.'),(31913,55270,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(31914,55270,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"let\'s take a look at what we call the\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"double tap now this is quite a unique\",\r\n        \"start\": 8.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.16\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"situation A Unique position here uh most\",\r\n        \"start\": 12,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.72\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"people wouldn\'t come across this uh the\",\r\n        \"start\": 14.839,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.001\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"rail to the rail but I wanted to use\",\r\n        \"start\": 17.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.44\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"this so you could see the front of me as\",\r\n        \"start\": 20.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.679\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"well generally a dou