eir activities, showcasing the transformative potential of parkour in everyday life.nnThe organization actively maintains a presence on various social media platforms, including Instagram and YouTube, where they share instructional videos and parkour-related content. Their YouTube channel features a range of parkour tutorials that cater to different skill levels, making it easier for individuals to learn at their own pace while engaging with a wider community of like-minded practitioners. The emphasis on practical movement reflects their commitment to making parkour accessible and enjoyable for everyone.nnFor those interested in further involvement or inquiries, London Parkour provides contact information through their website and social media channels. They invite followers and curious individuals to subscribe and stay updated on their latest offerings while promoting a supportive and inclusive atmosphere for learning and practicing parkour.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 222,n    \"total_tokens\": 454,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"pjXm8lZT7jxyo2Q5IccflEMG8.D1vZ8N3Hb0i5I_gjM-1733419193-1.0.1.1-XrFZ9M0DNWPkmTIKNO0prDhVta9HTHxnEeWVM5UTDmd9ndgZJ7wSWfqRkHh5etfCY7ZOYjgHjPyvbIetPGJVdQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733420993,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n    