ef=\"https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour\">https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour</a><br />\r\n🔸 contact@localhost:8443</p>'),(32408,55275,'_video_youtube_data_description_filtered','field_672253e91cdc8'),(32409,55275,'video_chatgpt_response','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": \"{n  \"id\": \"chatcmpl-Ab9ovpLfRdfs5GEPzvvp3Pwev4aG6\",n  \"object\": \"chat.completion\",n  \"created\": 1733419249,n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",n  \"choices\": [n    {n      \"index\": 0,n      \"message\": {n        \"role\": \"assistant\",n        \"content\": \"London Parkour is a dedicated platform that offers a range of resources and tutorials for individuals interested in the sport of parkour. The website, www.localhost:8443, serves as a comprehensive guide to practical movement, aiming to transform how participants think, move, and feel. By providing valuable information and training materials, it helps enthusiasts of all skill levels learn and enhance their parkour techniques.nnThe community is encouraged to engage with London Parkour through various online platforms. They can subscribe to their YouTube channel for parkour tutorials and related content, as well as follow the Instagram account for updates and inspiration. The goal is to foster a supportive and interactive environment for those looking to improve their parkour skills and connect with others who share the same passion.nnFor anyone looking to delve deeper into parkour, the website and associated social media channels offer numerous opportunities for learning and growth. By providing practical insights and community support, London Parkour aims to inspire individuals to embrace this dynamic form of movement and challenge themselves in new ways.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 206,n    \"total_tokens\": 438,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Xu86j8A0IRryVS176fE0.7Bvm0U1DaU7Szi5g8rdR9U-1733419253-1.0.1.1-tM8QFdKawz2_54WnMxCzfOoigije.Z1MkvHx5EWEAN67B3x1pG4Fd2_cBELWXncyRnxuwwvc1JueTmGVKLOU8g\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733421053,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \".Fox4lf2H3VCy3ZZhPGHSGAgZAG1WIE_XpN7UcthIQ4-1733419253901-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(32410,55275,'_video_chatgpt_response','field_67221dc82655d'),(32411,55275,'video_chatgpt_response_text','London Parkour is a dedicated platform that offers a range of resources and tutorials for individuals interested in the sport of parkour. The website, www.localhost:8443, serves as a comprehensive guide to practical movement, aiming to transform how participants think, move, and feel. By providing valuable information and training materials, it helps enthusiasts of all skill levels learn and enhance their parkour techniques.\r\n\r\nThe community is encouraged to engage with London Parkour through various online platforms. They can subscribe to their YouTube channel for parkour tutorials and related content, as well as follow the Instagram account for updates and inspiration. The goal is to foster a supportive and interactive environment for those looking to improve their parkour skills and connect with others who share the same passion.\r\n\r\nFor anyone looking to delve deeper into parkour, the website and associated social media channels offer numerous opportunities for learning and growth. By providing practical insights and community support, London Parkour aims to inspire individuals to embrace this dynamic form of movement and challenge themselves in new ways.'),(32412,55275,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(32413,55275,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"all right this is a slightly different\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 5\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"way of going up a parallel wall and this\",\r\n        \"start\": 6.879,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"is instead of being uh back to the wall\",\r\n        \"start\": 10.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.56\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"we\'re going to be split between the two\",\r\n        \"start\": 13.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.56\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so this is sort of more of a starfish\",\r\n        \"start\": 16.8,\r\n        \"duration\": 6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"shape and one hand one foot one hand one\",\r\n        \"start\": 19.279,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.721\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"foot and\",\r\n        \"start\": 22.8,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.879\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"sometimes the wall is a bit too narrow\",\r\n        \"start\": 26,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.8\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to do this it\'s you need a little bit\",\r\n        \"start\": 29.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.56\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"leverage with your shoulders and your\",\r\n        \"start\": 31.8,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.2\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"arms but if you find the right Gap um\",\r\n        \"start\": 33.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 8\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"yeah it\'s it\'s not too too bad to climb\",\r\n        \"start\": 39,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.079\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"up again you\'re shifting hands do the\",\r\n        \"start\": 41.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.521\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"work then feet do the work hands do the\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.079,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"work so I\'m going to get up my hands are\",\r\n        \"start\": 45.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.119\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to kind of create tension as I\",\r\n        \"start\": 47.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.919\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"jump and then push my feet into the\",\r\n        \"start\": 50.879,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"position I\'m twisted a little bit so I\",\r\n        \"start\": 53.879,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"can get the soles of my feet on and now\",\r\n        \"start\": 55.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.121\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"my feet are doing the work I\'m pushing\",\r\n        \"start\": 57.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"up to reposition my hands feet hands\",\r\n        \"start\": 59.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.119\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"feet hands\",\r\n        \"start\": 63.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.641\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"okay and that\'s how we climb up\",\r\n        \"start\": 64.799,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.881\r\n    }\r\n]'),(32414,55275,'_