lps in building confidence and increasing proficiency in achieving the rollover smoothly.nnThe technique is framed as one that requires more understanding of body mechanics than brute strength. Effectively using the hips and keeping the knees bent to hook onto the bar streamlines the transition for climbers. As a final note, experimentation and practice are key to mastering this technique, and all that is required is access to a sturdy bar for training.nnKey Points:n1. The roll-over or pullover technique is crucial for climbers, especially for those yet to master the muscle-up.n2. Successful execution requires creating a dish shape with the body and using hip momentum to clear the legs over the bar.n3. This move emphasizes technical skill over sheer strength and demands consistent practice to perfect.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1816,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 302,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2118,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"GwlrdMxWgL16qffZd09bz7xnxXhrmBH7n7Nv4V_ILMg-1733419310-1.0.1.1-MjZjyNj840_9IHI0e7mFRNa4hTxFvPuOlAFkWmhOHHuhtCmSNQlHu5bislvIULNxrRXP812Mc7uAq3z1j_X6FQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733421110,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"1II8GogJmzfGz3.xRw9GW0L4m8aN.fNgafzhKgb.6H8-1733419310478-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(32694,55277,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(32695,55277,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion focuses on a fundamental climbing technique known as the roll-over or pullover, essential for transitioning from hanging on a bar. This technique can be particularly useful for those who have yet to achieve a muscle-up. The roll-over involves a series of steps, starting with finding a suitable bar for a dead hang, then engaging the hips effectively to facilitate the move.\r\n\r\nTo execute the roll-over, practitioners are advised to create a \"dish shape\" by pulling the belly button towards the chest while driving the hips onto the bar. This step is crucial as the hips must rise high enough to help clear the legs over the bar. Demonstrations emphasize the importance of swinging the legs and bending the knees to gain the necessary height and technique. Practicing this movement helps in building confidence and increasing proficiency in achieving the rollover smoothly.\r\n\r\nThe technique is framed as one that requires more understanding of body mechanics than brute strength. Effectively using the hips and keeping the knees bent to hook onto the bar streamlines the transition for climbers. As a final note, experimentation and practice are key to mastering this technique, and all that is required is access to a sturdy bar for training.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The roll-over or pullover technique is crucial for climbers, especially for those yet to master the muscle-up.\r\n2. Successful execution requires creating a dish shape with the body and using hip momentum to clear the legs over the bar.\r\n3. This move emphasizes technical skill over sheer strength and demands consistent practice to perfect.'),(32696,55277,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(32697,55277,'svg_id',''),(32698,55277,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(32699,55277,'svg_colour',''),(32700,55277,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(32701,55277,'extra_variables',''),(32702,55277,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(32703,55277,'notes',''),(32704,55277,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(32705,55277,'enable_youtube_api',''),(32706,55277,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(32707,55277,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(32708,55277,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(32709,55277,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(32710,55277,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(32711,55277,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(32712,55277,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(32713,55277,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(32714,55277,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(32715,55277,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(32716,55277,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(32717,55277,'enable_transcript',''),(32718,55277,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(32719,55277,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(32720,55277,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(32721,55277,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(32722,55277,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(32723,55277,