nt\",n        \"content\": \"London Parkour is an organization that focuses on the art of practical movement, designed to reshape an individual\'s approach to physicality and self-expression. By incorporating elements of parkour into daily life, individuals can experience transformative changes in how they think, move, and feel. The company offers various resources, tutorials, and information related to parkour practices and techniques through their website and social media channels.nnThe organization actively encourages individuals to subscribe to their YouTube channel, providing a platform for parkour enthusiasts to access tutorials, tips, and new content regularly. Their social media presence on Instagram and YouTube fosters a community where members can connect and learn from one another, helping to promote the benefits of parkour as a holistic form of movement.nnFor those interested in parkour training or seeking guidance, London Parkour offers a wealth of resources, including instructional videos and tutorials. Users can visit their website for more information, subscribe to regular updates, and engage with the parkour community through their online platforms, enhancing their understanding and practice of this dynamic movement art.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 210,n    \"total_tokens\": 442,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"7NSFNVexo