nd tips on parkour through various platforms, encouraging enthusiasts to better their skills and enjoy the benefits of this dynamic discipline.\r\n\r\nThe group maintains a presence on multiple social media channels, including Instagram and YouTube, where they post instructional videos under the tags #ParkourHowTo, #ParkourTutorial, and #ParkourPulse. These platforms serve as resources for both beginners and experienced practitioners looking to refine their techniques or learn new moves. Engaging with their content helps participants stay motivated and connected to the parkour community.\r\n\r\nFor those interested in exploring this unique form of movement, London Parkour encourages users to subscribe to their channels for the latest updates and tutorials. More information about their offerings can be found on their website, where visitors can learn about the philosophy behind parkour and how it can positively impact their lives. Whether through online tutorials or community engagement, London Parkour invites everyone to discover the transformative power of parkour.'),(33387,55284,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(33388,55284,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"building upon the perpendicular balance\",\r\n        \"start\": 6.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.239\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so once we\'ve got this position um a\",\r\n        \"start\": 10.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"good strength\",\r\n        \"start\": 14.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"exercise to work your legs is keeping\",\r\n        \"start\": 16.279,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"this position and then focusing on\",\r\n        \"start\": 20.279,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.361\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"standing\",\r\n        \"start\": 23.119,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.841\r\n    },\r\n 