eld_67224b69b74d7'),(33536,55285,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-Ab4ZkQ88WHKNVqJPpPUZ5E5YAtn8m\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1733399088,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The crouch walk on a rail is primarily a training technique rather than something typically incorporated in practical scenarios. It emphasizes the need for more mobility as it requires the individual to maneuver while maintaining balance on the rail. This technique is not commonly used, but it serves as an excellent exercise for developing essential skills related to balance and stability.nnExecuting a crouch walk involves walking in a low position with both feet on the rail, which presents a unique challenge as only two limbs are used for balance. This method does demand considerable effort, particularly in maintaining stability while maneuvering the body. It is essential to focus on adjusting one\'s posture and utilizing the arms effectively, as the balance shifts from the typical three-limb support to relying heavily on two limbs.nnCrouch walking can be quite demanding and will strengthen one\'s technique over time if practiced with patience. It is advised to proceed slowly with the movements and to be conscious of how the body transitions throughout the exercise. The crouch walk is a beneficial training method that, while challenging, enhances mobility and balance skills effectively.nnKey points:nn1. The crouch walk on a rail is a challenging training technique focused on enhancing mobility and balance.n2. It requires the individual to operate with only two limbs for stability, making it a unique exercise that demands effort.n3. Practicing this technique should be done slowly and with attention to movement transitions to develop strength and skill.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1014,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 282,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1296,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"xHZFuG0qzL_H1L7fTUjvMZ_qUO4NqEnxxxXkOdlWGLA-1733399091-1.0.1.1-uSfqs3Qbj1mxp71jLW5UJy0IF9yC_zplRcVlehn9Z95q222Ea3LJbIAHb21nJEonmckJECs5_TGguGroD2YmsQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733400891,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"LS9.NXpHzMBRyEMrsLqsL1G5R74Tqqu3Qtzvd.L78DI-1733399091411-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(33537,55285,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(33538,55285,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The crouch walk on a rail is primarily a training technique rather than something typically incorporated in practical scenarios. It emphasizes the need for more mobility as it requires the individual to maneuver while maintaining balance on the rail. This technique is not commonly used, but it serves as an excellent exercise for developing essential skills related to balance and stability.\r\n\r\nExecuting a crouch walk involves walking in a low position with both feet on the rail, which presents a unique challenge as only two limbs are used for balance. This method does demand considerable effort, particularly in maintaining stability while maneuvering the body. It is essential to focus on adjusting one\'s posture and utilizing the arms effectively, as the balance shifts from the typical three-limb support to relying heavily on two limbs.\r\n\r\nCrouch walking can be quite demanding and will strengthen one\'s technique over time if practiced with patience. It is advised to proceed slowly with the movements and to be conscious of how the body transitions throughout the exercise. The crouch walk is a beneficial training method that, while challenging, enhances mobility and balance skills effectively.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n\r\n1. The crouch walk on a rail is a challenging training technique focused on enhancing mobility and balance.\r\n2. It requires the individual to operate with only two limbs for stability, making it a unique exercise that demands effort.\r\n3. Practicing this technique should be done slowly and with attention to movement transitions to develop strength and skill.'),(33539,55285,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(33540,55285,'svg_id',''),(33541,55285,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(33542,55285,'svg_colour',''),(33543,55285,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(33544,55285,'extra_variables',''),(33545,55285,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(33546,55285,'notes',''),(335