 techniques. nnThe organization actively engages users through various social media channels, including Instagram and YouTube, where they provide video content related to parkour tutorials and demonstrations. The YouTube channel, which invites subscriptions, features a range of instructional videos under hashtags like #ParkourHowTo and #ParkourTutorial, promoting a vibrant community of parkour enthusiasts and learners.nnFor further interaction and inquiries, London Parkour encourages users to connect via their email contact@localhost:8443. The mix of practical resources and an emphasis on community interactions positions London Parkour as a key destination for anyone interested in exploring the art of parkour.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 197,n    \"total_tokens\": 429,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ogl9EFUENtmx9BRzg.jojsomoH90cicoKtRP.XHxPoA-1733399113-1.0.1.1-4qiIgkRnNuQ4j1Yrds1BHSJ9irr.NMvRwdxSxXSu_afbqPHWx5Us421.Gn.jbSsCJRNZa4HjzqPkxBShNtUpig\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733400913,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"XnMg2FwErqJp4qqeURlu309O2pNELO5OPjSO2HR.y4k-1733399113505-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\