ance demands strength from the hips, abs, and deltoids, making it a physically demanding practice. The encouragement to explore these movements while maintaining balance illustrates the dual emphasis on fitness and fun in this exercise. Trying out various positions and movements can ultimately build proficiency and enhance overall balance skills.nnKey Points:n1. The cat balance exercise promotes core control and requires mindful hip positioning to minimize the risk of falling.n2. Different techniques can be employed, such as maintaining knee height above the bar and using quadrapedal movements for effective balance.n3. The exercise is physically demanding, engaging multiple muscle groups and encouraging participants to explore and improve their balance skills.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2037,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 298,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2335,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"RtLyHF5NZ9p1sp3Abp3ZdBnlzMs_xIWKZxSyh82n7sc-1733399118-1.0.1.1-T_qh4KUscBD.Jg8UM2i3oJugdCVRDBySWCOcPeEahfZqKK7PTGg7AA7caaXDRrqal74x0T8reQKceWAcjMx6Ww\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733400918,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"lM7Nlzl0TPXHWZWCY33g9suMLZysXKzvJQIwSTPalT8-1733399118889-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(33677,55286,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(33678,55286,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The concept of the cat balance exercise is introduced as a valuable activity focused on core control and body alignment. The exercise also emphasizes the significance of hip positioning, with advice to avoid being bunched up, as this increases the risk of falling. The exercise not only develops physical stability but also challenges various muscle groups, making it a comprehensive workout for both balance and strength.\r\n\r\nExecution begins with the individual securing a proper grip and placing one foot on the balance surface. From this position, they can transition to various movements, reinforcing the importance of distributing weight effectively. The two main techniques for maintaining balance—keeping knees above the bar and using a quadrapedal movement—are discussed in detail, offering different pathways for individuals to gauge their comfort and skill levels while ensuring a smooth movement pattern.\r\n\r\nAs the exercise continues, participants are reminded that the cat balance demands strength from the hips, abs, and deltoids, making it a physically demanding practice. The encouragement to explore these movements while maintaining balance illustrates the dual emphasis on fitness and fun in this exercise. Trying out various positions and movements can ultimately build proficiency and enhance overall balance skills.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The cat balance exercise promotes core control and requires mindful hip positioning to minimize the risk of falling.\r\n2. Different techniques can be employed, such as maintaining knee height above the bar and using quadrapedal movements for effective balance.\r\n3. The exercise is physically demanding, engaging multiple muscle groups and encouraging participants to explore and improve their balance skills.'),(33679,55286,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(33680,55286,'svg_id',''),(33681,55286,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(33682,55286,'svg_colour',''),(33683,55286,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(33684,55286,'extra_variables',''),(33685,55286,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(33686,55286,'notes',''),(33687,55286,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(33688,55286,'enable_youtube_api',''),(33689,55286,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(33690,55286,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(33691,55286,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(33692,55286,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(33693,55286,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(33694,55286,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(33695,55286,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(33696,55286,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(33697,55286,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(33698,55286,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(33699,55286,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(33700,55286,'enable_transcript',''),(33701,55286,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(33702,55286,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(33703,55286,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(33704,55286,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like