ng cat passes and vaults.\r\n2. Increasing the spatial distance between hands and feet during the exercise facilitates smoother transitions and improves technique.\r\n3. Mastery of this movement can positively impact various physical skills, emphasizing strength, coordination, and body awareness.'),(35084,55301,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(35085,55301,'svg_id',''),(35086,55301,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(35087,55301,'svg_colour',''),(35088,55301,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(35089,55301,'extra_variables',''),(35090,55301,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(35091,55301,'notes',''),(35092,55301,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(35093,55301,'enable_youtube_api',''),(35094,55301,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(35095,55301,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(35096,55301,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(35097,55301,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(35098,55301,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(35099,55301,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(35100,55301,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(35101,55301,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(35102,55301,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(35103,55301,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(35104,55301,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(35105,55301,'enable_transcript',''),(35106,55301,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(35107,55301,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(35108,55301,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(35109,55301,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(35110,55301,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(35111,55301,'rank_math_seo_score','20'),(35112,55301,'video_filename','Crawling-QM/Tutorial-Crawling-QM_2-Floor-Kong.mp4'),(35113,55301,'_vid