egs and torso remain aligned. These movements mimic traditional warm-up exercises, helping to prepare the body for more intense physical activities.nnAdditionally, this method emphasizes the importance of training muscle groups that may not typically be engaged in standard warm-up routines. The focus on inverse muscle engagement not only diversifies exercise regimens but also enhances overall muscle functionality and strength. It’s a valuable addition to anyone\'s workout routine, enhancing flexibility and reducing the likelihood of injury during more strenuous activities.nnKey points:n1. The inverted table technique effectively engages glutes and hamstrings while reducing muscle fatigue during warm-ups.n2. Proper alignment and core contraction are essential for executing the technique safely and effectively.n3. This method introduces a diverse range of muscle engagement that can improve overall functionality and strength.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1452,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 300,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1752,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"_T6EMTyVRzVuD_CNQx11cf7D9lFiP07IasaKk2pUHdg-1733400282-1.0.1.1-iAzNTlwo6BfNaCn6J9H1_jDe6aidAx4OZMsV0cShDdnagzK2DaxpcZ5kjdqDs.aOzeyK4jo.BDKKE.C0xmIHpQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733402082,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Xwxa8z8VSHbe9wc.xf7DDnjqQHgMdHTz3b87JsaGXnQ-1733400282727-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(35344,55303,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(35345,55303,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The inverted table technique is an effective method for engaging the glutes and hamstrings, particularly beneficial during warm-ups. By adopting a position that opens up the chest and relieves tension in the deltoids, individuals can perform exercises without aggravating muscle fatigue. This technique not only allows for continued movement but also helps alleviate the discomfort associated with other conventional exercises, focusing primarily on keeping the glutes and hamstrings active and contracted.\r\n\r\nTo properly execute the inverted table technique, it\'s crucial to maintain a straight alignment of the quads and abdomen. This position involves the hands placed behind the body and legs extended in front while contracting the core to create stability. Once in this position, participants can perform alternate limb movements, ensuring that the legs and torso remain aligned. These movements mimic traditional warm-up exercises, helping to prepare the body for more intense physical activities.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this method emphasizes the importance of training muscle groups that may not typically be engaged in standard warm-up routines. The focus on inverse muscle engagement not only diversifies exercise regimens but also enhances overall muscle functionality and strength. It’s a valuable addition to anyone\'s workout routine, enhancing flexibility and reducing the likelihood of injury during more strenuous activities.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The inverted table technique effectively engages glutes and hamstrings while reducing muscle fatigue during warm-ups.\r\n2. Proper alignment and core contraction are essential for executing the technique safely and effectively.\r\n3. This method introduces a diverse range of muscle engagement that can improve overall functionality and strength.'),(35346,55303,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(35347,55303,'svg_id',''),(35348,55303,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(35349,55303,'svg_colour',''),(35350,55303,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(35351,55303,'extra_variables',''),(35352,55303,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(35353,55303,'notes',''),(35354,55303,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(35355,55303,'enable_youtube_api',''),(35356,55303,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(35357,55303,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(35358,55303,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(35359,55303,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(35360,55303,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(35361,55303,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(35362,55303,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(35363,55303,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(35364,55303,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(35365,55303,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(35366,55303,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(35367,55303,'enable_transcript',''),(35368,55303,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(35369,55303,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(35370,55303,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(35