 stress on the joints. Frequent repetitions can intensify the workout, making it an advantageous choice prior to more strenuous activities.nnThe sequence of movements includes transitioning from hands together to feet spread apart and then reversing the position. It\'s encouraged to maintain proper form throughout, ensuring that the hands stay together while pushing the body into the desired positions. Participants are urged to give the exercise a try to appreciate its benefits fully.nnKey points:n1. The frog position is an easier variation of the Kong exercise, emphasizing hands inside and feet outside.n2. This position serves as an effective warm-up that engages the legs without high impact.n3. Proper technique is essential, with a focus on maintaining hand placement while transitioning between movements.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1023,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 245,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1268,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"x2u6tMhUDVEwyewBaq8kZfhU7goSW94N3vquPbuFuXY-1733400305-1.0.1.1-6A2i.Dc6ZQrT7LItGkhC3GM2OQiFM_uL5z.FqIKEPCI9hpPTByd_69h_OWYwXKtepYl2KHxPTruiyZBySbjegg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733402105,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"YrKaQI2MTfQKEYJ05.fwqVu8hmFuhTnWQBUD2AE2yfM-1733400305579-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(35463,55304,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(35464,55304,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The frog position is introduced as a variation of the Kong exercise, designed to be slightly easier. In the frog position, the hands are placed on the inside while the feet rest on the outside, contrasting with the traditional Kong where feet are positioned inside and hands outside. This open stance allows for better movement while still engaging the legs and core muscles significantly.\r\n\r\nPracticing the frog position is a beneficial warm-up exercise due to its low impact yet effective nature in warming up the body. It focuses on leg development while minimizing stress on the joints. Frequent repetitions can intensify the workout, making it an advantageous choice prior to more strenuous activities.\r\n\r\nThe sequence of movements includes transitioning from hands together to feet spread apart and then reversing the position. It\'s encouraged to maintain proper form throughout, ensuring that the hands stay together while pushing the body into the desired positions. Participants are urged to give the exercise a try to appreciate its benefits fully.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The frog position is an easier variation of the Kong exercise, emphasizing hands inside and feet outside.\r\n2. T