ping palm spins and a range of other twisting movements. By focusing on the mechanics of the one-handed twist, participants can cultivate greater control over their body weight and increase their proficiency in performing complex movements. The recommendation is to give this unique exercise a try for a comprehensive workout experience.nn**Key Points:**n1. The one-handed ground twist is a variation of the Kong movement, focusing on controlled rotations and coordination using one hand.n2. Practitioners can practice the movement both forwards and backwards to enhance balance and body awareness.n3. This exercise is beneficial for developing skills related to palm spins and improving proficiency in advanced maneuvers involving weight support on one hand.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1207,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 301,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1508,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"8rkquS2pn53AwgLGp5pp74rLFD4zRJJl9IZfXZSwXtc-1733400349-1.0.1.1-HXe.MrSF5i61g2IjsgFnwFBTy0lbM792mb_1CWjW4NQBff3BtpIiGXoX3VZIVmUztnX8Eri1WsD87N8yaQDfUQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733402149,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"dom