hensive workout experience.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The one-handed ground twist is a variation of the Kong movement, focusing on controlled rotations and coordination using one hand.\r\n2. Practitioners can practice the movement both forwards and backwards to enhance balance and body awareness.\r\n3. This exercise is beneficial for developing skills related to palm spins and improving proficiency in advanced maneuvers involving weight support on one hand.'),(35604,55305,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(35605,55305,'svg_id',''),(35606,55305,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(35607,55305,'svg_colour',''),(35608,55305,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(35609,55305,'extra_variables',''),(35610,55305,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(35611,55305,'notes',''),(35612,55305,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(35613,55305,'enable_youtube_api',''),(35614,55305,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(35615,55305,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(35616,55305,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(35617,55305,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(35618,55305,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(35619,55305,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(35620,55305,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(35621,55305,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(35622,55305,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(35623,55305,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(35624,55305,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(35625,55305,'enable_transcript',''),(35626,55305,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(35627,55305,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(35628,55305,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(35629,55305,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(35630,55305,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt