hape with the body. This movement emphasizes the importance of hip hinging, where the upper body bends forward while keeping the legs as straight as possible. The sequence involves alternating movements of the hands and feet, giving a solid focus on body mechanics and engagement.nnAs participants practice the hinge, they can expect to feel a stretch in their hamstrings due to the position they hold. Locking their knees helps to enhance this stretch, contributing to improved flexibility. This exercise is also beneficial in building awareness of upper body pressure, which is essential for performing tasks such as vaults and cat passes where torso positioning is crucial.nnIncorporating the hinge into training routines can greatly enhance overall movement quality and body control. It\'s a simple yet effective exercise to develop strength and flexibility while preparing the body for more complex movements. With proper execution and repetition, one can greatly benefit from the hinge\'s application in various physical activities and training.nnKey Points:n1. The hinge exercise is a basic movement focusing on coordinating upper and lower body while maintaining a V-shape.n2. It enhances hamstring flexibility and helps build awareness for upper body positioning in various physical activities.n3. Regular practice can improve overall movement quality and body control, making it beneficial for advanced training.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 973,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 269,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1242,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"bdTHs3Kdtcs7VJzINIrHrh6GCbWLquGdfVJYd_U8bwA-1735745223-1.0.1.1-nmoT_C4QAuisvI.l35VBJuRkMI1.WHfMnre62MAke1Po7Jvmp.xHAzhu7I9fcqklugQIqiTEuVBPaovaXKnJ1A\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735747023,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"lwpDAfhJeuslsnFqy6Vis_IB50AYEyPNSsUAqNTlx1s-1735745223655-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(35736,55306,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(35737,55306,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The hinge exercise is introduced as a fundamental movement where the arms and legs coordinate to create a V-shape with the body. This movement emphasizes the importance of hip hinging, where the upper body bends forward while keeping the legs as straight as possible. The sequence involves alternating movements of the hands and feet, giving a solid focus on body mechanics and engagement.\r\n\r\nAs participants practice the hinge, they can expect to feel a stretch in their hamstrings due to the position they hold. Locking their knees helps to enhance this stretch, contributing to improved flexibility. This exercise is also beneficial in building awareness of upper body pressure, which is essential for performing tasks such as vaults and cat passes where torso positioning is crucial.\r\n\r\nIncorporating the hinge into training routines can greatly enhance overall movement quality and body control. It\'s a simple yet effective exercise to develop strength and flexibility while preparing the body for more complex movements. With proper execution and repetition, one can greatly benefit from the hinge\'s application in various physical activities and training.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The hinge exercise is a basic movement focusing on coordinating upper and lower body while maintaining a V-shape.\r\n2. It enhances hamstring flexibility and helps build awareness for upper body positioning in various physical activities.\r\n3. Regular practice can improve overall movement quality and body control, making it beneficial for advanced training.'),(35738,55306,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(35739,55306,'svg_id',''),(35740,55306,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(35741,55306,'svg_colour',''),(35742,55306,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(35743,55306,'extra_variables',''),(35744,55306,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(35745,55306,'notes',''),(35746,55306,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(35747,55306,'enable_youtube_api',''),(35748,55306,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(35749,55306,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(35750,55306,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(35751,55306,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(35752,55306,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(35753,55306,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(35754,55306,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(35755,55306,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(35756,55306,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(35757,55306,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(35758,55306,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','fiel