 \"start\": 10.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.281\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"qm monkey walk uh position because\",\r\n        \"start\": 13.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.799\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you\'re going to be turning\",\r\n        \"start\": 16.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.92\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"45° and you\'re sort of pulling you\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 19.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.601\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Galloping and it\'s going to be much\",\r\n        \"start\": 21.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.839\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"faster than a normal uh monkey\",\r\n        \"start\": 23.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.559\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"walk so to begin with I\'m going to crou\",\r\n        \"start\": 26.599,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.12\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"down and I\'m going to my left so instead\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.199,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.441\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"of being face on\",\r\n        \"start\": 32.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"45° my right hand left hand is going to\",\r\n        \"start\": 35.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.079\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"drop and then my legs are going to join\",\r\n        \"start\": 38.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so hand hand foot hand hand foot foot so\",\r\n        \"start\": 40.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.401\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"from here it\'ll be hand hand\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.079,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"foot okay so this is different from the\",\r\n        \"start\": 47.12,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.119\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the monkey walking where it\'s this now\",\r\n        \"start\": 50.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"we\'re coming up a little bit our torso\",\r\n        \"start\": 55.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.361\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"is a bit higher and we\'re hopping\",\r\n        \"start\": 57.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.959\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"through um by putting all our weight on\",\r\n        \"start\": 60.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"our hands and then our feet so 1 2 3 4 1\",\r\n        \"start\": 63.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 10.24\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"2 3 4 and as you get used to that you\",\r\n        \"start\": 68.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 9.479\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"can go quite fast so from\",\r\n        \"start\": 73.479,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.081\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"here could be much quicker than the the\",\r\n        \"start\": 77.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.4\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"normal monkey walk uh yeah give it a go\",\r\n        \"start\": 80.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.44\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"make sure you do both sides left and\",\r\n        \"start\": 83.159,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.801\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"right um have a play\",\r\n        \"start\": 85,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.96\r\n    }\r\n]'),(35879,55307,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(35880,55307,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000\r\n[Music]\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000\r\nnext up is the gorilla run type qm and\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000\r\nthis is slightly different from a normal\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000\r\nqm monkey walk uh position because\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000\r\nyou\'re going to be turning\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000\r\n45° and you\'re sort of pulling you\'re\r\n\r\