ded by the knees while the process is executed smoothly and at a faster pace. Achieving comfort and safety during the maneuver leads to increased confidence and skill proficiency as one develops their technique.nn**Key Points:**n1. Mastering the underbar technique requires proper hand positioning and a smooth stepping-through movement.n2. Emphasis should be placed on driving through with the knees to enhance balance and minimize the risk of injury.n3. Consistent practice on both sides is essential for developing skill versatility and confidence in executing the maneuver.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1295,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 302,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1597,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"NVvBzwaFTd2kdQF6tjNCBFQtC2U35hMOxV4vddW8owo-1735744990-1.0.1.1-BEYy9tttK9iRzD5kfsqvjFfne.F91AVL5AjQkMQwXPbZMN.WI16Au8R5dSdzuoxDE9D14lrPA_IhXLnbw2ICtg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746790,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"O9MCUA1pHAZ3IUm3pyWexD_cX7E_XKIgIYOcjmnxAN0-1735744990301-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(36455,55311,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(36456,55311,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion focuses on mastering the technique of the underbar, particularly emphasizing the importance of body positioning and movement mechanics. The sequence begins with the basic grip configuration, where one hand is placed under and the other over, and involves stepping through while maintaining balance and fluidity. The technique is further refined by increasing speed and ensuring a smooth transition through the movements, completing the maneuver without abrupt stops or jerks.\r\n\r\nAs the execution progresses, the emphasis shifts to maintaining momentum by driving through with the knees rather than relying on the heels, which can result in misalignment and hindered movement. Practicing the knee drive is crucial, as elevating the position of the knee enhances confidence in the maneuver and minimizes the risk of injury. The discussion further illustrates the importance of practicing both sides to develop versatility and adaptability while executing the underbar technique effectively.\r\n\r\nUltimately, mastering the Turning underbar involves consistent practice and an understanding of key mechanics. The focus is placed on body awareness, ensuring that movements are guided by the knees while the process is executed smoothly and at a faster pace. Achieving comfort and safety during the maneuver leads to increased confidence and skill proficiency as one develops their technique.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. Mastering the underbar technique requires proper hand positioning and a smooth stepping-through movement.\r\n2. Emphasis should be placed on driving through with the knees to enhance balance and minimize the risk of injury.\r\n3. Consistent practice on both sides is essential for developing skill versatility and confidence in executing the maneuver.'),(36457,55311,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(36458,55311,'svg_id',''),(36459,55311,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(36460,55311,'svg_colour',''),(36461,55311,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(36462,55311,'extra_variables',''),(36463,55311,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(36464,55311,'notes',''),(36465,55311,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(36466,55311,'enable_youtube_api',''),(36467,55311,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(36468,55311,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(36469,55311,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(36470,55311,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(36471,55311,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(36472,55311,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(36473,55311,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(36474,55311,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(36475,55311,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(36476,55311,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(36477,55311,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(36478,55311,'enable_transcript',''),(36479,55311,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(36480,55311,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(36481,55311,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(36482,55311,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(36483,55311,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(36484,55311,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(36485,55311,'video_filename','Passing-Und