going to keep your\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000\r\nhands on the bar jump up and then get\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000\r\nyour feet straight through both at the\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000\r\nsame time now you can start with your\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000\r\ntoes on the bottom bar so from up here\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000\r\nand down on here notice I\'m going up\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000\r\nfirst and then coming down and then you\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000\r\ncan do there to the heel and then as you\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000\r\nfeel more comfortable up and then drive\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000\r\nthrough and under and that\'s the pike so\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000\r\nyou can build up to it it\'s scary cuz\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000\r\nyou feel like you\'re going to whack your\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000\r\nknee but the higher you go the easier\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000\r\nyou\'ll be able to thread through and do\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:61,000 --> 00:01:04,000\r\nthat Pike\r\n\r\n'),(36769,55313,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(36770,55313,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AkuqXaGUEl2fWRWntkirgBBaww8kE\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744969,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The pike underbar is a specific movement that involves keeping both legs straight while driving through with the heels. To execute the pike correctly, it is essential to elevate the hips high before attempting the maneuver. The process begins with the hands gripping the bar and then jumping up while ensuring that the feet are positioned straight through the bar simultaneously.nnStarting the pike with the toes touching the bottom bar is a useful technique. One should focus on rising first before letting the legs descend. As comfort increases, one can transition to driving the legs up and through under the bar. The pike move can be intimidating at first, as there might be a concern about hitting the knees, but increasing the height of the jump can facilitate a smoother execution of the move.nnOverall, mastering the pike underbar requires practice and patience. While it may seem daunting, gaining confidence in the technique will improve performance significantly. The key is to start low, get comfortable, and gradually work towards higher and more fluid movements.nnKey Points:n1. The pike underbar requires straight legs and high hips for effective execution.n2. Practicing from a lower height and gradually increasing the jump makes the movement easier.n3. Confidence in technique will improve performance and ease fears of injury during the move.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 804,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 256,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1060,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"9y7tlZOOQDr3gOI0YglD9JnlqH6qigs5FD5HXD.eyg8-1735744973-1.0.1.1-a9J_DBxyVj_TPbVjYcjFL1ImqbpYf6pOqitq6XNdFeAh8P2OMA2gUu5C2EZ5Yy0JKkPaKNhC6WWUsQ_t_AU5Zw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746773,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \".dxdQeDAQBupdUCwNdQhjSQipavCYHfL4DLilgTZ2KY-1735744973515-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(36771,55313,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(36772,55313,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The pike underbar is a specific movement that involves keeping both legs straight while driving through with the heels. To execute the pike correctly, it is essential to elevate the hips high before attempting the maneuver. The process begins with the hands gripping the bar and then jumping up while ensuring that the feet are positioned straight through the bar simultaneously.\r\n\r\nStarting the pike with the toes touching the bottom bar is a useful technique. One should focus on rising first before letting the legs descend. As comfort increases, one can transition to driving the legs up and through under the bar. The pike move can be intimidating at first, as there might be a concern about hitting the knees, but increasing the height of the jump can facilitate a smoother execution of the move.\r\n\r\nOverall, mastering the pike underbar requires practice and patience. While it may seem daunting, gaining confidence in the technique will improve performance significantly. The key is to start low, get comfortable, and gradually work towards higher and more fluid movements.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The pike underbar requires straight legs and high hips for effective execution.\r\n2. Practicing from a lower height and gradually increasing the jump makes the movement easier.\r\n3. Confidence in technique will improve performance and ease fears of injury during the move.'),(36773,55313,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(36774,55313,'svg_id',''),(36775,55313,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(36776,55313,'svg_colour',''),(36777,55313,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(36778,55313,'extra_variables',''),(36779,55313,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(36780,55313,'notes',''),(36781,55313,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(36782,55313,'enable_youtube_api',''),(36783,55313,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(36784,55313,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(36785,55313,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(36786,55313,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(36787,55313,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(36788,55313,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(36789,55313,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(36790,55313,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(36791,55313,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(36792,55313,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(36793,55313,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(36794,55313,'enable_transcript',''),(36795,55313,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(36796,55313,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(36797,55313,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(36798,55313,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(36799,55313,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','f