swinging. This motion helps to avoid excessive fatigue in the arms, as maintaining swings for too long can drain strength and hinder performance. It is recommended to achieve the desired height and force in swings within the first or second attempt to optimize efficiency.nnContinuous practice is essential for developing muscle memory and increasing the range of motion. Beginners should focus on building grip strength through dead hangs and gradually incorporating small leg movements to enhance the swing. Over time, they can intensify their efforts, emphasizing the elevation of their hips throughout the process to achieve maximum swing potential.nn**Key Points:**n1. Focus on engaging the hips to generate momentum and enhance swing performance rather than relying solely on the legs.n2. Achieving optimal height in swings early on helps to prevent arm fatigue and increases efficiency.n3. Consistent practice and building grip strength are vital for mastering aerial movements and refining technique.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2362,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 297,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2659,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Sat_13.0R7HXYmcOVLLCJY.Xm0JpLqAhwuMBLO9rlLY-1735744798-1.0.1.1-1We.S9oWG6rDrDS2OGH2aEw6KRw4vpaMD7L4zAqLsCxVfmbD56r2kmVxM1DV1t.2tXdvCwD.UtYpKYFWQ5JofQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746598,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"G07dDvrAf6.R_nfe.nmdMJqeT6Swq5.niPSIiy1t4.k-1735744798108-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(37512,55320,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(37513,55320,'video_transcript_chatgpt','When learning to perform aerial movements like swinging on a bar, it is crucial to understand the role of body dynamics, particularly hip engagement. Starting with basic awareness, beginners often struggle with generating enough momentum due to a lack of focus on the hips. Many tend to rely on their legs, which, while important, primarily serve to aid in driving the hips forward. The emphasis should be placed on elevating the hips to initiate and maintain the swing effectively.\r\n\r\nThe process involves beginning from a static position and utilizing a combination of leg kicks and hip movements. By driving the hips upwards, one can create initial momentum necessary for swinging. This motion helps to avoid excessive fatigue in the arms, as maintaining swings for too long can drain strength and hinder performance. It is recommended to achieve the desired height and force in swings within the first or second attempt to optimize efficiency.\r\n\r\nContinuous practice is essential for developing muscle memory and increasing the range of motion. Beginners should focus on building grip strength through dead hangs and gradually incorporating small leg movements to enhance the swing. Over time, they can intensify their efforts, emphasizing the elevation of their hips throughout the process to achieve maximum swing potential.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. Focus on engaging the hips to generate momentum and enhance swing performance rather than relying solely on the legs.\r\n2. Achieving optimal height in swings early on helps to prevent arm fatigue and increases efficiency.\r\n3. Consistent practice and building grip strength are vital for mastering aerial movements and refining technique.'),(37514,55320,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(37515,55320,'svg_id',''),(37516,55320,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(37517,55320,'svg_colour',''),(37518,55320,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(37519,55320,'extra_variables',''),(37520,55320,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(37521,55320,'notes',''),(37522,55320,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(37523,55320,'enable_youtube_api',''),(37524,55320,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(37525,55320,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(37526,55320,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(37527,55320,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(37528,55320,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(37529,55320,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(37530,55320,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(37531,55320,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(37532,55320,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(37533,55320,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(37534,55320,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(37535,55320,'enable_transcript',''),(37536,55320,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(37537,55320,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(37538,55320,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(37539,55320,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt',