ult, dismounting forward can be risky, as the body faces away from the ground, which can lead to uncontrolled landings and potential injury.nnIn contrast, dismounting during the backward swing offers a greater advantage. This phase allows for a better view of the landing spot, as the body is facing downwards and the motion tends to slow down at the apex of the swing. By timing the release and focusing on the landing during this phase, a person can dismount more safely and effectively, minimizing the risk of falling or landing awkwardly.nnPracticing the correct dismount technique can significantly reduce the chances of injury. The key is to execute the dismount when the body reaches the peak of the backward swing, ensuring control and awareness of the surroundings. This strategy not only enhances safety but also improves overall performance on the apparatus.nn**Key Points:**n1. Dismounting forward can be dangerous due to limited visibility of the landing surface and potential for falling.n2. Performing dismounts during the backward swing allows for better visibility and control.n3. Timing the dismount at the apex of the backward swing enhances safety and reduces injury risk.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2091,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 286,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2377,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"M_DoPNUllZMN_8qyGoSd7rNt_Xl3ItmNVAKs_pl53Ic-1735744786-1.0.1.1-pEHoR.qziHsZMvI0oy4SeibJnUt1m_9fDzILyoqnn7sGk8fCzP7Teo5MOy9bQdeczK7EnWyjSgMGdh6Aix2IwQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746586,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"No6R6U8YPxaffP.GyIEJ0LEeUUpSwDrw4jEjY_Lc8J8-1735744786268-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(37653,55321,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(37654,55321,'video_transcript_chatgpt','When dismounting from an apparatus, it\'s important to consider body positioning and the mechanics of movement. The initial phase, when swinging forwards, often puts the body in an upward position where visibility is limited, making it hard to gauge the landing safely. As a result, dismounting forward can be risky, as the body faces away from the ground, which can lead to uncontrolled landings and potential injury.\r\n\r\nIn contrast, dismounting during the backward swing offers a greater advantage. This phase allows for a better view of the landing spot, as the body is facing downwards and the motion tends to slow down at the apex of the swing. By timing the release and focusing on the landing during this phase, a person can dismount more safely and effectively, minimizing the risk of falling or landing awkwardly.\r\n\r\nPracticing the correct dismount technique can significantly reduce the chances of injury. The key is to execute the dismount when the body reaches the peak of the backward swing, ensuring control and awareness of the surroundings. This strategy not only enhances safety but also improves overall performance on the apparatus.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. Dismounting forward can be dangerous due to limited visibility of the landing surface and potential for falling.\r\n2. Performing dismounts during the backward swing allows for better visibility and control.\r\n3. Timing the dismount at the apex of the backward swing enhances safety and reduces injury risk.'),(37655,55321,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(37656,55321,'svg_id',''),(37657,55321,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(37658,55321,'svg_colour',''),(37659,55321,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(37660,55321,'extra_variables',''),(37661,55321,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(37662,55321,'notes',''),(37663,55321,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(37664,55321,'enable_youtube_api',''),(37665,55321,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(37666,55321,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(37667,55321,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(37668,55321,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(37669,55321,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(37670,55321,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(37671,55321,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(37672,55321,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(37673,55321,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(37674,55321,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(37675,55321,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(37676,55321,'enable_transcript',''),(37677,55321,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(37678,55321,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(37679,55321,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(37680,55321,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following tr