ance and safety during high-impact activities.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. Rolling techniques help disperse impact during falls, protecting the body from injury.\r\n2. Proper technique involves rolling diagonally from one shoulder to the opposite hip at a 45-degree angle.\r\n3. Regular practice on various surfaces is crucial for mastering the roll and ensuring safety during physical activities.'),(41004,55359,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(41005,55359,'svg_id',''),(41006,55359,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(41007,55359,'svg_colour',''),(41008,55359,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(41009,55359,'extra_variables',''),(41010,55359,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(41011,55359,'notes',''),(41012,55359,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(41013,55359,'enable_youtube_api',''),(41014,55359,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(41015,55359,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(41016,55359,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(41017,55359,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(41018,55359,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(41019,55359,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(41020,55359,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(41021,55359,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(41022,55359,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(41023,55359,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(41024,55359,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(41025,55359,'enable_transcript',''),(41026,55359,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(41027,55359,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(41028,55359,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(41029,55359,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(41030,55359,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(41031,55359,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_