ame going to go to\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000\r\nthe hands to the shoulder to the hip and\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000\r\nthen off to the foot okay so from here\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000\r\ndown around and\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000\r\nup this is going to be super useful\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000\r\nbecause when you start doing it from a\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000\r\njump or a drop you understand the the\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000\r\ntrajectory that your body is going to\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\nhave to do to then curve it along the\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\nthe floor to disperse that energy\r\n\r\n'),(41133,55360,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(41134,55360,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AkupfuSrKKmmFaux8xnekozEMSm9w\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744915,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The progression from a standing position to a crouched stance is a critical component of mastering the basic role technique. The goal is to gradually lower oneself into a roll while maintaining comfort and control throughout the movement. Starting upright, individuals are encouraged to lean forward and eventually transition to a half-crouch before completing the roll. This practice not only enhances flexibility but also builds muscle memory necessary for the subsequent execution of more complex movements.nnAs the individual moves from standing to the ground, the technique remains consistent: the hands lead along the path from the shoulders to the hips and then to the feet. This methodical approach ensures that the body forms a smooth arc as it descends, facilitating a controlled roll. Repetition of this practice will establish a solid foundation, allowing for a natural progression into advanced techniques, particularly those involving jumps or drops.nnUnderstanding the trajectory of the body during these movements is vital. As one learns to roll from dynamic positions, such as jumping, the principles of energy dispersion come into play. By mastering the roll technique from a standing and crouched position, individuals can effectively manage the forces exerted on their body, ultimately leading to safer and more proficient performance in various physical activities.nnKey Points:n1. Transitioning from standing to a crouched position is essential for mastering roll techniques.n2. Consistent practice of the roll promotes muscle memory and flexibility.n3. Learning to manage body trajectory and energy dispersion is crucial for executing advanced movements safely.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 759,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 293,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1052,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"z6gB8ObtSMwAV5LV7taEeOEAncJMKG_XKMbOKGNrNf8-1735744917-1.0.1.1-ei5oGm5Ts6OvcZ2slslX78cR56f82tssAJ3G9e_ay1dJFXmnVU.tNcjr.FJbH0.N6PsQXhn0wLuMkjRT6H3evw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746717,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"YfnGiZ6mL_Jcyj7px8Cthhbd6b3E2vdBSyX4_MpIXIk-1735744917539-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(41135,55360,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(41136,55360,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The progression from a standing position to a crouched stance is a critical component of mastering the basic role technique. The goal is to gradually lower oneself into a roll while maintaining comfort and control throughout the movement. Starting upright, individuals are encouraged to lean forward and eventually transition to a half-crouch before completing the roll. This practice not only enhances flexibility but also builds muscle memory necessary for the subsequent execution of more complex movements.\r\n\r\nAs the individual moves from standing to the ground, the technique remains consistent: the hands lead along the path from the shoulders to the hips and then to the feet. This methodical approach ensures that the body forms a smooth arc as it descends, facilitating a controlled roll. Repetition of this practice will establish a solid foundation, allowing for a natural progression into advanced techniques, particularly those involving jumps or drops.\r\n\r\nUnderstanding the trajectory of the body during these movements is vital. As one learns to roll from dynamic positions, such as jumping, the principles of energy dispersion come into play. By mastering the roll technique from a standing and crouched position, individuals can effectively manage the forces exerted on their body, ultimately leading to safer and more proficient performance in various physical activities.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Transitioning from standing to a crouched position is essential for mastering roll techniques.\r\n2. Consistent practice of the roll promotes muscle memory and flexibility.\r\n3. Learning to manage body trajectory and energy dispersion is crucial for executing advanced movements safely.'),(41137,55360,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(41138,55360,'svg_id',''),(41139,55360,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(41140,55360,'svg_colour',''),(41141,55360,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(41142,55360,'extra_variables',''),(41143,55360,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(41144,55360,'notes',''),(41145,55360,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(41146,55360,'enable_youtube_api',''),(41147,55360,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(41148,55360,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(41149,55360,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(41150,55360,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(41151,55360,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(41152,55360,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(41153,55360,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(41154,55360,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(41155,55360,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(41156,55360,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(41157,55360,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(41158,55360,'enable_transcript',''),(41159,55360,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(41160,55360,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(41161,55360,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(41162,55360,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the follo