ersion and dive rolls are essential for safely handling drops and navigating obstacles.\r\n2. Practicing rolls allows individuals to manage landings effectively, reducing potential injuries.\r\n3. Mastery of roll mechanics enhances overall performance in physically demanding activities.'),(42065,55367,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(42066,55367,'svg_id',''),(42067,55367,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(42068,55367,'svg_colour',''),(42069,55367,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(42070,55367,'extra_variables',''),(42071,55367,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(42072,55367,'notes',''),(42073,55367,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(42074,55367,'enable_youtube_api',''),(42075,55367,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(42076,55367,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(42077,55367,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(42078,55367,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(42079,55367,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(42080,55367,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(42081,55367,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(42082,55367,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(42083,55367,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(42084,55367,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(42085,55367,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(42086,55367,'enable_transcript',''),(42087,55367,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(42088,55367,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(42089,55367,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(42090,55367,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(42091,55367,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(42092,55367,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(42093,55367,'video_filename','Rolling-Rolls/Tutorial-rolling-rolls-9-dive-gap-roll.mp4'),(42094