00\r\nposition my bum is not on it\'s still\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:59,000\r\njust my hands and from here around back\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000\r\nto my right hand again so\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:60,000 --> 00:01:06,000\r\ntry that it\'s very taxing on the\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:62,000 --> 00:01:08,000\r\nshoulders and uh yeah it\'s hard to get\r\n\r\n22\r\n00:00:66,000 --> 00:01:10,000\r\nthat momentum to get around but the more\r\n\r\n23\r\n00:00:69,000 --> 00:01:13,000\r\nyou do it the more you\'ll kind of\r\n\r\n24\r\n00:00:70,000 --> 00:01:15,000\r\nunderstand how your body has to move to\r\n\r\n25\r\n00:00:73,000 --> 00:01:17,000\r\nto do it um a lot of push-ups are going\r\n\r\n26\r\n00:00:76,000 --> 00:01:19,000\r\nto help a lot of dips are going to help\r\n\r\n27\r\n00:00:77,000 --> 00:01:20,000\r\nto build up that shoulder strength but\r\n\r\n28\r\n00:00:79,000 --> 00:01:23,000\r\nyeah the waist capat\r\n\r\n29\r\n00:00:81,000 --> 00:01:27,000\r\n360 uh is kind of a fun one uh to\r\n\r\n30\r\n00:00:84,000 --> 00:01:30,000\r\npractice and put in as like a challenge\r\n\r\n31\r\n00:00:87,000 --> 00:01:30,000\r\nuh when you\'re training\r\n\r\n'),(42818,55372,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(42819,55372,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AkuoFGSpUMfZIMxfby4aaNvgfg3kW\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744827,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"A useful movement to incorporate into training routines is the waist capat 360 technique. While this technique may not see regular use, it can be beneficial in specific situations. The movement requires one to advance from a waist position and rotate the body 360 degrees, which can present some challenges due to the reliance on one hand for support and the involvement of core strength to execute the twist.nnPerforming the waist capat 360 effectively necessitates a good deal of upper body strength and coordination. The motion involves engaging the shoulders actively and manipulating weight between the hands while maintaining balance in a precarious position. Initially, it might feel difficult, but the more one practices, the better understanding they develop regarding body movement and the required mechanics. nnTo facilitate improvement in performing this movement, incorporating exercises like push-ups and dips can help build the necessary shoulder strength. The waist capat 360 can serve as an engaging challenge within training sessions, making it both a functional and enjoyable addition to one’s workout repertoire. Regular practice will ultimately lead to increased proficiency and strength in executing this technique smoothly.nnKey points:n1. The waist capat 360 is a challenging movement that can enhance training but may not be frequently utilized.n2. Mastery of the technique requires significant shoulder strength, balance, and coordination.n3. Complementary exercises like push-ups and dips can aid in building the requisite strength for the waist capat 360.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1160,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 285,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1445,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"9FpzEZPjeG6vVGFR.clxJhDPFOaskPU2kQ0c1XuNUxA-1735744831-1.0.1.1-yPf2oNCyNzrj.Vat47cZIE7KQzdqCQDSn8o2aEv7fTH8Ou7NZjAjh0hUMubQ5TlgBUmdxfQGLJ3mwqHhxp5KjQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746631,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"uKT0cHLdX88vpERlZiFUwcPGHL74_Jfaa5QBk65hlnk-1735744831245-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(42820,55372,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(42821,55372,'video_transcript_chatgpt','A useful movement to incorporate into training routines is the waist capat 360 technique. While this technique may not see regular use, it can be beneficial in specific situations. The movement requires one to advance from a waist position and rotate the body 360 degrees, which can present some challenges due to the reliance on one hand for support and the involvement of core strength to execute the twist.\r\n\r\nPerforming the waist capat 360 effectively necessitates a good deal of upper body strength and coordination. The motion involves engaging the shoulders actively and manipulating weight between the hands while maintaining balance in a precarious position. Initially, it might feel difficult, but the more one practices, the better understanding they develop regarding body movement and the required mechanics. \r\n\r\nTo facilitate improvement in performing this movement, incorporating exercises like push-ups and dips can help build the necessary shoulder strength. The waist capat 360 can serve as an engaging challenge within training sessions, making it both a functional and enjoyable addition to one’s workout repertoire. Regular practice will ultimately lead to increased proficiency and strength in executing this technique smoothly.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The waist capat 360 is a challenging movement that can enhance training but may not be frequently utilized.\r\n2. Mastery of the technique requires significant shoulder strength, balance, and coordination.\r\n3. Complementary exercises like push-ups and dips can aid in building the requisite strength for the waist capat 360.'),(42822,55372,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(42823,55372,'svg_id',''),(42824,55372,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(42825,55372,'svg_colour',''),(42826,55372,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(42827,55372,'extra_variables',''),(42828,55372,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(42829,55372,'notes',''),(42830,55372,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(42831,55372,'enable_youtube_api',''),(42832,55372,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(42833,55372,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(42834,55372,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(42835,55372,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(42836,55372,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(42837,55372,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(42838,55372,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(42839,55372,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(42840,55372,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(42841,55372,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(42842,55372,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(42843,55372,'enable_transcript',''