e wall before executing the roll. While fluidity in execution isn\'t always required, understanding the sequence will enhance mastery of this fundamental parkour skill.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The drop and roll technique is vital for safely landing from heights in parkour.\r\n2. Proper orientation through turns before landing is crucial for dispersing impact.\r\n3. Regular practice of this movement develops muscle memory and increases confidence.'),(44476,55389,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(44477,55389,'svg_id',''),(44478,55389,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(44479,55389,'svg_colour',''),(44480,55389,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(44481,55389,'extra_variables',''),(44482,55389,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(44483,55389,'notes',''),(44484,55389,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(44485,55389,'enable_youtube_api',''),(44486,55389,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(44487,55389,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(44488,55389,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(44489,55389,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(44490,55389,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(44491,55389,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(44492,55389,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(44493,55389,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(44494,55389,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(44495,55389,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(44496,55389,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(44497,55389,'enable_transcript',''),(44498,55389,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(44499,55389,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(44500,55389,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(44501,55389,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(44502,55389,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_