.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.28\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"get onto the side you know sometimes\",\r\n        \"start\": 19.88,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.559\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"that happens because you know you\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 21.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.8\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to perhaps a window sill um or a\",\r\n        \"start\": 23.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 5\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"window ledge and you know you\'re not\",\r\n        \"start\": 26.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to climb up there\'s no space to CL\",\r\n        \"start\": 28.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"climb up but a lot of the time you will\",\r\n        \"start\": 29.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.64\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"be climbing up on top of the wall after\",\r\n        \"start\": 32.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.921\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you\'ve done the arm jump so the\",\r\n        \"start\": 35.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.959\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"combination of the two is it\'s important\",\r\n        \"start\": 38.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to have practiced both um and to get it\",\r\n        \"start\": 41.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.761\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"seamless now when you do the uh climb up\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.479\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"it\'s also advantageous to use the\",\r\n        \"start\": 49.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 7\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"momentum of the cat leap to then help\",\r\n        \"start\": 52.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"push up with the leg to make the climb\",\r\n        \"start\": 56