ill levels looking to enhance their vaulting technique.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The drill helps develop hip flexor and core strength, essential for executing step vaults effectively.\r\n2. It encourages familiarity with movement mechanics through structured practice and muscle engagement.\r\n3. Incorporating the drill into warm-up routines prepares participants for more intense training sessions.'),(46084,55402,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(46085,55402,'svg_id',''),(46086,55402,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(46087,55402,'svg_colour',''),(46088,55402,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(46089,55402,'extra_variables',''),(46090,55402,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(46091,55402,'notes',''),(46092,55402,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(46093,55402,'enable_youtube_api',''),(46094,55402,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(46095,55402,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(46096,55402,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(46097,55402,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(46098,55402,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(46099,55402,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(46100,55402,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(46101,55402,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(46102,55402,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(46103,55402,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(46104,55402,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(46105,55402,'enable_transcript',''),(46106,55402,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(46107,55402,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(46108,55402,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(46109,55402,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(46110,55402,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(46111,55402,'rank_math_primary_tutoria