 strategy includes being aware of the proximity needed to execute the vault effectively, honing the skill through consistent repetition.nnUltimately, mastering the step vault entails not only physical preparation but also mental adaptability. A focus on maintaining comfort and confidence at different speeds ensures the individual can perform the move effectively, regardless of the circumstances. The key takeaway is that continuous practice leads to a better execution of the technique, enabling one to manage obstacles without rigid planning.nn**Key Points:**n1. Mastering the step vault requires progressively increasing speed while maintaining control and comfort.n2. Understanding timing, distance, and foot positioning is essential for effective execution.n3. Consistent practice allows for adaptability in varied situations, leading to improved performance.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1458,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 256,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1714,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"e4dAg__BM.sKyQoNdELtiBgBewW3sH0a0p9RY8ATiE0-1735840130-1.0.1.1-RUA5izCiUrOejv55nWE0Uz03e.s0wzvnW1EOPk4N4VXDN6x6hTgxlqMYmIc0fI0uSVdw8zZnyRHJtedT4WXuMw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735841930,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"WDMqlscrdaSVyN31cfHRueXm7dRR8qS8o2j4wIQ13xg-1735840130730-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(46322,55404,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(46323,55404,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion focuses on improving the technique for performing a step vault with an emphasis on building momentum and speed. Initially, the individual is encouraged to practice the motion at a slower pace to get accustomed to stepping and jumping. As proficiency increases, the goal transitions to executing the vault at speeds between 70% to 100%, allowing for fluid movement and a smooth landing.\r\n\r\nThe importance of understanding the timing, distance, and foot placement is highlighted. It\'s crucial to adapt to varying situations where a calculated approach may not always be feasible, emphasizing the necessity of practice and experience. The strategy includes being aware of the proximity needed to execute the vault effectively, honing the skill through consistent repetition.\r\n\r\nUltimately, mastering the step vault entails not only physical preparation but also mental adaptability. A focus on maintaining comfort and confidence at different speeds ensures the individual can perform the move effectively, regardless of the circumstances. The key takeaway is that continuous practice leads to a better execution of the technique, enabling one to manage obstacles without rigid planning.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. Mastering the step vault requires progressively increasing speed while maintaining control and comfort.\r\n2. Understanding timing, distance, and foot positioning is essential for effective execution.\r\n3. Consistent practice allows for adaptability in varied situations, leading to improved performance.'),(46324,55404,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(46325,55404,'svg_id',''),(46326,55404,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(46327,55404,'svg_colour',''),(46328,55404,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(46329,55404,'extra_variables',''),(46330,55404,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(46331,55404,'notes',''),(46332,55404,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(46333,55404,'enable_youtube_api',''),(46334,55404,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(46335,55404,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(46336,55404,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(46337,55404,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(46338,55404,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(46339,55404,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(46340,55404,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(46341,55404,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(46342,55404,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(46343,55404,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(46344,55404,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(46345,55404,'enable_transcript',''),(46346,55404,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(46347,55404,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(46348,55404,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(46349,55404,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(46350,55404,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(46351,55404,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0')