ail\r\n\r\n'),(46485,55405,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(46486,55405,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJbBdnnnrqVKykCpKiHA8VcwSWP8\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735840117,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The focus is on executing a step vault specifically using a railing as an anchor point. Typically, individuals tend to place their hands flat on top of a wall while performing this move, but this method is not optimal when it comes to stability and safety on a railing. Instead, it\'s recommended to grip the railing with the thumb positioned behind, which provides better security and prevents slipping off during the vault. It\'s emphasized that this grip aids in maintaining balance and control, allowing for a more secure execution of the technique.nnIn the execution of the step vault, mastering hand placement is critical. Both the hand and foot must be accurately positioned, with the ball of the foot making contact with the rail to help guide the body through the move. While the foot provides some level of safety, the majority of the body\'s weight and support should come from the hands. This understanding is essential for feeling comfortable and confident while performing the vault, as it shifts the focus away from reliance on the foot and toward effectively utilizing the hands.nnFinally, the practice of the step vault can be enhanced by integrating speed and refining technique. Encouragement is given to attempt the movement from different sides to develop versatility and adapt the method to different situations. By doing so, the practitioner can build confidence and improve their overall performance, ensuring a smooth execution of the step vault on a railing in various environments.nn### Key Points:n1. Proper grip on the railing is crucial for safety and control during the step vault, with thumbs positioned behind the hands to prevent slipping.n2. Accurate hand and foot placement is vital, as the majority of the support should come from the hands rather than the feet.n3. Practicing with increased speed and from different angles can enhance technique and build confidence in performing the step vault.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1282,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 352,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1634,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"0wSkBgkNUaVk3ngWtWvE.5M5rihlj85nh1v2C1GW2EU-1735840122-1.0.1.1-H_0.9_u.0l0kKnB9lWxn1EjY2ROlWhbIgAp5VxgKo5gdbkuF4P8wIqnH3DsoVr078bRkiLc4hu1DfZ0kOAylwQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735841922,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"W1f4YY8k9H0CkS4Js4vAhqbBI2siSU5z1zZ0_WAHxQ8-1735840122470-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(46487,55405,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(46488,55405,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The focus is on executing a step vault specifically using a railing as an anchor point. Typically, individuals tend to place their hands flat on top of a wall while performing this move, but this method is not optimal when it comes to stability and safety on a railing. Instead, it\'s recommended to grip the railing with the thumb positioned behind, which provides better security and prevents slipping off during the vault. It\'s emphasized that this grip aids in maintaining balance and control, allowing for a more secure execution of the technique.\r\n\r\nIn the execution of the step vault, mastering hand placement is critical. Both the hand and foot must be accurately positioned, with the ball of the foot making contact with the rail to help guide the body through the move. While the foot provides some level of safety, the majority of the body\'s weight and support should come from the hands. This understanding is essential for feeling comfortable and confident while performing the vault, as it shifts the focus away from reliance on the foot and toward effectively utilizing the hands.\r\n\r\nFinally, the practice of the step vault can be enhanced by integrating speed and refining technique. Encouragement is given to attempt the movement from different sides to develop versatility and adapt the method to different situations. By doing so, the practitioner can build confidence and improve their overall performance, ensuring a smooth execution of the step vault on a railing in various environments.\r\n\r\n### Key Points:\r\n1. Proper grip on the railing is crucial for safety and control during the step vault, with thumbs positioned behind the hands to prevent slipping.\r\n2. Accurate hand and foot placement is vital, as the majority of the support should come from the hands rather than the feet.\r\n3. Practicing with increased speed and from different angles can enhance technique and build confidence in performing the step vault.'),(46489,55405,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(46490,55405,'svg_id',''),(46491,55405,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(46492,55405,'svg_colour',''),(46493,55405,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(46494,55405,'extra_variables',''),(46495,55405,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(46496,55405,'notes',''),(46497,55405,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(46498,55405,'enable_youtube_api',''),(46499,55405,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(46500,55405,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(46501,55405,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(46502,55405,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(46503,55405,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(46504,55405,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(46505,55405,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(46506,55405,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(46507,55405,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(46508,55405,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(46509,55405,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(46510,55405,'enable_transcript',''),(46511,55405,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(46512,55405,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(46513,55405,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(46514,55405,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(46515,55405,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(46516,55405,'ra