etting the\r\n\r\n23\r\n00:00:76,000 --> 00:01:21,000\r\ntechnique and moving so you feel\r\n\r\n24\r\n00:00:79,000 --> 00:01:23,000\r\ncomfortable with being able to put the\r\n\r\n25\r\n00:00:81,000 --> 00:01:27,000\r\nfoot onto the top on top of the\r\n\r\n26\r\n00:00:84,000 --> 00:01:31,000\r\nwall the foot on top of the wall is the\r\n\r\n27\r\n00:00:88,000 --> 00:01:35,000\r\nissue because generally you\'re not going\r\n\r\n28\r\n00:00:91,000 --> 00:01:37,000\r\nto be seeing where the wall is so\r\n\r\n29\r\n00:00:95,000 --> 00:01:39,000\r\ngetting used to placing it on without\r\n\r\n30\r\n00:00:98,000 --> 00:01:45,000\r\nbeing able to see the wall is the key\r\n\r\n31\r\n00:00:100,000 --> 00:01:45,000\r\npart here give it a go see how you feel\r\n\r\n'),(46962,55409,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(46963,55409,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJ7LcK1KqB9vrN10MGbVF1kQSOHa\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735838267,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The reverse step vault is a technique that involves executing a step vault in reverse. It begins with placing one hand and one foot on a low wall, allowing the practitioner to organize their movement without needing to jump. This simplification makes the maneuver more accessible, especially for beginners. nnTo perform the reverse step vault, one should start by positioning their right hand on the wall and their left foot atop it. The focus should be on pushing the hips up while bringing the inside leg through before descending smoothly and comfortably from the wall. It’s essential to ensure the foot is placed correctly on the wall to maintain balance and control throughout the movement.nnPracticing this technique requires getting accustomed to not being able to see where the wall is while placing the foot. Mastery of the reverse step vault hinges on developing comfort and familiarity with the motion until the technique becomes second nature. Practitioners should try it out repeatedly to gauge their comfort level and improve their skills.nn**Key Points:**n1. The reverse step vault executes a step vault in reverse, starting from a low wall for ease of entry.n2. Technique involves correct placement of the hand and foot, with a focus on hip elevation and leg movement.n3. Practicing the maneuver without visual confirmation of the wall fosters familiarity and comfort with the technique.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1152,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 261,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1413,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"6EFQj10UttLKGe4NygnFuFg.r69QuLhgTM0IQDIqsG4-1735838272-1.0.1.1-Kjs5qbzmOE2ha7UP1eZV9O5NH7mQtMB2tZISeRFg8voai89aQmpWMRGWTovFq7O508zeV5Mn7fhFfi4zjP1Jfg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840072,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"TUvazgYEtT5eyV89Ylp5yWWALDyiNP.WiOwsMuY16TU-1735838272299-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(46964,55409,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(46965,55409,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The reverse step vault is a technique that involves executing a step vault in reverse. It begins with placing one hand and one foot on a low wall, allowing the practitioner to organize their movement without needing to jump. This simplification makes the maneuver more accessible, especially for beginners. \r\n\r\nTo perform the reverse step vault, one should start by positioning their right hand on the wall and their left foot atop it. The focus should be on pushing the hips up while bringing the inside leg through before descending smoothly and comfortably from the wall. It’s essential to ensure the foot is placed correctly on the wall to maintain balance and control throughout the movement.\r\n\r\nPracticing this technique requires getting accustomed to not being able to see where the wall is while placing the foot. Mastery of the reverse step vault hinges on developing comfort and familiarity with the motion until the technique becomes second nature. Practitioners should try it out repeatedly to gauge their comfort level and improve their skills.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The reverse step vault executes a step vault in reverse, starting from a low wall for ease of entry.\r\n2. Technique involves correct placement of the hand and foot, with a focus on hip elevation and leg movement.\r\n3. Practicing the maneuver without visual confirmation of the wall fosters familiarity and comfort with the technique.'),(46966,55409,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(46967,55409,'svg_id',''),(46968,55409,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(46969,55409,'svg_colour',''),(46970,55409,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(46971,55409,'extra_variables',''),(46972,55409,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(46973,55409,'notes',''),(46974,55409,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(46975,55409,'enable_youtube_api',''),(46976,55409,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(46977,55409,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(46978,55409,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(46979,55409,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(46980,55409,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(46981,55409,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(46982,55409,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(46983,55409,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(46984,55409,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(46985,55409,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(46986,55409,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(46987,55409,'enable_transcript',''),(46988,55409,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(46989,55409,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(46990,55409,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(46991,55409,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(46992,55409,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(46993,55409,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(46994,55409,'video_filename','Vaulting-ReverseStep/Tutorial-vaulting-reverse_step-1-low-wall.mp4'),(46995,55409,'_video_filename','field_677cead91f698'),(46996,55409,'portrait_thumbnail_image','Vaulting-ReverseStep/screenshots/Tutorial-vaulting-reverse_step-1-l