 down and drop okay let\'s do\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000\r\nit again so I I\'ll do the same right\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000\r\nhand so you can see it from the other\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000\r\nside so Hand comes across foot comes up\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000\r\non top of the wall push up get my hips\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\nup high leg through step down and there\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:60,000 --> 00:01:04,000\r\nyou go so all the things we\'ve been\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:63,000 --> 00:01:07,000\r\ntalking about all the components put\r\n\r\n22\r\n00:00:65,000 --> 00:01:12,000\r\ntogether in the reverse step Vault but\r\n\r\n23\r\n00:00:67,000 --> 00:01:11,000\r\nwithout any momentum for now\r\n\r\n'),(47264,55411,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(47265,55411,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJ76cYM4IkbpCqDvP7SqasOUR14S\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735838252,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The instruction focuses on performing a reverse step vault, emphasizing the importance of executing the movement without the aid of speed or momentum. The technique involves stepping up with a controlled motion, highlighting specific body placements such as positioning the right hand and back foot correctly on top of the wall. This increasingly precise approach ensures that the individual is aware of their body movements during the trick.nnIn the demonstration, the speaker elaborates on the mechanics involved in the vault. The initial step requires placing the right hand across and carefully positioning the foot on the wall while pushing the body upwards. The emphasis is on maintaining a high hip position during the leg motion to ensure a smooth transition. The process is repeated for clarity, demonstrating the correct body posture from different angles to enhance understanding.nnThroughout the explanation, attention is drawn to the key elements required for a successful reverse step vault, including balance, control, and body alignment without relying on momentum. By focusing on these foundational aspects first, practitioners can later integrate speed into their execution when they feel more comfortable performing the movement.nnKey Points:n1. The reverse step vault technique should be performed without momentum to ensure control and precision.n2. Proper body positioning, particularly the placement of hands and foot, is crucial for executing the movement.n3. Emphasis on maintaining high hips and supporting alignment lays the foundation for integrating speed in future attempts.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 881,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 271,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1152,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"sU3ehdfWCm.YjYyiv0bBxq_zONlbQZ43jKBCN23gNyU-1735838256-1.0.1.1-5GFXg8XuPweKYsxf1luCScpoWEaZ55zduFUzSACosbYL6qN0g6IslfZZqayTjIKg2FwGGbkjNxoKnCKBGNaYuw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840056,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"n_b7JOs53a_2sgo1GnbK3stqWK35ANMoWAkLOTVu40k-1735838256505-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(47266,55411,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(47267,55411,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The instruction focuses on performing a reverse step vault, emphasizing the importance of executing the movement without the aid of speed or momentum. The technique involves stepping up with a controlled motion, highlighting specific body placements such as positioning the right hand and back foot correctly on top of the wall. This increasingly precise approach ensures that the individual is aware of their body movements during the trick.\r\n\r\nIn the demonstration, the speaker elaborates on the mechanics involved in the vault. The initial step requires placing the right hand across and carefully positioning the foot on the wall while pushing the body upwards. The emphasis is on maintaining a high hip position during the leg motion to ensure a smooth transition. The process is repeated for clarity, demonstrating the correct body posture from different angles to enhance understanding.\r\n\r\nThroughout the explanation, attention is drawn to the key elements required for a successful reverse step vault, including balance, control, and body alignment without relying on momentum. By focusing on these foundational aspects first, practitioners can later integrate speed into their execution when they feel more comfortable performing the movement.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The reverse step vault technique should be performed without momentum to ensure control and precision.\r\n2. Proper body positioning, particularly the placement of hands and foot, is crucial for executing the movement.\r\n3. Emphasis on maintaining high hips and supporting alignment lays the foundation for integrating speed in future attempts.'),(47268,55411,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(47269,55411,'svg_id',''),(47270,55411,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(47271,55411,'svg_colour',''),(47272,55411,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(47273,55411,'extra_variables',''),(47274,55411,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(47275,55411,'notes',''),(47276,55411,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(47277,55411,'enable_youtube_api',''),(47278,55411,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(47279,55411,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(47280,55411,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(47281,55411,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(47282,55411,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(47283,55411,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(47284,55411,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(47285,55411,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(47286,55411,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(47287,55411,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(47288,55411,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(47289,55411,'enable_transcript',''),(47290,55411,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(47291,55411,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(47292,55411,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(47293,55411,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this