 should be a part of this line, showcasing versatility while ensuring that it fits naturally into the overall performance.nnThe process includes trial and error in devising combinations of vaults, which supports the overall development of skills. It is important to ensure each element transitions smoothly into the next, particularly focusing on making the reverse step vault feel integrated. This reinforces the idea that practice is essential for achieving fluidity in movement.nnKey Points:n1. Master the reverse step vault and integrate it into diverse movement scenarios.n2. Create a routine that combines multiple vaults, ensuring they flow together seamlessly.n3. Prioritize natural transitions in performance to enhance versatility and skill fluency.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 931,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 250,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1181,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"tUDbDFpW8ea22.8.lH1S7ZII95pQlpkcOBdmoBhg0UA-1735838205-1.0.1.1-5vCSXydpopZVhnQfQuL0isMZ9EK3lWJVd5lchr4WWXTqap9mHPSEoaiIw9R7lCqGkvn6_kMl48kATfQIUMjGCw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840005,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"doma