 combines multiple vaults, ensuring they flow together seamlessly.\r\n3. Prioritize natural transitions in performance to enhance versatility and skill fluency.'),(48352,55418,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(48353,55418,'svg_id',''),(48354,55418,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(48355,55418,'svg_colour',''),(48356,55418,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(48357,55418,'extra_variables',''),(48358,55418,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(48359,55418,'notes',''),(48360,55418,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(48361,55418,'enable_youtube_api',''),(48362,55418,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(48363,55418,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(48364,55418,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(48365,55418,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(48366,55418,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(48367,55418,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(48368,55418,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(48369,55418,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(48370,55418,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(48371,55418,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(48372,55418,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(48373,55418,'enable_transcript',''),(48374,55418,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(48375,55418,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(48376,55418,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(48377,55418,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(48378,55418,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(48379,55418,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(48380,55418,'video_filename','Vaulting-ReverseStep/Tutorial-vaulting-reverse_step-10-in-a-route.mp4'),(48381,55418,'_video_filename','field_677cead91f698'),(48382,55418,'portrait_thumbnail_image','Vaulting-ReverseStep/scre