       \"content\": \"London Parkour is an online platform dedicated to teaching the art of parkour through tutorials, tips, and community engagement. They offer various resources including a website, social media channels, and a YouTube channel where subscribers can learn practical movements that can transform their physical abilities and mindset. The focus is on making parkour accessible and enjoyable for everyone, regardless of skill level.nnTo stay updated with their content and community, London Parkour encourages users to subscribe to their YouTube channel and follow them on Instagram. They provide a variety of tutorials that guide viewers through essential parkour techniques, promoting a fit and active lifestyle. The platform aims to foster a supportive environment for parkour enthusiasts and newcomers alike.nnFor inquiries or further information, users can reach out via email or explore their website, which serves as a hub for all parkour-related content and community events. By engaging with London Parkour, individuals can enhance their understanding and practice of parkour, connecting with fellow enthusiasts in the process.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 198,n    \"total_tokens\": 430,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"loAAEOw1LI084NWCrVf.zEuToYTBIaXcE7Gci5B3tDM-1733399560-1.0.1.1-Fyf10rnuTYbUJ4DwJfnevUtVmzVz.7RXMbuLw9NIvrVOEHRf.203