for everyone, regardless of their skill level.nnTo stay updated with the latest parkour tutorials and content, users are encouraged to subscribe to their YouTube channel, which features a variety of instructional videos and demonstrations. The channel serves as a platform for parkour enthusiasts to learn new skills, improve existing ones, and connect with the broader parkour community. Engaging with the material can broaden one’s understanding of parkour as not only a physical discipline but also a form of personal expression and growth.nnFor those interested in exploring more about London Parkour, additional information can be found on their official website and social media platforms. Through these channels, users can follow their journey, access more resources, and contact the team for further inquiries. By focusing on the holistic development of individuals in the realm of parkour, London Parkour aims to foster an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive physically and mentally.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 235,n    \"total_tokens\": 467,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"SA8OrCbWTuBu.c7beaYlnaV4Ff3xryfqm4GRdnVOP5Q-1733399605-1.0.1.1-7GG5iP8vyTug23jHNV1NivyYNoiSuzN9ByWRq0AXTPWA6QZjtx.b0IqJiTz8.r44Er6P1gkhUI3lzzkUfXF0DA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733401405,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.open