 easier climbs on lower rails which can gradually build up to higher obstacles. Again, it is advised that all body weight should remain on the first leg while the second leg is brought into the correct position.nnOverall, efficiency and control are highlighted within both techniques to successfully mount obstacles using proper foot placement and weight distribution. The speaker encourages practitioners to practice these movements gradually, ensuring they develop strength and technique to aid in their progression in parkour.nnKey points:n1. Two methods for mounting a rail or wall are discussed: a step vault and a direct transition.n2. Proper foot placement and weight management are crucial for effective execution of both methods.n3. Practitioners should focus on gradual progression and strength building while practicing these mounting techniques.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1376,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 302,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1678,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"OTh75MC4EIDW3OLurJy9347WGr4qK344Aa98dRzzrWY-1733399612-1.0.1.1-nwx4mlzGYUck.X4BolqcMS6R1muXQhZXfaLCDXxdQXn6duAQDKyN_ZymKo2bls4NnH9Z8aZAcQ9ScixXegq2