ib5QEjpzbIKTumglNvANhWbUDZ\",n  \"object\": \"chat.completion\",n  \"created\": 1733399637,n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",n  \"choices\": [n    {n      \"index\": 0,n      \"message\": {n        \"role\": \"assistant\",n        \"content\": \"London Parkour offers a comprehensive online platform dedicated to the art of parkour, providing tutorials and resources to help individuals learn and improve their skills in practical movement. Their website, https://LONDONPARKOUR.com, serves as a hub for various training materials, encouraging users to revolutionize their physical capabilities and mindset through parkour techniques. The aim is to enhance both mental and physical fitness, making it approachable for people of all levels.nnThe organization actively promotes engagement through social media channels, including Instagram and YouTube. They encourage users to subscribe to their YouTube channel for regular updates and tutorials, which are categorized under various hashtags like #ParkourHowTo, #ParkourTutorial, and #LondonParkour. These platforms allow followers to stay connected with the parkour community and access valuable content that can aid in their journey of mastering parkour moves.nnFor those interested in learning more about their offerings or seeking guidance, London Parkour provides an email contact for inquiries. The organization emphasizes a transformation in movement and overall well-being, making it a promising resource for anyone looking to explore the dynamic discipline of parkour. Potential learners are invited to connect through their website and social media to begin their journey in this exciting physical activity.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 247,n    \"total_tokens\": 479,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens