ltimately facilitating a smoother transition to performing this maneuver on the rail.nnKey Points:n1. The parallel pistol technique requires substantial strength and balance to execute effectively on a rail.n2. Proper technique involves shifting body weight and coordinating movement to align along the rail while maintaining balance.n3. Beginners should practice on lower bars and ground-level pistols to develop the necessary strength and stability before attempting the mount on higher rails.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1219,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 296,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1515,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"T9MlHdd.KaaFPvu4Dxmkqe8aUpqPm4vbi7qcNKnV5J8-1733399648-1.0.1.1-yTCTilVpHkPFTqFqsqf_.kKSoQMvzPYwXeN22Ar1ortRUReLfUgKyCgp3gvGImgwhSQJ6mrfwsjOl_09sXUjvA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733401448,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"V3kpG.SETALHWNOc.qZ7A6Da0EvN62dXB.jhcr9weTI-1733399648277-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(48906,55422,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(48907,55422,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The method of mounting onto a rail using a parallel pistol technique requires significant strength and balance, particularly as it involves performing a one-legged squat while maintaining stability. The motion begins with positioning one foot on the rail, then shifting the body and turning to align along the rail. This method not only demands a strong leg workout but also helps in mastering balance, essential for optimizing performance on the rail.\r\n\r\nTo execute this maneuver, it is suggested to start from a step vault position or by placing the foot directly onto the rail, then transitioning into the pistol position. The emphasis is on using the hands for support if necessary while pushing up from the leg to achieve height on the rail. This coordination of movement highlights the dual requirement of physical strength in the legs and body balance, making it a nuanced skill to develop.\r\n\r\nA gradual approach is recommended for those looking to perfect this technique. Practicing on lower bars can help individuals get accustomed to the necessary balance before attempting the full motion on higher rails. Additionally, incorporating one-legged squats or pistols on the ground can enhance strength, ultimately facilitating a smoother transition to performing this maneuver on the rail.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The parallel pistol technique requires substantial strength and balance to execute effectively on a rail.\r\n2. Proper technique involves shifting body weight and coordinating movement to align along the rail while maintaining balance.\r\n3. Beginners should practice on lower bars and ground-level pistols to develop the necessary strength and stability before attempting the mount on higher rails.'),(48908,55422,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(48909,55422,'svg_id',''),(48910,55422,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(48911,55422,'svg_colour',''),(48912,55422,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(48913,55422,'extra_variables',''),(48914,55422,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(48915,55422,'notes',''),(48916,55422,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(48917,55422,'enable_youtube_api',''),(48918,55422,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(48919,55422,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(48920,55422,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(48921,55422,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(48922,55422,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(48923,55422,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(48924,55422,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(48925,55422,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(48926,55422,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(48927,55422,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(48928,55422,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(48929,55422,'enable_transcript',''),(48930,55422,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(48931,55422,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(48932,55422,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(48933,55422,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(48934,55422,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(48935,55422,'rank_math_seo_score','17'),(48936,55422,'video_filename','Balance-Mounting/Tutorial-Balancing-Mounting_4-Parallel-Pistol.mp4'),(48937,55422,'_video_filename','field_677cead91f698'),(48938,55422,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_cat