 but also practice to master the balance aspect. Those unfamiliar with this orientation might struggle initially, indicating that practice and gradual progression are key to successfully incorporating this technique into their training regime.nnIn addition to building strength, the perpendicular pistol is noted for its practical applications in various scenarios and environments. The skill not only enhances the practicer\'s ability to execute movements in a more versatile manner but is also beneficial for activities that require dynamic striding. Thus, mastering the perpendicular pistol can lead to overall improvements in mobility and functional strength.nnKey points:n1. The perpendicular pistol is an advanced variation of the parallel pistol, necessitating a position perpendicular to the rail for better strength and balance training.n2. This movement requires practice and coordination, presenting challenges in maintaining balance and effectively executing a one-legged squat.n3. The technique is beneficial for various scenarios, enhancing mobility and functional strength in dynamic movements.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 828,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 293,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1121,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"7bNmRDWwiSyLvy_J0Rc9RM460lYzMhGizvM2y9dT8zs-1733399675-1.0.1.1-I75Tlo7FtSEiIy.jE4eHTYd_PILlMrJHKV68BijZsqUkcfjUrEjq9Pnz9sutDIvFwPL9VtBLTbJipBRwxYf12g\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733401475,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"39NRc4BIRjUxg6WvcVJBHnPwMpnE74tYUgxGkd1kirE-1733399675957-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(49045,55423,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(49046,55423,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion revolves around a specific technique in movement training called the perpendicular pistol. This technique serves as an advanced variation of the parallel pistol, requiring the practitioner to position themselves perpendicular to the rail or support structure. The main goal of this movement is to enhance strength and balance while performing a one-legged squat, leading to a more methodical approach to developing leg strength and stability.\r\n\r\nExecuting the perpendicular pistol is described as a more challenging endeavor due to the need for improved balance and coordination. The movement entails facing forward and pushing upwards from a one-legged squat position, which demands not only physical strength but also practice to master the balance aspect. Those unfamiliar with this orientation might struggle initially, indicating that practice and gradual progression are key to successfully incorporating this technique into their training regime.\r\n\r\nIn addition to building strength, the perpendicular pistol is noted for its practical applications in various scenarios and environments. The skill not only enhances the practicer\'s ability to execute movements in a more versatile manner but is also beneficial for activities that require dynamic striding. Thus, mastering the perpendicular pistol can lead to overall improvements in mobility and functional strength.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The perpendicular pistol is an advanced variation of the parallel pistol, necessitating a position perpendicular to the rail for better strength and balance training.\r\n2. This movement requires practice and coordination, presenting challenges in maintaining balance and effectively executing a one-legged squat.\r\n3. The technique is beneficial for various scenarios, enhancing mobility and functional strength in dynamic movements.'),(49047,55423,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(49048,55423,'svg_id',''),(49049,55423,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(49050,55423,'svg_colour',''),(49051,55423,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(49052,55423,'extra_variables',''),(49053,55423,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(49054,55423,'notes',''),(49055,55423,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(49056,55423,'enable_youtube_api',''),(49057,55423,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(49058,55423,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(49059,55423,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(49060,55423,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(49061,55423,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(49062,55423,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(49063,55423,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(49064,55423,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(49065,55423,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(49066,55423,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(49067,55423,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50