s can access a range of parkour-related content and learn how to improve their physical abilities through practical movement.\r\n\r\nFor ongoing updates and visual content, London Parkour encourages interested individuals to subscribe to their YouTube channel, which provides step-by-step tutorials and showcases various parkour techniques. By visiting their social media platforms, particularly Instagram, followers can stay connected with the latest trends and community events surrounding parkour in London. The overarching goal is to inspire transformation in one\'s thinking, movement, and overall physical experience.\r\n\r\nTo engage with the community or seek additional information, users are invited to reach out via the provided contact email. By participating in London Parkour, members can expect to enhance their parkour skills while also connecting with like-minded individuals who share a passion for this physical art form.'),(49199,55424,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(49200,55424,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"all right next mounting method is a Leap\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.279,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.28\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Frog again this is a little bit harder\",\r\n        \"start\": 8.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"again slightly trickier um the key here\",\r\n        \"start\": 10.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.161\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"is both feet are going to come up at the\",\r\n        \"start\": 15.16,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.48\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"same time and you want to be a bit\",\r\n        \"start\": 17.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"careful over this because you don\'t want\",\r\n        \"start\": 19.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to be a you don\'t want to clip your feet\",\r\n        