n the inside while keeping feet outside. This technique emphasizes the importance of a smooth transition into balance after the initial leap. For those new to this method, starting from a lower rail and gradually progressing to a higher one can help ease the learning curve.nnWith practice, the Leap Frog method is recognized as a fast and efficient way to mount rails, allowing for smoother progression in skill development. Once comfort with the movement is achieved, it can enhance overall performance in mounting techniques. The consistent practice of this method is seen as valuable for building confidence and improving execution.nn**Key Points:**n1. The Leap Frog method requires lifting both feet simultaneously and practicing on flat ground beforehand to avoid foot clipping.n2. Hands should be placed on the inside with feet outside to facilitate balance after the leap.n3. Starting from lower rails and progressing to higher ones makes mastering the technique easier and enhances overall mounting efficiency.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1008,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 248,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1256,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n          