g confidence and improving execution.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The Leap Frog method requires lifting both feet simultaneously and practicing on flat ground beforehand to avoid foot clipping.\r\n2. Hands should be placed on the inside with feet outside to facilitate balance after the leap.\r\n3. Starting from lower rails and progressing to higher ones makes mastering the technique easier and enhances overall mounting efficiency.'),(49207,55424,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(49208,55424,'svg_id',''),(49209,55424,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(49210,55424,'svg_colour',''),(49211,55424,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(49212,55424,'extra_variables',''),(49213,55424,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(49214,55424,'notes',''),(49215,55424,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(49216,55424,'enable_youtube_api',''),(49217,55424,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(49218,55424,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(49219,55424,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(49220,55424,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(49221,55424,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(49222,55424,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(49223,55424,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(49224,55424,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(49225,55424,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(49226,55424,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(49227,55424,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(49228,55424,'enable_transcript',''),(49229,55424,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(49230,55424,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(49231,55424,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(49232,55424,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(49233,55424,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(492