xecuting the Danish flick include maintaining a high hip position and a forward lean similar to a cat pass. This stance helps in positioning the feet for landing while ensuring maximum control upon hitting the rail. It is recommended to land on the balls of the feet, which enhances stability and balance during the maneuver. Perfecting this skill is achievable through regular practice and focused technique reinforcement. nnKey points:n1. The Danish flick involves using hip height and flicking legs back to facilitate landing on a rail.n2. Practicing from a lower height can ease the learning process and build confidence.n3. Proper technique, including a forward lean and landing on the balls of the feet, is crucial for control and balance.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1634,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 313,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1947,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_bba3c8e70b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"T.0R0Im.m1SVNdwerBNC_G3iTNJTaVmbuo.ht3a4oiQ-1733399771-1.0.1.1-wWVOspSTlSzPRYKkud0h3O5al1OOKYLbgw9TRC.yFIkmVmiJ3beskzaHSHhm5iE4RtJkeatn9_.YjUhh9prT6Q\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733401571,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"oYXw_3cy_oztOT_ZpMdYt1MZoM64t0Co.Qj7hm5oRFY-1733399771534-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(49461,55426,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(49462,55426,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The Danish flick is an advanced movement that requires a precise technique involving the waist and hips. The method begins with catching a bar at hip level and then flicking the legs back while lifting the hips. This motion is critical because it allows for a powerful whip action of the feet, enabling them to land accurately on a rail. The skill is regarded as challenging, particularly when trying to mount the bar effectively.\r\n\r\nTo practice the Danish flick, starting at a lower position is advisable to minimize the height of the drop and reduce the associated risks. Skill-building can be approached by first mastering the ability to get one foot on the rail, then transitioning to both feet. The movement must be quick and fluid, so practicing consistently is essential for overcoming any fear related to the complexity of the skill. Gradually increasing height can aid in developing both confidence and technique.\r\n\r\nKey techniques for executing the Danish flick include maintaining a high hip position and a forward lean similar to a cat pass. This stance helps in positioning the feet for landing while ensuring maximum control upon hitting the rail. It is recommended to land on the balls of the feet, which enhances stability and balance during the maneuver. Perfecting this skill is achievable through regular practice and focused technique reinforcement. \r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The Danish flick involves using hip height and flicking legs back to facilitate landing on a rail.\r\n2. Practicing from a lower height can ease the learning process and build confidence.\r\n3. Proper technique, including a forward lean and landing on the balls of the feet, is crucial for control and balance.'),(49463,55426,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(49464,55426,'svg_id',''),(49465,55426,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(49466,55426,'svg_colour',''),(49467,55426,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(49468,55426,'extra_variables',''),(49469,55426,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(49470,55426,'notes',''),(49471,55426,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(49472,55426,'enable_youtube_api',''),(49473,55426,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(49474,55426,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(49475,55426,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(49476,55426,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(49477,55426,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(49478,55426,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(49479,55426,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(49480,55426,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(49481,55426,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(49482,55426,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(49483,55426,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(49484,55426,'enable_transcript',''),(49485,55426,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(49486,55426,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(49487,55426,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(49488,55426,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(49489,55426,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(494