eases the risk of missing the bar. By ensuring the thumb is positioned behind, the grip becomes more secure, allowing for a more confident and successful execution of movements over the rail. The overall strategy reinforces the need for adequate training environments, such as scaffolding or walls with bars, to practice effectively.nnParticipants are encouraged to refine their skills by trying exercises that involve going over the bar with careful attention to foot and hand alignment. This session demonstrates that even small adjustments in technique can significantly impact performance. Practicing in ideal settings provides an opportunity to develop skills that enhance both safety and proficiency in balance-oriented movements.nnKey Points:n1. Precision in foot placement is critical for successful execution over the bar.n2. Proper hand grip with the thumb curled back enhances safety and control.n3. Ideal practice environments facilitate the development of balance and movement skills.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1199,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 278,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1477,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 1024,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"w5Bd.tlOOlTMo9DYBi86tHrNJpPODiPvH8Fut9zc6n0-1735840410-1.0.1.1-J2JXOYpUGdgjdG8Wq1BylktBN2lHqQZdxNMPZ6Zo_3m06SYBVyNlbaOSlzn9KftBw3fdRg5plNlqhSwiwXT34A\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842210,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"of1vNzHhuN2NFQHYNINQ8RjmIqL5mwvKHfAHy3ot2jM-1735840410760-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(50246,55432,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(50247,55432,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The focus of this practice session is on developing precision and accuracy while using a rail for movement exercises. Emphasizing the importance of foot placement, the aim is for the foot to land perfectly on an upright bar during execution. The technique requires careful coordination, utilizing one hand and one foot to navigate over the bar effectively. This deliberate practice is designed to enhance balance and control.\r\n\r\nIn terms of grip, the session highlights a crucial hand positioning detail: the thumb should be curled back, which provides a safer grip by preventing slipping. A forward thumb position increases the risk of missing the bar. By ensuring the thumb is positioned behind, the grip becomes more secure, allowing for a more confident and successful execution of movements over the rail. The overall strategy reinforces the need for adequate training environments, such as scaffolding or walls with bars, to practice effectively.\r\n\r\nParticipants are encouraged to refine their skills by trying exercises that involve going over the bar with careful attention to foot and hand alignment. This session demonstrates that even small adjustments in technique can significantly impact performance. Practicing in ideal settings provides an opportunity to develop skills that enhance both safety and proficiency in balance-oriented movements.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Precision in foot placement is critical for successful execution over the bar.\r\n2. Proper hand grip with the thumb curled back enhances safety and control.\r\n3. Ideal practice environments facilitate the development of balance and movement skills.'),(50248,55432,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(50249,55432,'svg_id',''),(50250,55432,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(50251,55432,'svg_colour',''),(50252,55432,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(50253,55432,'extra_variables',''),(50254,55432,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(50255,55432,'notes',''),(50256,55432,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(50257,55432,'enable_youtube_api',''),(50258,55432,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(50259,55432,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(50260,55432,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(50261,55432,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(50262,55432,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(50263,55432,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(50264,55432,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(50265,55432,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(50266,55432,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(50267,55432,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(50268,55432,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(50269,55432,'enable_transcript',''),(50270,55432,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(50271,55432,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(50272,55432,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(50273,55432,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise wit