 to focus on the correct timing of lifting the hands and shuffling the feet together. By mastering the fundamental drills, individuals can avoid common mistakes that hinder progress, such as failing to create sufficient space under their bodies. nnKey points:n1. Positioning and coordination of hands and feet are essential for executing the cat pass correctly.n2. The movement requires both feet and hands to be lifted simultaneously to allow for a successful transition.n3. Practicing the basic technique helps avoid common errors and fosters progression to more advanced variations.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2269,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 305,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2574,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ExInxuTmS_4ywpMcFnEhcHvQ9cFqtZqgbCYCOaBseYE-1735837048-1.0.1.1-kFMZhsZQbwjdYC2thoQTkq3Ioknm60XbJsamDGDKnUm7vahE8rmPeEqG0eRUxGnCcu0JyrzCZApCHXSssDHyGg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735838848,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"kZAxkqAqTdH7UaYx6r112o8Z1LhEvDjcXAjwuJE5Hfw-1735837048114-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(50900,55438,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(50901,55438,'video_transcript_chatgpt','Learning the cat pass begins with positioning and understanding the coordination between hands and feet during the movement. The first step involves getting into a proper stance on the ground, where both hands are placed out in front, and the body is prepared for the action. Crouching down and leaning forward while balancing on the balls of the feet is crucial for achieving the correct form as one prepares to execute the movement.\r\n\r\nThe next key phase is lifting the feet off the ground while simultaneously bringing the hands off. This is a bilateral action, meaning both sides of the body need to move together to create an effective and fluid motion. As both feet come towards the hands, there should be an element of hopping forward, allowing the individual to shift their weight and clear the space beneath them. This technique encourages a better understanding of transferring body weight and generating momentum.\r\n\r\nUltimately, practicing this movement will allow for more advanced variations, such as bringing the feet past where the hands were initially placed. It\'s important for those learning this skill to focus on the correct timing of lifting the hands and shuffling the feet together. By mastering the fundamental drills, individuals can avoid common mistakes that hinder progress, such as failing to create sufficient space under their bodies. \r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Positioning and coordination of hands and feet are essential for executing the cat pass correctly.\r\n2. The movement requires both feet and hands to be lifted simultaneously to allow for a successful transition.\r\n3. Practicing the basic technique helps avoid common errors and fosters progression to more advanced variations.'),(50902,55438,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(50903,55438,'svg_id',''),(50904,55438,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(50905,55438,'svg_colour',''),(50906,55438,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(50907,55438,'extra_variables',''),(50908,55438,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(50909,55438,'notes',''),(50910,55438,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(50911,55438,'enable_youtube_api',''),(50912,55438,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(50913,55438,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(50914,55438,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(50915,55438,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(50916,55438,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(50917,55438,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(50918,55438,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(50919,55438,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(50920,55438,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(50921,55438,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(50922,55438,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(50923,55438,'enable_transcript',''),(50924,55438,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(50925,55438,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(50926,55438,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(50927,55438,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(50928,55438,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(50929,55438,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(50930,55438,'video_filename','Vaulting-CatPass/Tutorial-vaulting-cat_pass-1-floor-kong.mp4')