ividuals should practice prior movements to build towards the cat pass. This preparatory work ultimately aids in achieving success in overcoming obstacles such as walls safely and effectively.\r\n\r\nIn this progression, practitioners are urged to visualize their movements, keeping their head up and hands flat for better control. As they become more confident in the technique, they can work on refining their approach to ensure a smooth and efficient pass over the wall. Overall, proper technique and practice are vital for mastering this skill without compromising safety.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Emphasize body positioning to avoid injury when performing a cat pass.\r\n2. Practice is essential to build confidence and skills necessary for overcoming obstacles.\r\n3. Maintain proper technique, including head position and hand placement, for successful execution.'),(51142,55440,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(51143,55440,'svg_id',''),(51144,55440,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(51145,55440,'svg_colour',''),(51146,55440,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(51147,55440,'extra_variables',''),(51148,55440,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(51149,55440,'notes',''),(51150,55440,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(51151,55440,'enable_youtube_api',''),(51152,55440,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(51153,55440,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(51154,55440,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(51155,55440,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(51156,55440,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(51157,55440,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(51158,55440,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(51159,55440,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(51160,55440,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(51161,55440,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(51162,55440,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(51163,55440,'enable_transcript',''),(51164,55440,'_enable_transcri