der to jump\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000\r\nhigh and pull yourself past the wall all\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000\r\nright so from here I\'m going to put my\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000\r\nfingers over the back Edge and then when\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000\r\nI\'m ready to\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\ngo over I go okay so I\'m trying to get\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:60,000 --> 00:01:06,000\r\nas much height as I can and then I\'m\r\n\r\n22\r\n00:00:63,000 --> 00:01:09,000\r\npulling to get past that uh that wall um\r\n\r\n23\r\n00:00:66,000 --> 00:01:11,000\r\nthe hips want to be as high as you can\r\n\r\n24\r\n00:00:69,000 --> 00:01:14,000\r\nand I\'m really getting as low as I can\r\n\r\n25\r\n00:00:72,000 --> 00:01:17,000\r\nto do the push start at the top when I\'m\r\n\r\n26\r\n00:00:74,000 --> 00:01:18,000\r\nready to go down and up and pull\r\n\r\n27\r\n00:00:77,000 --> 00:01:23,000\r\neverything else is the same as the\r\n\r\n28\r\n00:00:79,000 --> 00:01:24,000\r\nnormal cat pass but yeah give it a go\r\n\r\n'),(51623,55443,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(51624,55443,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlIo0sJtZZueYz4FdjUk51tIENf6P\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735837068,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"Performing a standing cat pass is considered one of the more challenging maneuvers for athletes. This technique is executed without any initial momentum, often while positioned against a wall, complicating the jump. Achieving a successful cat pass may sometimes involve transitioning into a drop or precision landing, necessitating careful coordination and technique.nnThe primary technique for a standing cat pass involves placing hands effectively to maximize strength and pull over the edge. Proper positioning of the fingers is crucial to getting enough height during the jump, allowing the athlete to clear the obstacle. As the athlete prepares to execute the pass, they must focus on lifting their hips and maintaining a low body posture to enhance their launch into the jump.nnIn essence, the standing cat pass relies on solid fundamentals similar to a standard cat pass but demands special attention to positioning and body mechanics. Once the athlete is ready to navigate the wall, they must combine height with a strong pull to achieve success. With enough practice and focus on these techniques, the standing cat pass can be mastered.nnKey points:n1. The standing cat pass is a challenging technique performed without momentum, often while against a wall.n2. Proper hand positioning and body mechanics are crucial for achieving height and overcoming obstacles.n3. It shares fundamentals with the traditional cat pass but requires focused practice to master successfully.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1057,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 263,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1320,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\":