 special attention to positioning and body mechanics. Once the athlete is ready to navigate the wall, they must combine height with a strong pull to achieve success. With enough practice and focus on these techniques, the standing cat pass can be mastered.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The standing cat pass is a challenging technique performed without momentum, often while against a wall.\r\n2. Proper hand positioning and body mechanics are crucial for achieving height and overcoming obstacles.\r\n3. It shares fundamentals with the traditional cat pass but requires focused practice to master successfully.'),(51627,55443,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(51628,55443,'svg_id',''),(51629,55443,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(51630,55443,'svg_colour',''),(51631,55443,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(51632,55443,'extra_variables',''),(51633,55443,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(51634,55443,'notes',''),(51635,55443,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(51636,55443,'enable_youtube_api',''),(51637,55443,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(51638,55443,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(51639,55443,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(51640,55443,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(51641,55443,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(51642,55443,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(51643,55443,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(51644,55443,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(51645,55443,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(51646,55443,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(51647,55443,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(51648,55443,'enable_transcript',''),(51649,55443,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(51650,55443,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(51651,55443,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(51652,55443,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three ke