 the opposite side while maintaining a forward lean for better trajectory.nnTo successfully master the diving cat pass, it is important to practice on smaller, thinner surfaces before progressing to wider obstacles. The focus should be on maintaining proper body alignment and trajectory during the jump. As riders become more comfortable with the technique, they can gradually challenge themselves with larger distances and heights.nnSafety is key when practicing the diving cat pass. Start with manageable challenges to build confidence, ensuring that each attempt aligns with personal comfort levels. By taking this gradual approach, individuals can safely develop their skills in parkour.nnKey points:n1. The diving cat pass involves a higher jump and forward dive, allowing for smooth transitions over obstacles.n2. Gradual practice on smaller surfaces is essential for mastering the technique before tackling larger ones.n3. Safety through gradual challenge progression is crucial for building confidence in parkour skills.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 979,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 233,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1212,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"dWJzcVzaf37J_BomF79i7vfbYFlAaDxxhxrg04m1rSk-1735837080-1.0.1.1-w_laYqiA8XXtfBy32m5DUFIQxWB6KvcvPu_Cr29yYIjHebXPFEuU2x.v8kD1iVP46IdUmm4G6NBWV8405Pvj2w\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735838880,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"K_G7g5LMXuohNWt43Nrbg.kOb.tzUjwv5lMFdJRq53Y-1735837080991-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(51896,55445,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(51897,55445,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The diving cat pass is a challenging yet useful technique in parkour that involves a specific jumping motion. To execute this maneuver, one must leap slightly higher while engaging their hips and shoulders to dive forward. This technique allows for clearing obstacles, such as walls or blocks, and landing smoothly on the opposite side while maintaining a forward lean for better trajectory.\r\n\r\nTo successfully master the diving cat pass, it is important to practice on smaller, thinner surfaces before progressing to wider obstacles. The focus should be on maintaining proper body alignment and trajectory during the jump. As riders become more comfortable with the technique, they can gradually challenge themselves with larger distances and heights.\r\n\r\nSafety is key when practicing the diving cat pass. Start with manageable challenges to build confidence, ensuring that each attempt aligns with personal comfort levels. By taking this gradual approach, individuals can safely develop their skills in parkour.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The diving cat pass involves a higher jump and forward dive, allowing for smooth transitions over obstacles.\r\n2. Gradual practice on smaller surfaces is essential for mastering the technique before tackling larger ones.\r\n3. Safety through gradual challenge progression is crucial for building confidence in parkour skills.'),(51898,55445,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(51899,55445,'svg_id',''),(51900,55445,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(51901,55445,'svg_colour',''),(51902,55445,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(51903,55445,'extra_variables',''),(51904,55445,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(51905,55445,'notes',''),(51906,55445,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(51907,55445,'enable_youtube_api',''),(51908,55445,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(51909,55445,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(51910,55445,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(51911,55445,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(51912,55445,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(51913,55445,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(51914,55445,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(51915,55445,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(51916,55445,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(51917,55445,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(51918,55445,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(51919,55445,'enable_transcript',''),(51920,55445,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(51921,55445,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(51922,55445,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(51923,55445,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(51924,55445,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(51925,55445,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(51926