t impact um and getting\r\n\r\n30\r\n00:00:102,000 --> 00:01:45,000\r\nthrough over the vault\r\n\r\n'),(52373,55449,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(52374,55449,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJUxrlaO41yIsEPaEURqyJW4gvsH\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735839731,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The speed step technique focuses on effectively navigating vaults using momentum and proper leg positioning. The initial stride involves leading with a foot and transitioning through with the opposite leg, ensuring that the landing and the subsequent movement flow seamlessly. By coordinating the movement of the legs and hands, one can achieve a more fluid motion over the vault. The key is to emphasize the timing of the leg movements in relation to the hand placement, making the execution both efficient and less taxing on the body.nnThroughout the practice, various attempts are made to refine the movement, with the importance of positioning highlighted. Each iteration builds upon the previous one, allowing for adjustments in form that result in improved execution. The goal is to ensure that as one foot lands, the other leg is already in position to move over the vault, thereby minimizing delays and maximizing the fluidity of the motion. Observational feedback is crucial in identifying areas for improvement, especially concerning leg placement and body alignment during the execution.nnFinally, the technique emphasizes the \'inside leg\' positioning, which helps maintain balance and control during the vault. As the process is practiced on both sides, the adaptability and utility of the speed step become apparent; it is not only essential for managing the impact on landing but also for enhancing overall performance in vaulting exercises. This technique serves as a fundamental skill for athletes looking to improve their agility and efficiency when navigating vaults.nn**Key Points:**n1. The speed step technique emphasizes leading with a foot and transitioning smoothly with the opposite leg to navigate vaults effectively.n2. Practice involves iterative feedback to refine leg positioning and body alignment for a more fluid execution.n3. Inside leg positioning is crucial for maintaining balance and control during vaulting, making it a fundamental skill for athletes.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1106,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 349,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1455,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"gGps06.jtEhGrXIaAzhgy2fosq2xZD8JlSttMPgYYQ8-1735839738-1.0.1.1-8NZeWuU2KuH0T1lOj56UAPXJTTktiERWlDMupuoadNeThDmiJOJu3yRTDEZoelEODviZOtNzKB0b2dVeOk_xNw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735841538,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"7mZqTb0sXyYEHLtjhnRIohi.23.3S2xhrKaYpXxRkZI-1735839738084-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(52375,55449,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(52376,55449,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The speed step technique focuses on effectively navigating vaults using momentum and proper leg positioning. The initial stride involves leading with a foot and transitioning through with the opposite leg, ensuring that the landing and the subsequent movement flow seamlessly. By coordinating the movement of the legs and hands, one can achieve a more fluid motion over the vault. The key is to emphasize the timing of the leg movements in relation to the hand placement, making the execution both efficient and less taxing on the body.\r\n\r\nThroughout the practice, various attempts are made to refine the movement, with the importance of positioning highlighted. Each iteration builds upon the previous one, allowing for adjustments in form that result in improved execution. The goal is to ensure that as one foot lands, the other leg is already in position to move over the vault, thereby minimizing delays and maximizing the fluidity of the motion. Observational feedback is crucial in identifying areas for improvement, especially concerning leg placement and body alignment during the execution.\r\n\r\nFinally, the technique emphasizes the \'inside leg\' positioning, which helps maintain balance and control during the vault. As the process is practiced on both sides, the adaptability and utility of the speed step become apparent; it is not only essential for managing the impact on landing but also for enhancing overall performance in vaulting exercises. This technique serves as a fundamental skill for athletes looking to improve their agility and efficiency when navigating vaults.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The speed step technique emphasizes leading with a foot and transitioning smoothly with the opposite leg to navigate vaults effectively.\r\n2. Practice involves iterative feedback to refine leg positioning and body alignment for a more fluid execution.\r\n3. Inside leg positioning is crucial for maintaining balance and control during vaulting, making it a fundamental skill for athletes.'),(52377,55449,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(52378,55449,'svg_id',''),(52379,55449,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(52380,55449,'svg_colour',''),(52381,55449,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(52382,55449,'extra_variables',''),(52383,55449,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(52384,55449,'notes',''),(52385,55449,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(52386,55449,'enable_youtube_api',''),(52387,55449,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(52388,55449,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(52389,55449,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(52390,55449,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(52391,55449,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(52392,55449,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(52393,55449,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(52394,55449,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(52395,55449,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(52396,55449,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(52397,55449,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(52398,55449,'enable_transcript',''),(52399,55449,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(52400,55449,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(52401,55449,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(52402,55449,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and s