17.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.479\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the same way as you exit as well so from\",\r\n        \"start\": 20.279,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.281\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"here up and down still facing the same\",\r\n        \"start\": 24.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"way you don\'t want to be turned out or\",\r\n        \"start\": 28.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"away it\'s sideways you\'re still facing\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"forwards uh land two feet to begin with\",\r\n        \"start\": 34.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 7\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you can as you exit go one two later on\",\r\n        \"start\": 37.8,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"when there\'s more momentum but for now\",\r\n        \"start\": 41.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.24\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"just land 2 feet take off two feet and\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.919\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"this is the up on and\",\r\n        \"start\": 48.16,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.28\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"over up and down\",\r\n        \"start\": 51.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.041\r\n    }\r\n]'),(53155,55454,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(53156,55454,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000\r\nonce you\'ve practiced doing the up and\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000\r\non of the side Vault the next thing is\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000\r\nthe off the other side so this is\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000\r\narguably the easier part you\'re just\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000\r\ndropping down but you want to be facing\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000\r\nthe same way as you exit as well so from\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000\r\nhere up and down still facing the same\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000\r\nway you don\'t want to be turned out or\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000\r\naway it\'s sideways you\'re still facing\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000\r\nforwards uh land two feet to begin with\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000\r\nyou can as you exit go one two later on\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000\r\nwhen there\'s more momentum but for now\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000\r\njust land 2 feet take off two feet and\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000\r\nthis is the up on and\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,000\r\nover up and down\r\n\r\n'),(53157,55454,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(53158,55454,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJBOtAKzFDSMetODRTxlUbQa1cCx\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735838518,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"Practicing the side vault involves mastering the technique of both ascending and descending smoothly. After successfully executing the upward aspect of the vault, the next step is the descent on the opposite side. This phase is considered relatively easier, as it primarily involves dropping down from the elevated position. However, maintaining a forward-facing orientation during the exit is crucial to ensure proper landing dynamics.nnAs you prepare for the descent, it is essential to align your body in the same direction as the exit. A correct approach involves keeping your body posture forward and straight as you navigate the landing. Initially, the focus should be on landing on both feet, emphasizing balance and control. This foundational technique serves as the groundwork for more advanced movements, where you may eventually incorporate a staggered landing as your skills progress and more momentum is gained.nnIn summary, the side vault technique requires practice not only in the ascent but also in mastering a controlled descent. The emphasis should be on maintaining directional alignment while landing, starting with a two-foot landing before evolving into a more dynamic approach as skill improves. Establishing these basics is vital for further development in vaulting.nnKey Points:n1. Proper technique for the side vault includes mastering both ascent and descent.n2. Maintaining a forward-facing position during the descent is critical for balance and control.n3. Start with two-foot landings, progressing to more dynamic movements as skills develop.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 587,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 276,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 863,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Eo9tNbj5y1YXPVKytNO5jjB2vADea3cxxSvGCZsRk2o-1735838523-1.0.1.1-tPerpldopOQyqLf9EF2MvylWJFrSRnAWEC6M7VrRxMIYJ7NZmsonaGpbftFU_TMHsR3GYYNL2V7EhvK8yOOCxg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840323,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"u1tWHJquoyPpUH3KgXJ4DccLMCxByca4Sa61TGZzPwQ-1735838523265-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(53159,55454,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(53160,55454,'video_transcript_chatgpt','Practicing the side vault involves mastering the technique of both ascending and descending smoothly. After successfully executing the upward aspect of the vault, the next step is the descent on the opposite side. This phase is considered relatively easier, as it primarily involves dropping down from the elevated position. However, maintaining a forward-facing orientation during the exit is crucial to ensure proper landing dynamics.\r\n\r\nAs you prepare for the descent, it is essential to align your body in the same direction as the exit. A correct approach involves keeping your body posture forward and straight as you navigate the landing. Initially, the focus should be on landing on both feet, emphasizing balance and control. This foundational technique serves as the groundwork for more advanced movements, where you may eventually incorporate a staggered landing as your skills progress and more momentum is gained.\r\n\r\nIn summary, the side vault technique requires practice not only in the ascent but also in mastering a controlled descent. The emphasis should be on maintaining directional alignment while landing, starting with a two-foot landing before evolving into a more dynamic approach as skill improves. Establishing these basics is vital for further development in vaulting.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Proper technique for the side vault includes mastering both ascent and descent.\r\n2. Maintaining a forward-facing position during the descent is critical for balance and control.\r\n3. Start with two-foot landings, progressing to more dynamic movements as skills develop.'),(53161,55454,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(53162,55454,'svg_id',''),(53163,55454,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(53164,55454,'svg_colour',''),(53165,55454,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(53166,55454,'extra_variables',''),(53167,55454,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(53168,55454,'notes',''),(53169,55454,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(53170,55454,'enable_youtube_api',''),(53171,55454,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(53172,55454,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(53173,55454,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(53174,55454,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(53175,55454,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(53176,55454,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(53177,55454,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(53178,55454,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(53179,55454,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(53180,55454,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(53181,55454,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(53182,55454,'enable_transcript',''),(53183,55454,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(53184,55454,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(53185,55454,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(53186,55454,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(53187,55454,'_transcript_c