start\": 37.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.96\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"it for like a millisecond but not\",\r\n        \"start\": 40.16,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.76\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"collapsing is going to be key you want\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to be solid on the arms arms can be\",\r\n        \"start\": 46.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.279\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"slightly bent and it gives you time to\",\r\n        \"start\": 49.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.44\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"travel over the top so again hands on\",\r\n        \"start\": 53.199,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.921\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the outside hand on the inside and up\",\r\n        \"start\": 55.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.559\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and over so you\'re still facing the same\",\r\n        \"start\": 60.12,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"way going from one side to the other\",\r\n        \"start\": 62.519,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.161\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"traveling uh onto your side so that\",\r\n        \"start\": 65.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"would be the side Vault over a wall\",\r\n        \"start\": 68.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.84\r\n    }\r\n]'),(53477,55456,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(53478,55456,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000\r\nwe\'ve practiced going over a rail with\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000\r\nthe side Vault now it\'s to get over a\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000\r\nwall or a vault or anything an obstacle\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000\r\nthat is wider and you know as wide as a\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000\r\nbrick wall so same things apply you\'re\r\