we\'re moving our\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000\r\nright hand around to grab the bar on the\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000\r\nopposite side but as we do so we\'re\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,000\r\ndropping both feet\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000\r\nLanding same time facing the rail as you\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000\r\ngo okay so this is really going to get\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000\r\nus used to getting around getting that\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000\r\nturn nice and comfortable so we\'re\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000\r\nLanding in a good position on both feet\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:00,000\r\nlet\'s go the other direction so step up\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000\r\nhere and drop both hands both feet\r\n\r\n'),(54480,55463,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(54481,55463,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJhKBuu5a7OCLlCKLMz0OkOUsXMG\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735840498,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The exercise focuses on improving the technique for the turn vault, specifically by aiming to land on both feet simultaneously. As the practice unfolds, participants are instructed to prioritize the mechanics of the jump and landing rather than fixating on a specific target. The steps involve pushing through, coordinating the turn, and ensuring that both feet touch down at the same time while facing the designated rail.nnTo successfully execute this movement, participants are encouraged to use their right hand to grasp the bar while concurrently managing their foot placement. This requires a coordinated effort to drop both feet down in unison. The ultimate goal is to achieve a comfortable turn while landing in a stable position, which is essential for safety and effectiveness during the vault.nnMoving forward, the exercise also involves practicing in the opposite direction to diversify skills and reinforces the technique learned earlier. The emphasis is on consistency and control throughout the process, ensuring that participants can replicate the skill confidently in different scenarios.nnKey Points:n1. The focus is on landing on both feet simultaneously during the turn vault.n2. Participants must coordinate hand movements and foot placements during the jump.n3. Practicing in both directions aids in skill diversification and overall technique improvement.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 657,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 236,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 893,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"4BBbzt8.XikJ7LgVkQ3PaHUb3DYRpTY9M2F5SSl3BGg-1735840501-1.0.1.1-6EoM_m9rYP1X6iHTxeaS2L6_YEz5E62.rDESuG3hwFk4.xcAIJIRrHh7VYwku8ymfoyP8BojZmjn_iYVcyyfRQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842301,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"XL7XGxgTLH4_WTSneVwh1_oZelYzBK0KB6IzXJx2fs4-1735840501932-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(54482,55463,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(54483,55463,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The exercise focuses on improving the technique for the turn vault, specifically by aiming to land on both feet simultaneously. As the practice unfolds, participants are instructed to prioritize the mechanics of the jump and landing rather than fixating on a specific target. The steps involve pushing through, coordinating the turn, and ensuring that both feet touch down at the same time while facing the designated rail.\r\n\r\nTo successfully execute this movement, participants are encouraged to use their right hand to grasp the bar while concurrently managing their foot placement. This requires a coordinated effort to drop both feet down in unison. The ultimate goal is to achieve a comfortable turn while landing in a stable position, which is essential for safety and effectiveness during the vault.\r\n\r\nMoving forward, the exercise also involves practicing in the opposite direction to diversify skills and reinforces the technique learned earlier. The emphasis is on consistency and control throughout the process, ensuring that participants can replicate the skill confidently in different scenarios.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The focus is on landing on both feet simultaneously during the turn vault.\r\n2. Participants must coordinate hand movements and foot placements during the jump.\r\n3. Practicing in both directions aids in skill diversification and overall technique improvement.'),(54484,55463,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(54485,55463,'svg_id',''),(54486,55463,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(54487,55463,'svg_colour',''),(54488,55463,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(54489,55463,'extra_variables',''),(54490,55463,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(54491,55463,'notes',''),(54492,55463,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(54493,55463,'enable_youtube_api',''),(54494,55463,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(54495,55463,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(54496,55463,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(54497,55463,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(54498,55463,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(54499,55463,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(54500,55463,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(54501,55463,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(54502,55463,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(54503,55463,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(54504,55463,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(54505,55463,'enable_transcript',''),(54506,55463,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(54507,55463,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(54508,55463,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(54509,55463,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(54510,55463,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(54511,55463,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(54512,55463,'video_filename','Vaulting-TurnVault/Tutorial-vaulting-turn_vault-2-step-turn-drop.mp4'),(54513,55463,'_video_filename','field_677cead91f698'),(54514,55463,'portrait_thumbnail_image','Vaulting-TurnVault/screenshots/Tuto