step towards mastering the more complex turn vault.n2. Focus is placed on hand positioning and body alignment to execute the vault effectively.n3. Preparing with side vaults builds confidence and skill before transitioning to more advanced movements.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 975,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 290,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1265,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Vlb6slGxdR2Zk4fZADpcjldnJew3As.xuXwN7DokAZw-1735840495-1.0.1.1-vj71K770lTLYinvLVbUxHtbJcOPfCWvEc3HxFC.TNN6qvw7VUqi6lQJcsJSRSFNU6Ni2rvvWeDcwEFNWssnQEA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842295,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"9tt8Q710FQddACCKAObsXvaP2XOWx1caYNfpq19Kulc-1735840495908-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(54656,55464,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(54657,55464,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The focus of the discussion revolves around the execution of a side vault, which acts as a preliminary step toward mastering the more complex turn vault. The side vault involves approaching the bar from the side and executing a 90-degree turn while maintaining hand placement before transitioning to a different grip on the other side. This technique prepares individuals to perform a full turn vault, where they will need to let go of the bar during the maneuver and then re-grab it upon landing.\r\n\r\nIn practicing this side vault, specific attention is given to hand positioning and body alignment during the jump. The process encourages individuals to practice their jumping technique beforehand, allowing them to become comfortable with the mechanics required to clear the bar. Ultimately, this step will build confidence and ensure that they can achieve a successful landing on both feet while facing the intended direction.\r\n\r\nRevisiting the mechanics of the side vault serves as an essential practice mechanism before progressing to the turn vault. The focus is not only on the jump but also on proper technique and body control as they prepare to navigate the more challenging movements with precision and safety. This foundational practice is crucial in developing the right skills needed for successful gymnastic performance.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The side vault serves as a foundational step towards mastering the more complex turn vault.\r\n2. Focus is placed on hand positioning and body alignment to execute the vault effectively.\r\n3. Preparing with side vaults builds confidence and skill before transitioning to more advanced movements.'),(54658,55464,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(54659,55464,'svg_id',''),(54660,55464,'_svg