0,000 --> 00:01:06,000\r\nwhere Landing both feet on that curb so\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:64,000 --> 00:01:08,000\r\nnow we\'re really close to doing the full\r\n\r\n22\r\n00:00:66,000 --> 00:01:12,000\r\nturn Vault uh we just need to now\r\n\r\n23\r\n00:00:68,000 --> 00:01:15,000\r\nincrease the angle so you\'re doing 180°\r\n\r\n24\r\n00:00:72,000 --> 00:01:15,000\r\nrather than 90°\r\n\r\n'),(54831,55465,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(54832,55465,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJh6vaNQ2UW8miy72zge0OeIhHOn\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735840484,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The focus of this session is on executing the side vault technique, transitioning into a precise turn vault. The aim is to master the landing on a curb\'s edge, which requires greater accuracy and controlled descent compared to previous attempts. Participants are guided to identify suitable rails that connect to a curb to enhance their practice setup.nnAs the instruction progresses, attention is given to the importance of both hands and feet landing securely on the designated area while maintaining control. It is emphasized that finding rails attached to curbs is common, and these structures serve to limit movement beyond certain boundaries. Practicing the side vault followed by the turn vault is encouraged, ensuring that both feet land on the curb seamlessly.nnTowards the end of the session, the goal is set to complete a full turn vault with an increased angle of 180 degrees instead of the previously aimed 90 degrees. This gradual escalation in difficulty is outlined as a natural progression toward mastering the turn vault technique, creating a stronger foundation for more advanced movements in the future.nnKey Points:n1. The session emphasizes mastering the side vault technique and transitioning into a precise turn vault.n2. Precision in landing on a curb\'s edge is crucial, requiring accurate control and descent.n3. Gradual progression in difficulty is encouraged, culminating in a 180-degree turn vault for improved skill development.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 913,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 264,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1177,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Jx5xGL0i3GFQ6VVn8jGXRiQLkCaDL4H6.6GuQB9fUlo-1735840488-1.0.1.1-d3Wawyy7WuHc4PK78ClR8sv7BT6WOJVLzFKDI1vETVDDju8dtni6A0VJttqRKCrEm20KdOovV2qNFO_IjAHgFw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842288,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"gaGlN2ho7ps2LqC1P9e0YZfH7uvJxhFOhPFsMPF.TCk-1735840488856-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(54833,55465,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(54834,55465,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The focus of this session is on executing the side vault technique, transitioning into a precise turn vault. The aim is to master the landing on a curb\'s edge, which requires greater accuracy and controlled descent compared to previous attempts. Participants are guided to identify suitable rails that connect to a curb to enhance their practice setup.\r\n\r\nAs the instruction progresses, attention is given to the importance of both hands and feet landing securely on the designated area while maintaining control. It is emphasized that finding rails attached to curbs is common, and these structures serve to limit movement beyond certain boundaries. Practicing the side vault followed by the turn vault is encouraged, ensuring that both feet land on the curb seamlessly.\r\n\r\nTowards the end of the session, the goal is set to complete a full turn vault with an increased angle of 180 degrees instead of the previously aimed 90 degrees. This gradual escalation in difficulty is outlined as a natural progression toward mastering the turn vault technique, creating a stronger foundation for more advanced movements in the future.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The session emphasizes mastering the side vault technique and transitioning into a precise turn vault.\r\n2. Precision in landing on a curb\'s edge is crucial, requiring accurate control and descent.\r\n3. Gradual progression in difficulty is encouraged, culminating in a 180-degree turn vault for improved skill development.'),(54835,55465,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(54836,55465,'svg_id',''),(54837,55465,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(54838