 to provide stability. The emphasis is on smooth and precise movements that contribute to a successful landing.nnUltimately, mastering the turn vault is depicted as a crucial skill within parkour. Achieving a comfortable execution of this maneuver not only enhances personal proficiency but also serves as a foundational element in the practice of parkour overall.nnKey points:n1. Precision during the landing is essential for a successful turn vault.n2. The inside hand must remain in contact throughout the vault for safety.n3. Mastery of the turn vault is a foundational skill in the practice of parkour.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 904,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 243,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1147,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ei0YsiOqJ5SemIPyMTeOo1G1fGctwXidDsigZjFNMTw-1735840474-1.0.1.1-bnG_PCJSvTY4nuwV9KLk8Uv.GgAKrr.LyoGNQcRJQoTOeWPH89wU7uW1lHKkIrzv07I0HnSwG4J2Hnt0MB3Rig\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842274,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"6jRCM3o5CHnmxpr6hvJbHmV.E6nA9RY9caTwX.HF1bg-1735840474765-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(55203,55467,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(55204,55467,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The focus of this discussion is on executing a turn vault in parkour, with a strong emphasis on precision during the landing phase. The technique begins with proper positioning—one hand raised and the other down—to facilitate a two-foot takeoff. The gymnast must execute a 180-degree turn in a tight arc, using the inside arm as momentum while aiming for a controlled landing on the opposite wall.\r\n\r\nKey elements of the turn vault include a secure grip with the inside hand and ensuring both feet land simultaneously on the ball of the foot. Maintaining bent arms during the execution is essential for safety, as the inside hand should remain in contact throughout the movement to provide stability. The emphasis is on smooth and precise movements that contribute to a successful landing.\r\n\r\nUltimately, mastering the turn vault is depicted as a crucial skill within parkour. Achieving a comfortable execution of this maneuver not only enhances personal proficiency but also serves as a foundational element in the practice of parkour overall.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Precision during the landing is essential for a successful turn vault.\r\n2. The inside hand must remain in contact throughout the vault for safety.\r\n3. Mastery of the turn vault is a foundational skill in the practice of parkour.'),(55205,55467,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(55206,55467,'svg_id',''),(55207,55467,'_