low.nnWhen performing the turn vault, it\'s essential to maintain proper hand positioning for stability and control. The left hand should be positioned under the right hand while approaching the turn, which helps maintain contact and balance. This technique aids in executing a safer landing on the wall, providing room for adjustments if the jump doesn\'t go as planned.nnGradual progression is key to mastering the turn vault, as doing so allows individuals to adapt to real-world scenarios involving height differences and drops. With practice, one can gain the necessary skills to navigate more challenging situations confidently. Overall, comfortability with the technique plays a significant role in ensuring safety and effectiveness during execution.nn**Key Points:**n1. The turn vault is essential for building confidence when jumping over a drop.n2. Proper hand positioning and technique are critical for a successful landing.n3. Gradual progression in height fosters comfort and skill, preparing for real-world challenges.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1295,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 245,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1540,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"kEY3PsO6DPqBB9NStCYwNAsrmKs8.Thh8oJNXJhWBnk-1735840469-1.0.1.1-CChBm2PgjHqW.kq9mpIeFtBmVsDIxBCaWfnszZhJbLyzZRCwW3EDGsi6_aacQpSBNnsIkZlkdh.i0B1kOHOG.Q\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842269,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"3hPLto0UFVsUtxnP.oRfRztYgcwAeX3I1uxk_1RUkGg-1735840469408-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(55380,55468,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(55381,55468,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The turn vault is a crucial skill in gymnastics, especially when performing over a drop. The importance lies in gradually increasing the heights of the jumps to build confidence and control while executing the maneuver. By practicing the turn vault, one can ensure they are more comfortable landing on a wall instead of potentially falling into a gap below.\r\n\r\nWhen performing the turn vault, it\'s essential to maintain proper hand positioning for stability and control. The left hand should be positioned under the right hand while approaching the turn, which helps maintain contact and balance. This technique aids in executing a safer landing on the wall, providing room for adjustments if the jump doesn\'t go as planned.\r\n\r\nGradual progression is key to mastering the turn vault, as doing so allows individuals to adapt to real-world scenarios involving height differences and drops. With practice, one can gain the necessary skills to navigate more challenging situations confidently. Overall, comfortability with the technique plays a significant role in ensuring safety and effectiveness during execution.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The turn vault is essential for building confidence when jumping over a drop.\r\n2. Proper hand positioning and technique are critical for a successful landing.\r\n3. Gradual progression in height fosters comfort and skill, preparing for real-world challenges.'),(55382,55468,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(55383,55468,'svg_id',''),(55384,55468,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(55385,55468,'svg_colour',''),(55386,55468,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(55387,55468,'extra_variables',''),(55388,55468,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(55389,55468,'notes',''),(55390,55468,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(55391,55468,'enable_youtube_api',''),(55392,55468,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(55393,55468,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(55394,55468,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(55395,55468,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(55396,55468,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(55397,55468,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(55398,55468,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(55399,55468,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(55400,55468,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(55401,55468,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(55402,55468,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(55403,55468,'enable_transcript',''),(55404,55468,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(55405,55468,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(55406,55468,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(55407,55468,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(55408,55468,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(55409,55468,'rank_