 fundamental mechanics include an arm jump and cat position to manage the descent and maintain control during the maneuver. nnKey aspects of the turn vault include the foot placement against the wall instead of on a solid surface, which requires adeptness and adaptability. The hand positioning is crucial; the left hand supports while the right hand transitions to guide the body safely into the intended position. Practicing this technique emphasizes the adjustment of body weight and momentum during the movement, contributing to a more fluid performance.nnThis vault technique is not only about execution but also about building confidence in descending and controlling one’s trajectory. It engages core strength and coordination and serves as an essential skill for progressing in vaulting. As one practices the turn vault to arm jump position, they effectively enhance their overall vaulting skills and adaptability in various environments.nn**Key Points:**n1. The turn vault is essential for maneuvering around obstacles at height, utilizing techniques like an arm jump and cat position.n2. Proper foot and hand placement is vital for controlling descent and ensuring a smooth transition.n3. Practicing this technique builds confidence, enhances vaulting skills, and improves overall agility and coordination.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1214,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 289,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1503,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"zMoTiC7gZguk98zeh0Y1NicV1mcJQASRBGpSkmBGSEA-1735840461-1.0.1.1-YYCDpVoirX5a2evhUnuUDzlt4uJriWDTXXWPkpiijVaoPWgeDnMIkSgol47XmDDst290adDAWBCgUcbGjZgsKQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735842261,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"_plerxZBLVRFvZONKvS8C6KqRyAaXfTylONBAvZXT70-1735840461395-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(55539,55469,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(55540,55469,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The technique described focuses on the turn vault, which is often utilized in situations involving height and needing to maneuver around a barrier, such as a rail at the top of a wall. This movement enables a performer to transition smoothly to the side of a wall by leveraging their body position and balance. The fundamental mechanics include an arm jump and cat position to manage the descent and maintain control during the maneuver. \r\n\r\nKey aspects of the turn vault include the foot placement against the wall instead of on a solid surface, which requires adeptness and adaptability. The hand positioning is crucial; the left hand supports while the right hand transitions to guide the body safely into the intended position. Practicing this technique emphasizes the adjustment of body weight and momentum during the movement, contributing to a more fluid performance.\r\n\r\nThis vault technique is not only about execution but also about building confidence in descending and controlling one’s trajectory. It engages core strength and coordination and serves as an essential skill for progressing in vaulting. As one practices the turn vault to arm jump position, they effectively enhance their overall vaulting skills and adaptability in various environments.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The turn vault is essential for maneuvering around obstacles at height, utilizing techniques like an arm jump and cat position.\r\n2. Proper foot and hand placement is vital for controlling descent and ensuring a smooth transition.\r\n3. Practicing this technique builds confidence, enhances vaulting skills, and improves overall agility and coordination.'),(55541,55469,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(55542,55469,'svg_id',''),(55543,55469,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(55544,55469,'svg_colour',''),(55545,55469,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(55546,55469,'extra_variables',''),(55547,55469,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(55548,55469,'notes',''),(55549,55469,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(55550,55469,'enable_youtube_api',''),(55551,55469,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(55552,55469,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(55553,55469,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(55554,55469,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(55555,55469,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(55556,55469,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(55557,55469,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(55558,55469,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(55559,55469,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(55560,55469,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(55561,55469,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_6722