deo_youtube_data_description','field_67222e14397d2'),(56514,55475,'video_youtube_data_description_filtered',''),(56515,55475,'_video_youtube_data_description_filtered','field_672253e91cdc8'),(56516,55475,'video_chatgpt_response',''),(56517,55475,'_video_chatgpt_response','field_67221dc82655d'),(56518,55475,'video_chatgpt_response_text',''),(56519,55475,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(56520,55475,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"we\'ve practiced the step Vault up and\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.24\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"step Vault down we\'ve practiced on\",\r\n        \"start\": 7.919,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.201\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"sitting on a wide uh wall now we\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 10.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.12\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to do the same thing but not place\",\r\n        \"start\": 15.12,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.12\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"our foot on so instead of placing it up\",\r\n        \"start\": 18.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.159\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"we\'re going to go straight over and land\",\r\n        \"start\": 22.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.72\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"on the right foot so remember right leg\",\r\n        \"start\": 25.119,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.4\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"back is going to swing up over and land\",\r\n        \"start\": 27.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 7\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"now straight onto the other\",\r\n        \"start\": 31.519,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"side and down okay so big\",\r\n        \"start\": 34.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.96\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"swing same thing instead of touching\",\r\n        \"start\": 39.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.961\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"here I\'m Just landing on the other\",\r\n        \"start\": 42.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"side okay this is now the slide Vault\",\r\n        \"start\": 47.36,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.039\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and it\'s the full thing get used to this\",\r\n        \"start\": 50.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"this is actually fairly high for a slide\",\r\n        \"start\": 54.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.081\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Vault but you can practice on something\",\r\n        \"start\": 56.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.44\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"lower so you get used to going over it\",\r\n        \"start\": 59.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.399\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you don\'t have to push so hard do it on\",\r\n        \"start\": 61.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.879\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"a wall do it on a vault box do it on\",\r\n        \"start\": 64.879,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.521\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"anything you can but the idea is to get\",\r\n        \"start\": 66.799,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.841\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"used to that swing up and over now\",\r\n        \"start\": 69.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.24\r\n    }\r\n]'),(56521,55475,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(56522,55475,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000\r\nwe\'ve practiced the step Vault up and\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000\r\nstep Vault down we\'ve practiced on\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:18,000\r\nsitting on a wide uh wall now we\'re\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000\r\ngoing to do the same thing but not place\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000\r\nour foot on so instead of placing it up\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000\r\nwe\'re going to go straight over and land\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:31,000\r\non the right foot so remember right leg\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000\r\nback is going to swing up over and land\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000\r\nnow straight onto the other\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000\r\nside and down okay so big\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000\r\nswing same thing instead of touching\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000\r\nhere I\'m Just landing on the other\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000\r\nside okay this is now the slide Vault\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000\r\nand it\'s the full thing get used to this\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000\r\nthis is actually fairly high for a slide\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000\r\nVault but you can practice on something\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000\r\nlower so you get used to going over it\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:61,000 --> 00:01:05,000\r\nyou don\'t have to push so hard do it on\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:64,000 --> 00:01:08,000\r\na wall do it on a vault box do it on\r\n\r\n20\r\n00:00:66,000 --> 00:01:13,000\r\nanything you can but the idea is to get\r\n\r\n21\r\n00:00:69,000 --> 00:01:14,000\r\nused to that swing up and over now\r\n\r\n'),(56523,55475,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(56524,55475,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJL5i2XFq49hTJxG0K1cjascekAL\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735839119,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The training session focuses on practicing vaulting techniques, particularly the step vault and slide vault. Initially, participants are instructed on how to practice vaulting both up and down while sitting on a wide wall. The emphasis is on improving their movement by going over obstacles without placing their feet down, which involves coordinating their body movements, especially swinging their back leg upward and landing correctly on the opposite side.nnAs they progress, the instructions shift to practicing the full slide vault technique. This involves executing a swing and landing effectively without touching the surface they are vaulting over. It is noted that while the height of the slide vault can be challenging, practitioners are encouraged to start with lower obstacles to build confidence and refine their technique. This gradual approach helps them adapt to the feel of the movement without overexerting themselves.nnThe session ends with advice on finding suitable objects for practice, such as a wall or a vault box, to help familiarize themselves with the vaulting action. The overarching goal is to master the swing motion and ensure a smooth transition over the obstacles, reinforcing the importance of adaptability and confidence in executing vaults effectively.nn**Key Points:**n1. The training involves practicing various vaulting techniques, focusing on movement and landing without using feet on obstacles.n2. Participants are encouraged to start with lower vaults to build confidence before attempting higher surfaces.n3. The emphasis is on mastering the swing motion for a smooth vault transition, with recommendations for suitable practice objects.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 807,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 293,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1100,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"fEmgETN4FXhEJElvRsD1IPlC6kFuCuwemfh.KdvUXMs-1735839123-1.0.1.1-E.J02OGelGfXvjOMIigWGpE2qsiAIDKIxATaJW.ydI6sRvl.xABdWCRLvSXMtKSc9Ic0HWbQ.h1nHUSyB1JvfQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840923,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"gSGQvuQzv1zv3.7ut_eaxrup1otCyG3LPPjtF_8cFq4-1735839123255-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(56525,55475,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(56526,55475,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The training session focuses on practicing vaulting techniques, particularly the step vault and slide vault. Initially, participants are instructed on how to practice vaulting both up and down while sitting on a wide wall. The emphasis is on improving their movement by going over obstacles without placing their feet down, which involves coordinating their body movements, especially swinging their back leg upward and landing correctly on the opposite side.\r\n\r\nAs they progress, the instructions shift to practicing the full slide vault technique. This involves executing a swing and landing effectively without touching the surface they are vaulting over. It is noted that while the height of the slide vault can be challenging, practitioners are encouraged to start with lower obstacles to build confidence and refine their technique. This gradual approach helps them adapt to the feel of the movement without overexerting themselves.\r\n\r\nThe session ends with advice on finding suitable objects for practice, such as a wall or a vault box, to help familiarize themselves with the vaulting action. The overarching goal is to master the swing motion and ensure a smooth transition over the obstacles, reinforcing the importance of adaptability and confidence in executing vaults effectively.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The training involves practicing various vaulting techniques, focusing on movement and landing without using feet on obstacles.\r\n2. Participants are encouraged to start with lower vaults to build confidence before attempting higher surfaces.\r\n3. The emphasis is on mastering the swing motion for a smooth vault transition, with recommendations for suitable practice objects.'),(56527,55475,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(56528,55475,'svg_id',''),(56529,55475,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(56530,55475,'svg_colour',''),(56531,55475,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(56532,55475,'extra_variables',''),(56533,55475,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(56534,55475,'enable_youtube_api',''),(56535,55475,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(56536,55475,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(56537,55475,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(56538,55475,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(56539,55475,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(56540,55475,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(56541,55475,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(56542,55475,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(56543,55475,'_enable_use_as_e