xperienced when not executing the move correctly, serves as a caution to focus on technique.\r\n\r\nOverall, the key points of this execution method include the importance of correct body positioning; particularly how the hand should be placed behind the body for smooth transitions on the rail. The need for precise leg movement and maintaining forward momentum is crucial. Lastly, recognizing pitfalls, such as improper hand placement and the resulting awkward movements, is essential for successfully performing the vault slide.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The vault slide technique requires accurate hand placement and body positioning to execute effectively on different surfaces.\r\n2. Proper leg movement is crucial for differentiating between an effective vault and a lazy execution.\r\n3. Awareness of common mistakes, such as incorrect hand movement, can help enhance performance and maintain forward momentum during the trick.'),(56711,55476,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(56712,55476,'svg_id',''),(56713,55476,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(56714,55476,'svg_colour',''),(56715,55476,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(56716,55476,'extra_variables',''),(56717,55476,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(56718,55476,'notes',''),(56719,55476,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(56720,55476,'enable_youtube_api',''),(56721,55476,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(56722,55476,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(56723,55476,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(56724,55476,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(56725,55476,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(56726,55476,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(56727,55476,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(56728,55476,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(56729,55476,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(56730,55476,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(56731,55476,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411')