nts. The technique requires switching hand positions in a way that helps generate momentum for subsequent actions. This emphasis on the upper body support allows for better stability throughout the movement, ensuring that the athlete can effectively manage the physical dynamics of the vault.nnFinally, practicing the slide vault in pairs is recommended as a method to grasp the flow of the movement. It not only aids in building the necessary skills but also enhances the enjoyment of performing the vaults. Engaging in consecutive movements helps in understanding the coordination of feet and hands, making the overall execution more natural and dynamic, which adds to the thrill of incorporating these techniques into a routine.nn**Key Points:**n1. The slide vault requires proper leg positioning and timing for effective transitions.n2. Hand placement is critical for maintaining balance and generating momentum during the movement.n3. Practicing consecutive vaults enhances skill development and enjoyment in executing the technique.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1328,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 299,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1627,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ppA2vR1mEVpQ1rk9xQi87oAIe32uMmgBgBhBuHxjUro-1735838990-1.0.1.1-.l.OkN4Tcdvehq56nAJ.JzXjh489XYteISmpGJhVRqKenDsAmyKtfPlznqPKQGNNmIYttuj_q8gJw0SolFhyTQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840790,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"0tArTFJ7IjA1BMQt9n3xD9B3PzLi81UKei6sfHdLmTQ-1735838990351-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(56872,55477,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(56873,55477,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion focuses on executing a specific movement known as the slide vault in gymnastics or parkour. The technique involves landing on one leg while positioning the other leg appropriately to facilitate a quick transition into another vault. The emphasis is on synchronization and timing, particularly how to land the left leg on one side and then use it to initiate another move with the right lead. The speaker suggests practicing this sequence continuously to enhance fluidity and confidence in executing the maneuver.\r\n\r\nMoreover, the importance of hand placement during the vault is highlighted. The hands play a crucial role in maintaining balance and control, especially when transitioning between movements. The technique requires switching hand positions in a way that helps generate momentum for subsequent actions. This emphasis on the upper body support allows for better stability throughout the movement, ensuring that the athlete can effectively manage the physical dynamics of the vault.\r\n\r\nFinally, practicing the slide vault in pairs is recommended as a method to grasp the flow of the movement. It not only aids in building the necessary skills but also enhances the enjoyment of performing the vaults. Engaging in consecutive movements helps in understanding the coordination of feet and hands, making the overall execution more natural and dynamic, which adds to the thrill of incorporating these techniques into a routine.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The slide vault requires proper leg positioning and timing for effective transitions.\r\n2. Hand placement is critical for maintaining balance and generating momentum during the movement.\r\n3. Practicing consecutive vaults enhances skill development and enjoyment in executing the technique.'),(56874,55477,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(56875,55477,'svg_id',''),(56876,55477,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(56877,55477,'svg_colour',''),(56878,55477,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(56879,55477,'extra_variables',''),(56880,55477,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(56881,55477,'notes',''),(56882,55477,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(56883,55477,'enable_youtube_api',''),(56884,55477,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(56885,55477,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(56886,55477,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(56887,55477,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(56888,55477,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(56889,55477,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(56890,55477,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(56891,55477,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(56892,55477,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(56893,55477,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(56894,55477,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(56895,55477,'enable_transcript',''),(56896,55477,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(56897,55477,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(568