nimal hesitation. Ultimately, the foundational aspect of the slide vault rests on maintaining that cyclical rhythm of swinging back and forth.nnKey Points:n1. Mastering the slide vault requires establishing a rhythm focused on repetitive back and forward body movements.n2. Practicing in sets aids in solidifying this rhythm and enhances performance.n3. Success in executing the slide vault is more about consistency in movement rather than the number of repetitions.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 538,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 265,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 803,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ADo4xW42xXk9dVwDLFyVIsdXenTzAzBGcpafj_BDJUE-1735838968-1.0.1.1-au4qmQ8zKWziI74ulmIn9O3BzKRoXUXSaKUkEymzTFqBPXCZdld8KAJgO9YtIknEJ3qYFY_h3UhUXlCiV_qCNQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735840768,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"H7gIoBORVf.9JjStOIt5PHQjg3oO2SH4Ge2ZzvZeg7c-1735838968192-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(57434,55481,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(57435,55481,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The technique of performing the slide vault involves developing a rhythm that focuses on the back and forward movement of the body. Once the foundational steps are established, executing multiple slide vaults becomes a matter of repetition and maintaining consistent body movement. The emphasis lies on refining one\'s ability to swing back and forth effectively, constructing a smooth flow in the execution of the move.\r\n\r\nPracticing the slide vault in sets can help solidify this rhythm, as evidenced by the suggestion to try performing four consecutive vaults. The process isn\'t necessarily about varying techniques but rather getting comfortable with the repetition. This consistency in practice is crucial for mastering the dynamics of the movement and enhances overall performance.\r\n\r\nMoreover, there\'s an understanding that the number of vaults isn\'t as important as establishing a rhythm that translates well into each performance. The more one engages in this practice, the more intuitive the motion becomes, allowing for greater completion of the moves with minimal hesitation. Ultimately, the foundational aspect of the slide vault rests on maintaining that cyclical rhythm of swinging back and forth.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Mastering the slide vault requires establishing a rhythm focused on repetitive back and forward body movements.\r\n2. Practicing in sets aids in solidifying this rhythm and enhances performance.\r\n3. Success in executing the slide vault is more about consistency in movement rather than the number of repetiti