especially regarding the thumb position and hand grasp, is vital for achieving the correct technique and landing safely after the vault.nnWhen attempting the lazy vault, it is important to emphasize the inside leg\'s position, which should come up and over as you perform the switch to the opposite hand. This movement not only enhances control but also contributes to the overall fluidity of the motion. Practicing the transition from different angles can help solidify the technique, making it easier to adapt in real-time situations.nnTo summarize, effective execution of the lazy vault on a rail hinges on practicing hand positioning, maintaining balance through transitions, and refining the technique through repeated attempts and adjustments. With an emphasis on accuracy, the vault becomes a smoother and more controlled maneuver. nnKey points:n1. Switching hands accurately behind the back is crucial for performing the lazy vault effectively.n2. The inside leg should be lifted and positioned properly to facilitate a smooth transition.n3. Proper thumb positioning and practice can enhance control and improve overall technique in executing the vault.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1110,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 249,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1359,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"A0oapq6SzytBI7dhcpzi2Ph6pfW8PncJhMWEPBbdb0E-1735837261-1.0.1.1-jjshx_dcSwTbEWnvd6PiiYea1hxE2h9MEI_.gqZ.ZU9b69UW.kXpiHmMVaEd1hIawH_pFrtH9C5odgIyQqUoGw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839061,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"nYSttDtHkTvBbV0XWRM1oBi0sCRmV8Tao0a2tQtYNic-1735837261611-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(57765,55483,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(57766,55483,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The lazy vault technique on the rail requires careful execution, particularly when it comes to switching hands behind the back. Maintaining one hand while transitioning to the other is essential for balance and success in the maneuver. Attention to detail, especially regarding the thumb position and hand grasp, is vital for achieving the correct technique and landing safely after the vault.\r\n\r\nWhen attempting the lazy vault, it is important to emphasize the inside leg\'s position, which should come up and over as you perform the switch to the opposite hand. This movement not only enhances control but also contributes to the overall fluidity of the motion. Practicing the transition from different angles can help solidify the technique, making it easier to adapt in real-time situations.\r\n\r\nTo summarize, effective execution of the lazy vault on a rail hinges on practicing hand positioning, maintaining balance through transitions, and refining the technique through repeated attempts and adjustments. With an emphasis on accuracy, the vault becomes a smoother and more controlled maneuver. \r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Switching hands accurately behind the back is crucial for performing the lazy vault effectively.\r\n2. The inside leg should be lifted and positioned properly to facilitate a smooth transition.\r\n3. Proper thumb positioning and practice can enhance control and improve overall technique in executing the vault.'),(57767,55483,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(57768,55483,'svg_id',''),(57769,55483,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(57770,55483,'svg_colour',''),(57771,55483,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(57772,55483,'extra_variables',''),(57773,55483,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(57774,55483,'notes',''),(57775,55483,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(57776,55483,'enable_youtube_api',''),(57777,55483,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(57778,55483,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(57779,55483,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(57780,55483,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(57781,55483,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(57782,55483,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(57783,55483,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(57784,55483,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(57785,55483,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(57786,55483,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(57787,55483,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(57788,55483,'enable_transcript',''),(57789,55483,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(57790,55483,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(57791,55483,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(57792,55483,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention t