35837251,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The lazy vault technique combines running with the vaulting movement, enhancing momentum while transitioning over obstacles, such as rails and walls. This method builds off prior skills while emphasizing the importance of proper foot placement to ensure a smooth execution. Practitioners are encouraged to approach the vault with gradually increasing speed to successfully navigate the obstacle.nnIn performing the lazy vault, the inside leg should be brought over first, allowing for a fluid motion that transitions from running to vaulting seamlessly. Key to this technique is the appropriate switching of hands as one navigates the rail. It’s important to focus on maintaining momentum throughout the movement without making drastic changes that could disrupt balance.nnTo effectively master the lazy vault, individuals should focus on drills that reinforce speed and proper technique, while reminding themselves to maintain control throughout. Practicing this skill will enhance not only agility but also confidence when approaching various barriers during movement.nn**Key Points:**n1. The lazy vault integrates running with vaulting techniques, requiring proper foot placement and momentum.n2. The inside leg should be positioned correctly, with hand-switching occurring at the right moment.n3. Gradual speed increase and consistent practice are essential for mastering the lazy vault.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 675,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 238,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 913,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"_zlOqFP_l7824ZEd_YG8bENDtnHqZaZxjNInCoYQXFk-1735837256-1.0.1.1-ZvWXcBQtNTwtTss9lgWsptdFjb6kGn3TuLpSxU93vv3os05Adf8YBraMOUjI2G1Z5eJigM.gbC3r9ppG_dFHMQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839056,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"NlzGZv2u1_6O4aOV5Julo1fLKCEMiy5cMEidE9zG91o-1735837256168-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(57947,55484,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(57948,55484,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The lazy vault technique combines running with the vaulting movement, enhancing momentum while transitioning over obstacles, such as rails and walls. This method builds off prior skills while emphasizing the importance of proper foot placement to ensure a smooth execution. Practitioners are encouraged to approach the vault with gradually increasing speed to successfully navigate the obstacle.\r\n\r\nIn performing the lazy vault, the inside leg should be brought over first, allowing for a fluid motion that transitions from running to vaulting seamlessly. Key to this technique is the appropriate switching of hands as one navigates the rail. It’s important to focus on maintaining momentum throughout the movement without making drastic changes that could disrupt balance.\r\n\r\nTo effectively master the lazy vault, individuals should focus on drills that reinforce speed and proper technique, while reminding themselves to maintain control throughout. Practicing this skill will enhance not only agility but also confidence when approaching various barriers during movement.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The lazy vault integrates running with vaulting techniques, requiring proper foot placement and momentum.\r\n2. The inside leg should be positioned correctly, with hand-switching occurring at the right moment.\r\n3. Gradual speed increase and consistent practice are essential for mastering the lazy vault.'),(57949,55484,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(57950,55484,'svg_id',''),(57951,55484,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(57952,55484,'svg_colour',''),(57953,55484,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(57954,55484,'extra_variables',''),(57955,55484,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(57956,55484,'notes',''),(57957,55484,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(57958,55484,'enable_youtube_api',''),(57959,55484,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(57960,55484,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(57961,55484,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(57962,55484,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(57963,55484,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(57964,55484,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(57965,55484,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(57966,55484,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(57967,55484,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),