e wall; instead of a straight vertical run and vault as seen in traditional methods, one must kick the side of the wall with their foot to gain the necessary elevation. The wall used for this technique is typically slightly sloped rather than flat, allowing for a more dynamic push-off.nnUnderstanding the mechanics of the pop vault starts with mastering the step vault. Practitioners are encouraged to place both hands on the wall, kick against the side, and then push upwards while positioning one foot outside their hands. This series of movements aids in developing a feel for how to generate height by strategically leveraging the wall for propulsion. Central to executing the pop vault are the hips, as they play a crucial role in maximizing the jump\'s elevation.nnThe primary takeaway from this technique is the emphasis on practice and familiarity with the wall\'s angles. By perfecting the kick against the wall and the positioning of the feet, individuals can improve their overall height during the pop vault. Concentrating on hip movement and the timing of the kick will ultimately lead to a more successful and higher jump.nnKey Points:n1. The pop vault technique involves kicking the side of the wall instead of the traditional vertical approach.n2. Mastery of the step vault is essential for successfully executing the pop vault.n3. The height gained from the maneuver is largely dependent on proper hip movement and kick timing.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 906,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 309,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1215,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"S_5C.tVmvL63FrzSfENkd2H2q7UoOn_ytjP1K9nSZdI-1735838043-1.0.1.1-nHXug6HNnJk5H.7fwP0xXjK5BqZZM5rUayAPxeNaJ6SHvWgl.eUhQDumI.GLcjGMKc5Z_LBfoJhI6KlDCku4UA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839843,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"BUgXeLz_0DYatQCuxP6kLfTqU7btfWSj2Rt1tN0R4mI-1735838043932-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(58951,55492,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(58952,55492,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The discussion focuses on the technique of executing a pop vault, which involves utilizing a wall for additional height during the jump. The key aspect of this maneuver is the runner\'s approach to the wall; instead of a straight vertical run and vault as seen in traditional methods, one must kick the side of the wall with their foot to gain the necessary elevation. The wall used for this technique is typically slightly sloped rather than flat, allowing for a more dynamic push-off.\r\n\r\nUnderstanding the mechanics of the pop vault starts with mastering the step vault. Practitioners are encouraged to place both hands on the wall, kick against the side, and then push upwards while positioning one foot outside their hands. This series of movements aids in developing a feel for how to generate height by strategically leveraging the wall for propulsion. Central to executing the pop vault are the hips, as they play a crucial role in maximizing the jump\'s elevation.\r\n\r\nThe primary takeaway from this technique is the emphasis on practice and familiarity with the wall\'s angles. By perfecting the kick against the wall and the positioning of the feet, individuals can improve their overall height during the pop vault. Concentrating on hip movement and the timing of the kick will ultimately lead to a more successful and higher jump.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The pop vault technique involves kicking the side of the wall instead of the traditional vertical approach.\r\n2. Mastery of the step vault is essential for successfully executing the pop vault.\r\n3. The height gained from the maneuver is largely dependent on proper hip movement and kick timing.'),(58953,55492,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(58954,55492,'svg_id',''),(58955,55492,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(58956,55492,'svg_colour',''),(58957,55492,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(58958,55492,'extra_variables',''),(58959,55492,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(58960,55492,'notes',''),(58961,55492,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(58962,55492,'enable_youtube_api',''),(58963,55492,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(58964,55492,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(58965,55492,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(58966,55492,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(58967,55492,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(58968,55492,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(58969,55492,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(58970,55492,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(58971,55