ctively and land in a stable position.nnTo execute the technique, the individual needs to kick off the wall with one leg while simultaneously bringing the opposite leg forward to land between their hands. Achieving this requires good mobility to ensure that the foot can fit into the appropriate space. As the athlete progresses, they should practice this movement, initially focusing on balancing on the outside before gradually moving in. The hands will release similarly to a cat pass to facilitate the movement upwards onto the block.nnOverall, the proper execution of the pot vault involves a sequence of coordinated movements that hinge on timing, balance, and body control. Athletes are encouraged to strive for height and fluidity in their actions so that they develop a solid foundation for landing on the block effectively.nn**Key Points:**n1. The pot vault requires elevating hips high enough to position the opposite foot under the hands for balance and upward motion.n2. Proper technique involves kicking off the wall while bringing the opposite leg into position, emphasizing mobility and balanced execution.n3. Gradual practice, starting from the outside and moving inward, helps in mastering the movement and achieving successful landings.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 790,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 292,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1082,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"MKbuVkXAXcrRBL.AtfNr24Dqxn6MGYaiZ06UGjSkNjE-1735838031-1.0.1.1-m_KaFFTanTQNvOsqbXQdSL.lq6hVVEfy7tCi0LCpZR5EQB6r9ahFYSbPqk.8_aNtsws6MvjBCQCl0hLU9xR1cg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839831,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"epcM.4uHFydIjqwK37eb6MnSJ61D0THx8Xl.UtZ5Cjw-1735838031695-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(59113,55493,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(59114,55493,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The focus in this segment is on mastering a specific movement termed as the \"pot vault,\" which requires developing enough height and space underneath the athlete. The main objective is to elevate the hips sufficiently to position the opposite foot correctly beneath the hands. This movement is critical in allowing the athlete to utilize their momentum to progress upwards effectively and land in a stable position.\r\n\r\nTo execute the technique, the individual needs to kick off the wall with one leg while simultaneously bringing the opposite leg forward to land between their hands. Achieving this requires good mobility to ensure that the foot can fit into the appropriate space. As the athlete progresses, they should practice this movement, initially focusing on balancing on the outside before gradually moving in. The hands will release similarly to a cat pass to facilitate the movement upwards onto the block.\r\n\r\nOverall, the proper execution of the pot vault involves a sequence of coordinated movements that hinge on timing, balance, and body control. Athletes are encouraged to strive for height and fluidity in their actions so that they develop a solid foundation for landing on the block effectively.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The pot vault requires elevating hips high enough to position the opposite foot under the hands for balance and upward motion.\r\n2. Proper technique involves kicking off the wall while bringing the opposite leg into position, emphasizing mobility and balanced execution.\r\n3. Gradual practice, starting from the outside and moving inward, helps in mastering the movement and achieving successful landings.'),(59115,55493,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(59116,55493,'svg_id',''),(59117,55493,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(59118,55493,'svg_colour',''),(59119,55493,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(59120,55493,'extra_variables',''),(59121,55493,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(59122,55493,'notes',''),(59123,55493,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(59124,55493,'enable_youtube_api',''),(59125,55493,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(59126,55493,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(59127,55493,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(59128,55493,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(59129,55493,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(59130,55493,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(59131,55493,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(59132,55493,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(59133,55493,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(59134,55493,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(59135,55493,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(59136,55493,'enable_transcript',''),(59137,55