aising both knees and feet onto the vaulting surface, requiring the athlete to lift their hips high. It is essential to practice on higher obstacles than usual to facilitate the additional height needed for a successful vault and to ensure that all body parts are cleared properly.nnThe pop vault\'s execution mirrors that of a standard vault, emphasizing the importance of precise kicking techniques and controlled movements. Final tips recommend varying the heights of practice jumps and continuing to concentrate on a clean execution of the vault for improved performance and safety.nnKey Points:n1. The pop vault uses a wall to gain height, beginning with wall kick practices for elevation.n2. Transitioning to a cat pass requires lifting knees and feet properly onto the vaulting surface.n3. Practicing on varied heights ensures athletes develop the skills needed for a successful vault.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1550,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 256,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1806,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"cldTeuYm0kIX8zMjZVp_CNgxboHf5UNY91u_.RqQ6ds-1735838015-1.0.1.1-sDa__5qMVRh1lV7Vpn0ZUKkNb7pIfqrLP92KK7Z9uxpFsKhAQ0feeZie2jWIUp2ANAuna9L4fpycJ6P_hAUh4A\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839815,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"QLXXzIsZKSHCf61g.BY31JAXCSjcNqkv5072Xt2zjw8-1735838015036-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(59442,55495,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(59443,55495,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The pop vault is a technique that shares similarities with the cat pass and other vaulting methods, incorporating the side of a wall for additional height. The initial focus should be on practicing a wall kick, which helps in gaining the necessary elevation. Athletes are encouraged to simulate a running start, placing their hands above their heads to push off while simultaneously raising their legs.\r\n\r\nAs practitioners become more comfortable with the pop vault, the technique transitions into performing a cat pass. This involves raising both knees and feet onto the vaulting surface, requiring the athlete to lift their hips high. It is essential to practice on higher obstacles than usual to facilitate the additional height needed for a successful vault and to ensure that all body parts are cleared properly.\r\n\r\nThe pop vault\'s execution mirrors that of a standard vault, emphasizing the importance of precise kicking techniques and controlled movements. Final tips recommend varying the heights of practice jumps and continuing to concentrate on a clean execution of the vault for improved performance and safety.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The pop vault uses a wall to gain height, beginning with wall kick practices for elevation.\r\n2. Transitioning to a cat pass requires lifting knees and feet properly onto the vaulting surface.\r\n3. Practicing on varied heights ensures athletes develop the skills needed for a successful vault.'),(59444,55495,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(59445,55495,'svg_id',''),(59446,55495,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(59447,55495,'svg_colour',''),(59448,55495,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(59449,55495,'extra_variables',''),(59450,55495,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(59451,55495,'notes',''),(59452,55495,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(59453,55495,'enable_youtube_api',''),(59454,55495,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(59455,55495,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(59456,55495,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(59457,55495,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(59458,55495,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(59459,55495,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(59460,55495,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(59461,55495,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(59462,55495,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(59463,55495,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(59464,55495,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(59465,55495,'enable_transcript',''),(59466,55495,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(59467,55495,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(59468,55495,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(59469,55495,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(59470,55495,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(59471,55495,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(59472,55495,'video_filename','Vaulting-PopVault/Tutorial-vaul