 of a step Vault so\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000\r\nI want to pop up Land one foot one hand\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000\r\non the top of the wall and exit with the\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000\r\nopposite foot driving through so let\'s\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000\r\nlet\'s give that a\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,000\r\ngo and\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000\r\ndown so again let\'s get that height it\'s\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000\r\nexactly the same as a normal step\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000\r\nvult but this time making it a little\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000\r\nbit easier to get over by combining that\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000\r\npop Vault kick up and pass through our\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000\r\nhips are nice and high and our head is\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,000\r\nleaning a bit further forward we can get\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\nthrough much more comfortably\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000\r\n[Applause]\r\n\r\n'),(59615,55496,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(59616,55496,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJ35rvmNG7tqdzWKInJELYM7NpL4\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735838003,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The focus is on executing a pop Vault effectively, specifically targeting the landing directly on the exit of a step Vault. The objective is to achieve a secure landing with one foot and one hand on top of the wall, followed by a dynamic exit using the opposite foot. This technique is positioned as a progressive step in mastering vaults, aiming for both height and control during the maneuver.nnEmphasizing the importance of height, the instruction mimics a standard step vault while incorporating elements that enhance ease of passage. The goal is to combine the techniques of the pop vault with a high kick-up, manipulating body positioning to allow for a smooth transition through the hips and a forward-leaning head for balance. This combination is meant to facilitate a more comfortable execution of the vault, providing a safer and more effective passage over the obstacle.nnThe session underscores the idea of practice and progression in learning the vault, with specific attention given to body positioning and the mechanics of the landing. As participants practice these techniques, the goal is to achieve increased comfort and skill in their vaulting abilities, ultimately enhancing their overall performance.nn**Key Points:**n1. The goal is to land securely on the wall with a pop vault technique, transitioning seamlessly into an exit.n2. Height and body positioning are crucial for executing the vault effectively and safely.n3. Combining skills from multiple vault techniques can improve ease and comfort during practice.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 651,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 281,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 932,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"