ault, providing a safer and more effective passage over the obstacle.\r\n\r\nThe session underscores the idea of practice and progression in learning the vault, with specific attention given to body positioning and the mechanics of the landing. As participants practice these techniques, the goal is to achieve increased comfort and skill in their vaulting abilities, ultimately enhancing their overall performance.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The goal is to land securely on the wall with a pop vault technique, transitioning seamlessly into an exit.\r\n2. Height and body positioning are crucial for executing the vault effectively and safely.\r\n3. Combining skills from multiple vault techniques can improve ease and comfort during practice.'),(59619,55496,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(59620,55496,'svg_id',''),(59621,55496,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(59622,55496,'svg_colour',''),(59623,55496,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(59624,55496,'extra_variables',''),(59625,55496,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(59626,55496,'notes',''),(59627,55496,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(59628,55496,'enable_youtube_api',''),(59629,55496,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(59630,55496,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(59631,55496,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(59632,55496,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(59633,55496,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(59634,55496,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(59635,55496,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(59636,55496,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(59637,55496,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(59638,55496,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(59639,55496,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(59640,55496,'enable_transcript',''),(59641,55496,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(59642,55496,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(59643,55496,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_672