tart\": 11.639,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.841\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"your foot on the side of the wall to pop\",\r\n        \"start\": 15.04,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"up\",\r\n        \"start\": 18.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.559\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"higher when people do this um it\'s\",\r\n        \"start\": 20.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"usually on something that\'s a little bit\",\r\n        \"start\": 24.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.721\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"higher than normal than you would do on\",\r\n        \"start\": 26,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.679\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"a normal Vault um\",\r\n        \"start\": 27.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and I tend to see people try to do it\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.081\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and land on top so it would be sort of\",\r\n        \"start\": 33.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.959\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"like a like that but this is sort of\",\r\n        \"start\": 35.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.279\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"like a half pop\",\r\n        \"start\": 39.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.561\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Vault when you\'re doing a a full proper\",\r\n        \"start\": 42.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"pop Vault the idea is to not land on top\",\r\n        \"start\": 45.12,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so if you\'re doing a cat pass Pop um you\",\r\n        \"start\": 48.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.561\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"need to go over it or if you\'re doing a\",\r\n        \"start\": 51.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.079\r\n    },\r\n