'),(60361,55502,'video_chatgpt_response_text',''),(60362,55502,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(60363,55502,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the speed vault is like the big brother\",\r\n        \"start\": 6.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.239\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"of the stat Vault with a stat Vault we\",\r\n        \"start\": 10.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.64\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"are putting one foot on this time no\",\r\n        \"start\": 13.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.401\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"feet go on you\'re just stepping straight\",\r\n        \"start\": 17.88,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.72\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you\'re just going straight over it\'s\",\r\n        \"start\": 20.16,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.4\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"sort of a hop with the inside leg so\",\r\n        \"start\": 22.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"from here up and down okay\",\r\n        \"start\": 26.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.24\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"start with a low\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"wall practice the step Vault up and over\",\r\n        \"start\": 32.8,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.079\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"but it\'s that inside leg that does the\",\r\n        \"start\": 37.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.519\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"jump and gets us\",\r\n        \"start\": 40.879,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"over\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.601\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"okay the speed Vault needs a flat hand\",\r\n        \"start\": 46.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.88\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and you want to get your hips high like\",\r\n        \"start\": 51.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"usual with most other vaults it\'s about\",\r\n        \"start\": 53.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.599\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the hips and getting your body weight\",\r\n        \"start\": 55.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.239\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"over the top of the hand practice it on\",\r\n        \"start\": 59.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"a low wall gradually build up where\",\r\n        \"start\": 62.199,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.321\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you\'re practicing the hop over the top\",\r\n        \"start\": 64.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.961\r\n    }\r\n]'),(60364,55502,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(60365,55502,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000\r\nthe speed vault is like the big brother\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000\r\nof the stat Vault with a stat Vault we\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:19,000\r\nare putting one foot on this time no\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000\r\nfeet go on you\'re just stepping straight\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000\r\nyou\'re just going straight over it\'s\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000\r\nsort of a hop with the inside leg so\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000\r\nfrom here up and down okay\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000\r\nstart with a low\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,000\r\nwall practice the step Vault up and over\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,000\r\nbut it\'s that inside leg that does the\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000\r\njump and gets us\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:51,000\r\nover\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000\r\nokay the speed Vault needs a flat hand\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000\r\nand you want to get your hips high like\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,000\r\nusual with most other vaults it\'s about\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,000\r\nthe hips and getting your body weight\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000\r\nover the top of the hand practice it on\r\n\r\n18\r\n00:00:62,000 --> 00:01:10,000\r\na low wall gradually build up where\r\n\r\n19\r\n00:00:64,000 --> 00:01:09,000\r\nyou\'re practicing the hop over the top\r\n\r\n'),(60366,55502,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(60367,55502,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJYjerf6z1mF8EzHkaM7iliFBjav\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735839965,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The speed vault is an advanced technique that builds on the concepts of a standard vault. Unlike the stat vault where both feet step off the ground, the speed vault involves a quick hop using the inside leg, allowing the practitioner to clear an obstacle. As the body moves over the obstacle, emphasis is placed on having a flat hand and positioning the hips high to maintain body momentum.nnTo properly execute a speed vault, one begins by practicing on low walls to master the movement and gain confidence. As skills develop, gradually increasing the height of the obstacle is suggested. The key part of the technique is the explosive jump from the inside leg as it aids in lifting the body over while managing the balance with a flat hand.nnOverall, successful execution of the speed vault requires practice, coordination, and an understanding of body mechanics. It\'s essential to focus on each phase of the jump to ensure safety and effectiveness, allowing for a smooth and efficient vaulting technique.nn**Key Points:**n1. The speed vault relies on a quick hop with the inside leg rather than a two-footed launch.n2. Practicing on low walls helps build technique and confidence before increasing obstacle height.n3. Key elements include a flat hand position and the importance of hip height for maintaining momentum.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 714,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 252,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 966,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ocGyUVAzvouNmDOBK9y5r0_5eDSF76r5qlIjDlaMO.o-1735839972-1.0.1.1-tEjO0uke76DgG6y8lZC9S5tR03ijUVCU9kFhufNe5zk1FOlsnA9RHc7T5ck7IYxkJQ55pdLl6GbQweQS15iXzQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735841772,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"3qFyWwn907uyTT_6S2_ffSrI0W3H.ag0NINZR1X3p_I-1735839972644-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(60368,55502,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(60369,55502,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The speed vault is an advanced technique that builds on the concepts of a standard vault. Unlike the stat vault where both feet step off the ground, the speed vault involves a quick hop using the inside leg, allowing the practitioner to clear an obstacle. As the body moves over the obstacle, emphasis is placed on having a flat hand and positioning the hips high to maintain body momentum.\r\n\r\nTo properly execute a speed vault, one begins by practicing on low walls to master the movement and gain confidence. As skills develop, gradually increasing the height of the obstacle is suggested. The key part of the technique is the explosive jump from the inside leg as it aids in lifting the body over while managing the balance with a flat hand.\r\n\r\nOverall, successful execution of the speed vault requires practice, coordination, and an understanding of body mechanics. It\'s essential to focus on each phase of the jump to ensure safety and effectiveness, allowing for a smooth and efficient vaulting technique.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. The speed vault relies on a quick hop with the inside leg rather than a two-footed launch.\r\n2. Practicing on low walls helps build technique and confidence before increasing obstacle height.\r\n3. Key elements include a flat hand position and the importance of hip height for maintaining momentum.'),(60370,55502,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(60371,55502,'svg_id',''),(60372,55502,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(60373,55502,'svg_colour',''),(60374,55502,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(60375,55502,'extra_variables',''),(60376,55502,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(60377,55502,'notes',''),(60378,55502,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(60379,555