n\": 5.48\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"a cat pass it\'s kind of like a cat pass\",\r\n        \"start\": 25.359,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"but the body goes to the side feet do\",\r\n        \"start\": 27.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.28\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"not land on top so from\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.281\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"here over like\",\r\n        \"start\": 34.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.639\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"that the jump is two feet the uh hands\",\r\n        \"start\": 37.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.96\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"are two hands and you can land one foot\",\r\n        \"start\": 42.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.601\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so from here over land one foot so this\",\r\n        \"start\": 45.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.799\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"again is going to help us get to that\",\r\n        \"start\": 50,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.039\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"point where we\'re doing a speed V where\",\r\n        \"start\": 52.079,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.96\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"it\'s the same thing but onehanded we\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 54.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.48\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"building up to that in stages\",\r\n        \"start\": 57.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.48\r\n    }\r\n]'),(60712,55505,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(60713,55505,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000\r\nall right the next stage of the speed\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000\r\nvault is using two hands but now on a\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000\r\nproper wall and no foot landing on top\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000\r\nso the body is still going to the side\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000\r\nthis time you have to go on a little bit\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000\r\nof a higher wall and flat hands it\'s not\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000\r\na cat pass it\'s kind of like a cat pass\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000\r\nbut the body goes to the side feet do\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000\r\nnot land on top so from\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000\r\nhere over like\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,000\r\nthat the jump is two feet the uh hands\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000\r\nare two hands and you can land one foot\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000\r\nso from here over land one foot so this\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000\r\nagain is going to help us get to that\r\n\r\n15\r\n00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000\r\npoint where we\'re doing a speed V where\r\n\r\n16\r\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,000\r\nit\'s the same thing but onehanded we\'re\r\n\r\n17\r\n00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000\r\nbuilding up to that in stages\r\n\r\n'),(60714,55505,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(60715,55505,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AlJYcU7gZ2LGFdefAGp5NRyHdlYFB\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735839958,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The next phase of the speed vault involves utilizing both hands while making contact with a proper wall. Unlike previous methods, the focus here is on ensuring that no foot lands on top of the wall, which emphasizes a side motion for the body. As the technique progresses, participants must navigate a higher wall, transitioning to flat hands—a movement reminiscent of a cat pass, but with distinct differences in foot placement.nnIn the execution of this technique, the initial jump requires landing on both feet, with an understanding that while the hands engage with the wall, the body continues to shift laterally. Importantly, the foot placement should not rest atop the wall but rather allow for a smooth transition onto one foot as landing occurs. This modification is designed to build skills progressively, ultimately preparing participants for more complex vaults.nnThe ultimate goal is to master a speed vault using one hand, which will be introduced after solidifying the two-handed approach. The stages of practice are crucial to ensuring a seamless evolution into the one-handed movement, with each iteration contributing to overall proficiency. By breaking down the training into manageable steps, individuals can achieve greater confidence and technique in their vaulting skills.nnKey points:n1. The speed vault technique requires both hands and must avoid foot placement atop the wall, emphasizing lateral body movement.n2. The initial movements incorporate two-foot jumps and eventual one-foot landings to build skill progression.n3. The training aims to transition to a one-handed speed vault, with each stage designed to enhance technique and confidence.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 661,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 303,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 964,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"_o3fhCIzoRKnEBiuIwRdbTKhEs00WBf6oKpZXe96s4o-1735839964-1.0.1.1-647t_aItDUUAO4h4usTB7dhHwbi78CXo01HtxzaLP9avyrf1cCWqn4cisrsI62Kr23ZS.w6doM7T3dwz3qxZDw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735841764,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"5cZKHfQvX9dCwmr.W2HPF4IMXeZCVM71l3KqNuxHW0A-1735839964344-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(60716,55505,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(60717,55505,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The next phase of the speed vault involves utilizing both hands while making contact with a proper wall. Unlike previous methods, the focus here is on ensuring that no foot lands on top of the wall, which emphasizes a side motion for the body. As the technique progresses, participants must navigate a higher wall, transitioning to flat hands—a movement reminiscent of a cat pass, but with distinct differences in foot placement.\r\n\r\nIn the execution of this technique, the initial jump requires landing on both feet, with an understanding that while the hands engage with the wall, the body continues to shift laterally. Importantly, the foot placement should not rest atop the wall but rather allow for a smooth transition onto one foot as landing occurs. This modification is designed to build skills progressively, ultimately preparing participants for more complex vaults.\r\n\r\nThe ultimate goal is to master a speed vault using one hand, which will be introduced after solidifying the two-handed approach. The stages of practice are crucial to ensuring a seamless evolution into the one-handed movement, with each iteration contributing to overall proficiency. By breaking down the training into manageable steps, individuals can achieve greater confidence and technique in their vaulting skills.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The speed vault technique requires both hands and must avoid foot placement atop the wall, emphasizing lateral body movement.\r\n2. The initial movements incorporate two-foot jumps and eventual one-foot landings to build skill progression.\r\n3. The training aims to transition to a one-handed speed vault, with each stage designed to enhance technique and confidence.'),(60718,55505,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(60719,55505,'svg_id',''),(60720,55505,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(60721,55505,'svg_colour',''),(60722,55505,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(60723,55505,'extra_variables',''),(60724,55505,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(60725,55505,'notes',''),(60726,55505,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(60727,55505,'enable_youtube_api',''),(60728,55505,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(60729,55505,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(60730,55505,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(60731,55505,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(60732,55505,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(60733,55505,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(60734,55505,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(60735,55505,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(60736,55505,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(60737,55505,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(60738,55505,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field