_text',''),(61373,55510,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(61374,55510,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the scissor kick speed vault is one of\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.64\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"those movements which is a bit flowery\",\r\n        \"start\": 9.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.639\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"uh we used to do it back in the day at\",\r\n        \"start\": 12.16,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the beginnings of Parkour to make it\",\r\n        \"start\": 16.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.681\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"look cooler than it really was the\",\r\n        \"start\": 18.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.839\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"scissor kick you would see a lot of like\",\r\n        \"start\": 21.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.92\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the yamakasi and the original F was\",\r\n        \"start\": 23.519,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.321\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"doing it uh but it\'s not really\",\r\n        \"start\": 25.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"necessary it just sort of adds a little\",\r\n        \"start\": 27.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.28\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"bit of flare to the speed Vault the idea\",\r\n        \"start\": 29.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 9.72\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"is that the top leg leads further\",\r\n        \"start\": 33.12,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.919\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"forwards and the back leg the one that\'s\",\r\n        \"start\": 39.44,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to land on the ground is going to\",\r\n        \"start\": 42.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.2\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"scissor and then land so it\'s just\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.399\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"emphasizing that top leg to go further\",\r\n        \"start\": 47.239,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.281\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"forward and then you can kick it back to\",\r\n        \"start\": 49.879,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.721\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"scissor past and land on the floor so\",\r\n        \"start\": 52.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"let\'s give it a go the yeah I\'m going to\",\r\n        \"start\": 56.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.24\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"lead with the right leg forward and then\",\r\n        \"start\": 58.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.599\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"I\'m GNA try and kick it back in that\",\r\n        \"start\": 60.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.92\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"scissor\",\r\n        \"start\": 63.199,\r\n        \"duration\": 2.561\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"action so I\'m sort of kicking backwards\",\r\n        \"start\": 66.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.4\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"in midair um as I go let\'s see if we can\",\r\n        \"start\": 70.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"give it another go trying to keep my leg\",\r\n        \"start\": 74.08,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.32\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"a bit straighter this time so from\",\r\n        \"start\": 75.799,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.881\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"here and kick back so again it\'s not\",\r\n        \"start\": 79.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"really useful uh there\'s no real\",\r\n        \"start\": 82.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.2\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"function to it but sort of nostalgic\",\r\n        \"start\": 84.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.6\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"reasons uh that scissor kick\",\r\n        \"start\": 87.88,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"uh it\'s kind of fun looks cool um yeah\",\r\n        \"start\": 90.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.599\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"have a play with it if you\'re happy with\",\r\n        \"start\": 93.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.4\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the speed volat now that can be kind of\",\r\n        \"start\": 96.119,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.441\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"an interesting move to use\",\r\n        \"start\": 99.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.24\r\n    }\r\n]'),(61375,55510,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(61376,55510,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000\r\nthe scissor kick speed vault is one of\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000\r\nthose movements which is a bit flowery\r\n\r\n3\r\n00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000\r\nuh we used to do it back in the day at\r\n\r\n4\r\n00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000\r\nthe beginnings of Parkour to make it\r\n\r\n5\r\n00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000\r\nlook cooler than it really was the\r\n\r\n6\r\n00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000\r\nscissor kick you would see a lot of like\r\n\r\n7\r\n00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000\r\nthe yamakasi and the original F was\r\n\r\n8\r\n00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000\r\ndoing it uh but it\'s not really\r\n\r\n9\r\n00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000\r\nnecessary it just sort of adds a little\r\n\r\n10\r\n00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,000\r\nbit of flare to the speed Vault the idea\r\n\r\n11\r\n00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,000\r\nis that the top leg leads further\r\n\r\n12\r\n00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000\r\nforwards and the back leg the one that\'s\r\n\r\n13\r\n00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000\r\ngoing to land on the ground is going to\r\n\r\n14\r\n00:00:44,000 --> 0