ting atop the wall and using their hands for support. They should drive their hips forward while kicking their feet to allow for a smooth landing on the ground. This foundational movement is crucial for transitioning into the dash vault.nnAs the practitioner lifts their hips and pushes off, they need to emphasize the upward movement coupled with a forward drive. This motion replicates the exit phase of a dash vault. Practicing this movement not only helps in mastering the initial stage but also aids in developing the necessary abdominal strength to maintain stability while transitioning through the movements involved in the dash vault.nnThe landing is equally important in this sequence. The proper technique requires landing on the balls of the feet, as this helps with balance and prepares the body for subsequent actions. This initial stage serves as a vital building block for progressing further into the more advanced elements of performing a dash vault efficiently.nnKey points:n1. Begin by practicing the push-off technique from a raised surface to establish foundational skills.n2. Focus on driving the hips forward and maintaining abdominal contraction throughout the movement.n3. Ensure proper landing technique by landing on the balls of the feet for better balance and stability.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1100,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 268,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1368,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"Fu89FloPAsmeI2vM2eKLOZCJgMH4_o4SDtkgRTqosl4-1735836780-1.0.1.1-nme9dPEp6QCthiv12LJPIJWzP5S6GEHDRjpVp_PJ8YSUwjkM5JOZZyUpgcyeg6tOIXZJwy1HumUFDeOtf21qkw\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735838580,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"tRx8xXRoORcBKciXzC2wmDNmEhBqRNeJ4zRrtjIKKbo-1735836780878-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(61624,55512,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(61625,55512,'video_transcript_chatgpt','When learning how to perform a dash vault, the initial focus should be on executing a proper push-off technique from a raised surface, such as a wall or box. The process begins with the practitioner sitting atop the wall and using their hands for support. They should drive their hips forward while kicking their feet to allow for a smooth landing on the ground. This foundational movement is crucial for transitioning into the dash vault.\r\n\r\nAs the practitioner lifts their hips and pushes off, they need to emphasize the upward movement coupled with a forward drive. This motion replicates the exit phase of a dash vault. Practicing this movement not only helps in mastering the initial stage but also aids in developing the necessary abdominal strength to maintain stability while transitioning through the movements involved in the dash vault.\r\n\r\nThe landing is equally important in this sequence. The proper technique requires landing on the balls of the feet, as this helps with balance and prepares the body for subsequent actions. This initial stage serves as a vital building block for progressing further into the more advanced elements of performing a dash vault efficiently.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Begin by practicing the push-off technique from a raised surface to establish foundational skills.\r\n2. Focus on driving the hips forward and maintaining abdominal contraction throughout the movement.\r\n3. Ensure proper landing technique by landing on the balls of the feet for better balance and stability.'),(61626,55512,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(61627,55512,'svg_id',''),(61628,55512,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(61629,55512,'svg_colour',''),(61630,55512,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(61631,55512,'extra_variables',''),(61632,55512,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(61633,55512,'notes',''),(61634,55512,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(61635,55512,'enable_youtube_api',''),(61636,55512,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(61637,55512,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(61638,55512,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(61639,55512,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(61640,55512,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(61641,55512,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(61642,55512,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(61643,55512,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(61644,55512,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(61645,55512,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(61646,55512,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(61647,55512,'enable_transcript',''),(61648,55512,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(61649,55512,'enable_transcript_chatgp