ped around\",\r\n        \"start\": 22.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.839\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"I\'ve tried to stop it my hands are there\",\r\n        \"start\": 25.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.199\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"my thumb is behind\",\r\n        \"start\": 28.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.72\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and that\'s how you catch the bar to then\",\r\n        \"start\": 31.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.921\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"push away you don\'t want to land flat\",\r\n        \"start\": 34.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.121\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"hands cuz more likely that\'s just going\",\r\n        \"start\": 36.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.64\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to miss the bar and slip off um the rail\",\r\n        \"start\": 39.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 8.24\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Dash yeah you kind of want to catch\",\r\n        \"start\": 43.6,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.16\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"it and through\",\r\n        \"start\": 47.8,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.559\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so yeah the the this can be scary um if\",\r\n        \"start\": 50.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.16\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you haven\'t done this before build up\",\r\n        \"start\": 55.359,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.921\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"using some of the other techniques that\",\r\n        \"start\": 57.559,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.441\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"you were doing on the\",\r\n        \"start\": 59.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.48\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"wall being much more accurate with the\",\r\n        \"start\": 61,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.439\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"rail Dash um is going to be necessary\",\r\n        \"start\": 63.76,