 of the seat vault. The design of this technique allows for a secure feeling while executing the move, as the performer is effectively seated on the wall momentarily. It’s essential to execute the movements fluidly, ensuring that the hands remain placed correctly on the block, which contributes to both balance and aesthetics. When performed correctly, the vault can appear seamless and visually appealing.nnPracticing on lower structures is highly encouraged before progressing to taller walls or vaults. This method helps build confidence and skill while ensuring a solid foundation in the technique. With consistent effort and attention to the mechanics, anyone can master the seat vault and enhance their overall vaulting skills.nnKey Points:n1. The seat vault involves a leftward rotation using the right hand, transferring weight to the right buttock before swinging the left leg over.n2. Safety is prioritized through proper hand placement on a block, allowing a secure and comfortable execution of the vault.n3. Beginners should practice on lower heights before advancing to ensure confidence and mastery of the technique.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1908,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 311,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2219,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"UFBdZOU9tsgW8D1Q1TsrY75UHIwpEeAc4g3xj2XYBTU-1735837467-1.0.1.1-W.WWvMiiMUJXnbi8KrhOM4ns3Tos_5fujcJY5BrAHq7iKsPrTvQVe8N6gLyt6BSRPrJCBkpb594AfCxeZTULBQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839267,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"VqHk_PtdLh75TMf9AFmzRbRSbL4Azl_R7mlAhM7UFDk-1735837467379-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(62989,55522,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(62990,55522,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The technique for performing a seat vault is straightforward and emphasizes the importance of proper body movement and positioning. To initiate the vault, one must approach the wall and use their right hand to facilitate a leftward rotation across the body. As the movement progresses, the individual needs to shift their weight onto their right buttock, allowing the left leg to swing over. This coordination also requires placing the left hand on a block for stability, preparing for the exit by allowing both legs to follow through and drop off.\r\n\r\nSafety and comfort are fundamental aspects of the seat vault. The design of this technique allows for a secure feeling while executing the move, as the performer is effectively seated on the wall momentarily. It’s essential to execute the movements fluidly, ensuring that the hands remain placed correctly on the block, which contributes to both balance and aesthetics. When performed correctly, the vault can appear seamless and visually appealing.\r\n\r\nPracticing on lower structures is highly encouraged before progressing to taller walls or vaults. This method helps build confidence and skill while ensuring a solid foundation in the technique. With consistent effort and attention to the mechanics, anyone can master the seat vault and enhance their overall vaulting skills.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The seat vault involves a leftward rotation using the right hand, transferring weight to the right buttock before swinging the left leg over.\r\n2. Safety is prioritized through proper hand placement on a block, allowing a secure and comfortable execution of the vault.\r\n3. Beginners should practice on lower heights before advancing to ensure confidence and mastery of the technique.'),(62991,55522,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(62992,55522,'svg_id',''),(62993,55522,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(62994,55522,'svg_colour',''),(62995,55522,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(62996,55522,'extra_variables',''),(62997,55522,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(62998,55522,'notes',''),(62999,55522,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(63000,55522,'enable_youtube_api',''),(63001,55522,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(63002,55522,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(63003,55522,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(63004,55522,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(63005,55522,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(63006,55522,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(63007,55522,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(63008,55522,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(63009,55522,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(63010,55522,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(63011,55522,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(63012,55522,'enable_transcript',''),(63013,55522,'_enable_transcript','field_67