ither side of the obstacle—one on the inside and the other on the outside. From this position, they are able to push off, straddle the obstacle briefly, and then kick their legs outward to clear it. Momentum plays a critical role in this maneuver, allowing for a more fluid movement without the need to halt mid-action. Proper foot placement and hand positioning are essential for successful execution, as they directly impact balance and momentum.nnFor beginners, it is recommended to practice the chest vault on lower obstacles, ideally around hip height, before attempting higher structures. Over time, individuals can adapt this skill to various heights and surfaces, including railings. The chest vault not only showcases the balance and agility required in gymnastics but also encourages the individual to experiment with different heights and techniques to enhance their proficiency. nnKey Points:n1. The chest vault involves facing downwards while transitioning over an obstacle, contrasting with the backwards motion of the bum roll.n2. Hand positioning and momentum are crucial for successfully executing the chest vault, allowing for a fluid movement over the barrier.n3. Beginners should start practicing on lower obstacles before progressing to higher surfaces to develop the necessary skills and confidence.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1520,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 345,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1865,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"E33gr0eH8y1i1OBkZywIXVTG23339HY_RtROzVbmLVI-1735837462-1.0.1.1-Ef.hnhB5RR.5_pB0xMHP.0j3GO_8Zyg7JmVkrAP4y4PwKKimHWQjs7g9K593sGpEEtsdQOnfnKXAHZyfpFTDng\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839262,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"9MoVvJ8Wyu2K1VcZDSqoPbNREIDTcnwgp4Os.cP5cms-1735837462446-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(63146,55523,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(63147,55523,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The chest vault, also known as the barrel vault, represents a gymnastic movement that contrasts with the bum roll. While the bum roll involves rolling backward and landing on one’s rear, the chest vault requires the performer to face downward, utilizing their hands to support their body’s weight as they navigate an obstacle like a box or wall. This technique emphasizes a forward motion and straddling action to effectively transition over the obstacle, drawing attention to the importance of body positioning and control.\r\n\r\nExecuting the chest vault begins with the performer placing their hands on either side of the obstacle—one on the inside and the other on the outside. From this position, they are able to push off, straddle the obstacle briefly, and then kick their legs outward to clear it. Momentum plays a critical role in this maneuver, allowing for a more fluid movement without the need to halt mid-action. Proper foot placement and hand positioning are essential for successful execution, as they directly impact balance and momentum.\r\n\r\nFor beginners, it is recommended to practice the chest vault on lower obstacles, ideally around hip height, before attempting higher structures. Over time, individuals can adapt this skill to various heights and surfaces, including railings. The chest vault not only showcases the balance and agility required in gymnastics but also encourages the individual to experiment with different heights and techniques to enhance their proficiency. \r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. The chest vault involves facing downwards while transitioning over an obstacle, contrasting with the backwards motion of the bum roll.\r\n2. Hand positioning and momentum are crucial for successfully executing the chest vault, allowing for a fluid movement over the barrier.\r\n3. Beginners should start practicing on lower obstacles before progressing to higher surfaces to develop the necessary skills and confidence.'),(63148,55523,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(63149,55523,'svg_id',''),(63150,55523,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(63151,55523,'svg_colour',''),(63152,55523,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(63153,55523,'extra_variables',''),(63154,55523,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(63155,55523,'notes',''),(63156,55523,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(63157,55523,'enable_youtube_api',''),(63158,55523,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(63159,55523,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(63160,55523,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(63161,55523,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(63162,55523,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(63163,55523,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(63164,55523,'_en