o_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the gate Vault can be performed on a\",\r\n        \"start\": 6.04,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.759\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"wall or a rail um but more traditionally\",\r\n        \"start\": 8.599,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"on a rail because it allows you to\",\r\n        \"start\": 12.799,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.761\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"actually grab the top so the gate vault\",\r\n        \"start\": 14.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.241\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"is it looks really fun it\'s really cool\",\r\n        \"start\": 18.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.039\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and actually it\'s it\'s fairly easy to\",\r\n        \"start\": 21.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.759\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"perform as as well so the way this works\",\r\n        \"start\": 24.599,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.16\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"is you\'re going to go up to the\",\r\n        \"start\": 27.679,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.761\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"railing and you\'re going to grab it\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.001\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"upside down so your left hand uh on this\",\r\n        \"start\": 33.44,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"side I\'m going to grab with my left\",\r\n        \"start\": 36.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.56\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"upside down now the next step is I\'m\",\r\n        \"start\": 38.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.8\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to put my waist on the rail and\",\r\n        \"start\": 42.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.719\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"I\'m going to lean forwards and I\'m going\",\r\n        \"start\": 44.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.64\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to put my right hand straight to the\",\r\n        \"start\": 46.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 7\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"ground as my hand touches the ground my\",\r\n        \"start\": 48.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.96\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"legs are going to go around the bar so\",\r\n        \"start\": 53.039,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"they\'re not going over the top so\",\r\n        \"start\": 56.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.92\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"sometimes you know when people see it\",\r\n        \"start\": 59.399,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.281\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"first they think oh the legs are going\",\r\n        \"start\": 60.84,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.319\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"straight over it\'s not like a front flip\",\r\n        \"start\": 62.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.4\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"it\'s just going around the bar so I\'ll\",\r\n        \"start\": 65.159,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.121\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"show you in slow motion from here I go\",\r\n        \"start\": 68.08,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.48\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"down and I go around so they\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 71.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.08\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"literally just coming up and\",\r\n        \"start\": 73.56,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"over um and that\'s the gate Vault it\'s\",\r\n        \"start\": 76.36,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"yeah from here over kick and down you\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 79.08,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.359\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"using your hips a lot the hips are the\",\r\n        \"start\": 83.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.359\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"key and again you\'re sort of like the\",\r\n        \"start\": 86.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.801\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"lower abs it\'s between between your\",\r\n        \"start\": 88.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.961\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"groin and the hip bone it\'s just in\",\r\n        \"start\": 90.24,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.76\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"between and yeah you should be able to\",\r\n        \"start\": 92.72,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.56\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"sort of hold the position on the bar put\",\r\n        \"start\": 96,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.52\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"your hand down and then just spin those\",\r\n        \"start\": 99.28,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.479\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"legs over you can do this both sides so\",\r\n        \"start\": 102.52,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"make sure that you can so this this side\",\r\n        \"start\": 105.759,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.68\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"would be the right hand underneath thumb\",\r\n        \"start\": 108.2,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.519\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"on top here left hand and then over\",\r\n        \"start\": 110.439,\r\n        \"duration\": 7.04\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"notice how I can step over as I feel\",\r\n        \"start\": 114.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.76\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"comfortable\",\r\n        \"start\": 117.479,\r\n        \"duration\": 3\r\n    }\r\n]'),(63387,55525,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(63388,55525,'video_transcript_srt','1\r\n00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000\r\nthe gate Vault can be performed on a\r\n\r\n2\r\n00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000\r\nwall or a rail um but more traditionally\r\n\r\n3\r\n0