 hand, which sets the stage for the maneuver.nnOnce you have a secure grip, the next steps involve positioning your waist on the rail and leaning forward while extending your right hand toward the ground. As your hand reaches the ground, your legs will maneuver around the rail rather than going straight over the top. It\'s a common misconception that the legs must clear the bar like in a front flip; instead, they smoothly transition around it in a circular motion.nnKey elements of the gate vault include the use of hip control and maintaining a strong core, particularly using the lower abdominals. To successfully complete the vault, you will need to practice the hand placements and the motion of your legs, as both sides can be executed. As you progress, you should feel more comfortable and confident in stepping over the rail while holding the position.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1456,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 220,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1676,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"HCDe9Qnrr1Oamm_sPH1NoNTt8QOZ1W4ddK8QuQaqSEE-1735837792-1.0.1.1-uoBnMEu6I6ih7uel65PcP9.6YHf2RCHqsoQAw.ZP6k8eXJ3tIllW3wJiMuLVxj3lNKJEZoXzYLROcj