 support and leveraging rotational forces, are essential to maintain balance and control throughout the maneuver.nnFor those inexperienced with the reverse vault, beginning training on a low wall can build confidence and skill. Starting with a reverse step vault, practitioners can gradually acclimate themselves to the movements required for the complete reverse vault. Incorporating practice into one\'s routine will allow for improvement, enabling performers to eventually execute the vault smoothly, even without placing their foot on top of the obstacle during the landing phase.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1359,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 243,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1602,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"j7kXfCG4CdX.HtGWGNNQKwYOOQDVDTjfFYSAm__7.1Q-1735837770-1.0.1.1-sM0iTHYfm9YZj_rO_IyvzIBOWwnCdYWqNJylqnah8ZCdRb7kAOUMADnUGZ4mqeJotHEeO5zSuRKbUBSlU2MYqQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735839570,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"EVl82jFR602VNyndzfQkb8.tO9FaIo1yMzLQCmldDFc-1735837770666-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(63552,55526,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(63553,55526,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The reverse vault is a maneuver that resembles the speed vault but requires a backward motion. In this technique, the performer makes a running start, utilizes one hand, and propels their legs over an obstacle, reversing the actions of the speed vault. As the practitioner approaches the vault, they shift their body position to ensure a backward trajectory while executing the maneuver, which may include a 360° rotation as they prepare to land.\r\n\r\nDuring execution, the individual must project momentum while lifting both legs off the ground and bringing them over the obstacle. This demands a significant amount of speed, and the performer needs to ensure they are facing outward as they complete the vault, which involves a careful rotation. Proper body mechanics, such as using one hand for support and leveraging rotational forces, are essential to maintain balance and control throughout the maneuver.\r\n\r\nFor those inexperienced with the reverse vault, beginning training on a low wall can build confidence and skill. Starting with a reverse step vault, practitioners can gradually acclimate themselves to the movements required for the complete reverse vault. Incorporating practice into one\'s routine will allow for improvement, enabling performers to eventually execute the vault smoothly, even without placing their foot on top of the obstacle during the landing phase.'),(63554,55526,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(63555,55526,'svg_id',''),(63556,55526,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(63557,55526,'svg_colour',''),(63558,55526,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(63559,55526,'extra_variables',''),(63560,55526,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(63561,55526,'enable_youtube_api',''),(63562,55526,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(63563,55526,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(63564,55526,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(63565,55526,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(63566,55526,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(63567,55526,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(63568,55526,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(63569,55526,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(63570,55526,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(63571,55526,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(63572,55526,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(63573,55526,'enable_transcript',''),(63574,55526,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(63575,55526,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(63576,55526,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(63577,55526,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(63578,55526,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(63579,55526,'_yoast_wpseo_primary_tutorial_category',''),(63580,55526,'_yoast_wpseo_primary_playlist_category',''),(63581,55526,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(63582,55526,'rank_math_seo_score','10'),(63583,55526,'display_transcript_chatgpt','1'),(63584,55526,'_display_transcript_chatgpt','field_674ebfa53aadd'),(63585,55526,'display_content','1'),(63586,55526,'_display_content','field_674ebb84ced2b'),(63587,55526,'display_challenge_rules','1'),(63588,55526,'_display_challenge_rules','field_674ebc48a03cb'),(63589,55526,'display_chatgpt_summary','0'),(63590,55526,'_display_chatgpt_summary','field_674ebc59a03cc'),(63591,55526,'display_youtube_description','0')