55534,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\r\n    \"headers\": {},\r\n    \"body\": {\r\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-AkumLN3BFpcQNQSEz3qJt46vLTN6o\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744709,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The tutorial focused on the technical aspects of performing precision jumps from block to block. It began by recommending an extensive series for those interested in deeper knowledge before outlining the foundational techniques necessary for executing a precision jump. Emphasis was placed on the basic mechanics, such as the importance of starting with proper foot positioning, utilizing arm movements for added momentum, and maintaining a solid body posture during takeoff and landing.nnKey techniques discussed included the necessity of bending the knees and hips at roughly 90 degrees upon landing, ensuring that the quads absorb most of the impact. The tutorial also highlighted the importance of visual targeting to enhance focus during the jump. It advised practicing by gradually increasing the distance of jumps as comfort and skill levels improve, promoting the idea that consistent practice leads to mastery of form and stability.nnAs jumps become larger or more complex, maintaining strict attention to technique is vital for safety and performance. The tutorial concluded by encouraging continual practice of these techniques to ensure accurate landings, especially as challenges increase, such as taking off from different surfaces or tackling obstacles like rails. Reinforcing good habits in precision jumping not only maximizes performance but also minimizes the risk of injury.nn**Key Points:**n1. Proper foot positioning and body mechanics are essential for executing precision jumps effectively.n2. Landing techniques should involve bending the knees and hips to absorb impact while stabilizing with arm movements.n3. Gradual increase in jump difficulty requires reinforcement of precise techniques to ensure safety and reliability.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 2241,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 294,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 2535,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"deJG2eqe17h54QjL6VXL3lACrKjko5yf0_nwqutScqU-1735744715-1.0.1.1-bQvefY5vBMdUUTPOubbDDN9d.ZuEdaV2_gZg6FjfloMc4lLOZRTU80Ou.J5jHgGY9KGAf7G1YURKpYOH2XyA4A\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746515,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"8IfnWvj6g.RmrAdgsmG033izpan.D1l7TUejFvndeC8-1735744715187-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(64422,55534,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(64423,55534,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The tutorial focused on the technical aspects of performing precision jumps from block to block. It began by recommending an extensive series for those interested in deeper knowledge before outlining the foundational techniques necessary for executing a precision jump. Emphasis was placed on the basic mechanics, such as the importance of starting with proper foot positioning, utilizing arm movements for added momentum, and maintaining a solid body posture during takeoff and landing.\r\n\r\nKey techniques discussed included the necessity of bending the knees and hips at roughly 90 degrees upon landing, ensuring that the quads absorb most of the impact. The tutorial also highlighted the importance of visual targeting to enhance focus during the jump. It advised practicing by gradually increasing the distance of jumps as comfort and skill levels improve, promoting the idea that consistent practice leads to mastery of form and stability.\r\n\r\nAs jumps become larger or more complex, maintaining strict attention to technique is vital for safety and performance. The tutorial concluded by encouraging continual practice of these techniques to ensure accurate landings, especially as challenges increase, such as taking off from different surfaces or tackling obstacles like rails. Reinforcing good habits in precision jumping not only maximizes performance but also minimizes the risk of injury.\r\n\r\n**Key Points:**\r\n1. Proper foot positioning and body mechanics are essential for executing precision jumps effectively.\r\n2. Landing techniques should involve bending the knees and hips to absorb impact while stabilizing with arm movements.\r\n3. Gradual increase in jump difficulty requires reinforcement of precise techniques to ensure safety and reliability.'),(64424,55534,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(64425,55534,'svg_id',''),(64426,55534,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(64427,55534,'svg_colour',''),(64428,55534,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(64429,55534,'extra_variables',''),(64430,55534,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(64431,55534,'notes',''),(64432,55534,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(64433,55534,'enable_youtube_api',''),(64434,55534,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(64435,55534,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(64436,55534,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(64437,55534,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(64438,55534,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(64439,55534,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(64440,55534,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(64441,55534,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(64442,55534,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(64443,55534,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(64444,55534,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(64445,55534,'enable_transcript',''),(64446,55534,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(64447,55534,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(64448,55534,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(64449,55534,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the result.'),(64450,55534,'_transcript_chatgpt_prompt','field_672214208bf31'),(64451,55534,'rank_math_primary_tutorial_category','0'),(64452,55534,'video_filename','Jumping-Precisions/Tutorial-jumping-precisions-3-block-to-block.mp4'),(64453,55534,'_video_filename','field_677cead91f698'),(64454,55534,'portrait_thumbnail_image','Jumping-Precisions/screenshots/Tutorial-jumping-precisions-3-block-to-block_3_4.png'),(64455,55534,'_portrait_thumbnail_image',''),(64456,55534,'landscape_thumbnail_image','Jumping-Precisions/screenshots/Tutor