vels.\r\n\r\nOnce the landing technique is established, maintaining stability on the rail is emphasized. Proper grip with toes is suggested to aid in managing balance, alongside controlled arm positioning to stabilize the body upon landing. It\'s crucial to aim for a clean and controlled landing that can handle any potential consequences of miscalculation, ensuring safety throughout the practice. Furthermore, mastering bail techniques like the turn vault can enhance confidence and provide safety options for unexpected falls during practice.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Start practicing rail-to-rail maneuvers incrementally, focusing on balance and control.\r\n2. Overcoming fear through repeated exposure is essential for developing confidence in landings.\r\n3. Emphasize proper landing technique and stability, along with bail techniques for safety during practice.'),(64967,55539,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(64968,55539,'svg_id',''),(64969,55539,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(64970,55539,'svg_colour',''),(64971,55539,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(64972,55539,'extra_variables',''),(64973,55539,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(64974,55539,'notes',''),(64975,55539,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(64976,55539,'enable_youtube_api',''),(64977,55539,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(64978,55539,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(64979,55539,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(64980,55539,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(64981,55539,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(64982,55539,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(64983,55539,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(64984,55539,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(64985,55539,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(64986,55539,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(64987,55539,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(64988,55539,'enable_transcript',''),(64989,55539,'_enable_transcri