\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"EM4u8FLO8bcOIqy99x3u6CmziI6VBxc9cDwUrAhZHEQ-1733419974-1.0.1.1-fM309m5LLMQGEXkDHdxCO7IuhfK2ccU_biXqwwVSljDiYzNvo.yYys44spMTKyEQCVwRONfnObRW7vuEj4uDtg\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733421774,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"g0RiYCIVuncTus32A59JV29T3iMO5kOVtseChDRdcZk-1733419974292-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(65556,55544,'_video_chatgpt_response','field_67221dc82655d'),(65557,55544,'video_chatgpt_response_text','London Parkour is an organization dedicated to the practice and promotion of parkour as a transformative movement discipline. Their website, LONDONPARKOUR.com, serves as a platform for resources, tutorials, and information aimed at helping individuals improve their physical capabilities and change their mindset towards movement. They emphasize practical movement that can enhance both mental and physical well-being.\r\n\r\nThe organization leverages social media and video content to reach a broader audience. They encourage interested individuals to subscribe to their YouTube channel for parkour tutorials and insights. This approach not only fosters community engagement but also provides accessible training resources for practitioners at all skill levels.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, London Parkour maintains a presence on Instagram and offers direct contact via email for inquiries or further information. Their online platforms are designed to connect enthusiasts, share knowledge, and inspire individuals to explore the art of parkour.'),(65558,55544,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(65559,55544,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"we\'ve looked at the cat leap position\",\r\n        \"start\": 6.04,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.92\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"both bent arm and straight arm now we\'re\",\r\n        \"start\": 8.48,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.44\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"going to have a look at traversing in\",\r\n        \"start\": 10.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"those positions you want to again start\",\r\n        \"start\": 12.92,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.48\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"with the bent arm so you\'re nice and\",\r\n        \"start\": 16.32,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.36\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"high you\'re up or close to the top Edge\",\r\n        \"start\": 18.4,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.76\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"and when you move initially all you need\",\r\n        \"start\": 21.68,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.28\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"to do is move that hand a tiny bit get\",\r\n        \"start\": 24.16,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.439\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"used to putting your body weight on one\",\r\n        \"start\": 27.96,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"arm and then Shifting the other hand\",\r\n        \"start\": 30.599,\r\n        \"