le\": \"assistant\",n        \"content\": \"London Parkour is a dedicated platform focused on teaching the art of parkour through various tutorials and instructional content. Their website, LONDONPARKOUR.com, serves as a central hub for information and resources related to practical movement, aimed at helping individuals transform their physical abilities and perspectives on movement. Users can subscribe to the YouTube channel to receive updates and access a wealth of parkour-related content.nnThe organization emphasizes the importance of functional movement, encouraging participants to rethink how they move through their environment. This practical approach not only promotes physical fitness but also enhances mental agility, promoting overall well-being. The tutorials are designed to cater to a wide range of skill levels, from beginners to more advanced practitioners.nnTo stay connected with the community, London Parkour maintains an active presence on social media platforms such as Instagram and YouTube, where they share tips, videos, and the latest news related to parkour. Interested individuals can reach out via email for further engagement and inquiries, ensuring a supportive and interactive environment for all parkour enthusiasts.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 207,n    \"total_tokens\": 439,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"yvL1AmASkD