eam for any inquiries. The organization seeks to inspire and empower people through the art of movement, making parkour accessible to all.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 232,n    \"completion_tokens\": 212,n    \"total_tokens\": 444,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"RShyAv6S7KVUU79N61aWzMrY5Lguk2cVaxsE9sWFTw0-1733420088-1.0.1.1-6cVWW2_Rz_tTXoMr6lIoEOM93aB.ppPwIiype11_8dk..fOB3pgb036fFxc2xV_WAy6JFqiUZFhJCouwFdZLhA\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733421888,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"ipIilBg7ZaRvvWvw4o56QBR6.URs1RSTo_uQdXK7_v0-1733420088350-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(66395,55551,'_video_chatgpt_response','field_67221dc82655d'),(66396,55551,'video_chatgpt_response_text','London Parkour is an organization dedicated to teaching the art of parkour, focusing on practical movement techniques that can transform how individuals think, move, and feel. They offer a variety of resources, tutorials, and instructional videos to help practitioners at all levels improve their skills. The organization emphasizes community involvement and encourages people to engage with their content through social media and other platforms.\r\n\r\nTheir presence on social media, including Instagram and YouTube, helps reach a wider audience and connects enthusiasts of parkour around the world. By subscribing to their channel, viewers can access a wealth of tutorials and tips aimed at enhancing their abilities in parkour. This interactive approach fosters a supportive environment for both beginners and experienced practitioners.\r\n\r\nFor those interested in learning more about parkour and joining the community, further information can be found on their official website, LondoonParkour.com. There, individuals can explore various resources, sign up for classes, or contact the team for any inquiries. The organization seeks to inspire and empower people through the art of movement, making parkour accessible to all.'),(66397,55551,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(66398,55551,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"so a common scenario you will find a lot\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.319,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.681\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"in parkour is when you\",\r\n        \"start\": 9,\r\n        \"duration\": 5.519\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"Traverse you will then have to finish\",\r\n        \"start\": 12,\r\n        \"duration\": 3.76\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"with a climb\",\r\n        \"start\": 14.519,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.84\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"up obviously with this you need to be\",\r\n        \"start\": 15.76,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.2\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"able to do a climb up uh so see the\",\r\n        \"start\": 19.359,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.201\r\n    },