gnificant challenge that tests both physical conditioning and technique. It requires not just strength but also an understanding of momentum and body movement to perform effectively under fatigue. Success in these movements will enhance overall parkour skill and contribute to greater agility and flexibility in performing various maneuvers.nnKey Points:n1. Transitioning from a traverse to a climb-up is crucial in parkour and requires specific body mechanics.n2. Proper technique involving hand and foot placement is essential for executing an effective climb-up.n3. The combination of traversing and climbing tests one\'s physical endurance and technique, highlighting the need for practice.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1529,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 304,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1833,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_bba3c8e70b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"knjZV.HAZ9R8f8k1gOKjpG4n1CwxZCcQ091iPF3.Djw-1733420094-1.0.1.1-kL2p2Aq4B56JTMye5XdMMuVOgPCnhGzFZYqJASf1UB5pXMl1jjpfEEr6t2kgTLUFJfMkcvT6YlUfW8yTl8C4BQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733421894,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"DuxPTSEgXFiiUnz66UBdlQLeerJaWEkUGKO8TmvJRCw-1733420094034-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(66403,55551,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(66404,55551,'video_transcript_chatgpt','In parkour, transitioning from traversing to climbing up is a fundamental movement that requires practice and coordination. When completing a traverse, it’s essential to prepare for the subsequent climb-up effectively. This movement involves strategic hand placement and body mechanics to ensure a successful ascent after navigating across a surface. As fatigue sets in from traversing, executing a climb-up can become increasingly difficult, making it crucial to practice this combination to enhance technique and physical endurance.\r\n\r\nThe climb-up itself involves several key steps that need to be mastered. Initially, one must engage in traversing while ensuring the body remains oriented toward the climb. As the individual reaches the point of ascent, maintaining focus on proper hand positioning and elevating the elbows will assist in generating the necessary upper body strength. Feet placement is equally vital, as they need to be positioned appropriately to facilitate a smooth transition from hanging to climbing up.\r\n\r\nCombining the traverse and climb-up presents a significant challenge that tests both physical conditioning and technique. It requires not just strength but also an understanding of momentum and body movement to perform effectively under fatigue. Success in these movements will enhance overall parkour skill and contribute to greater agility and flexibility in performing various maneuvers.\r\n\r\nKey Points:\r\n1. Transitioning from a traverse to a climb-up is crucial in parkour and requires specific body mechanics.\r\n2. Proper technique involving hand and foot placement is essential for executing an effective climb-up.\r\n3. The combination of traversing and climbing tests one\'s physical endurance and technique, highlighting the need for practice.'),(66405,55551,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(66406,55551,'svg_id',''),(66407,55551,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(66408,55551,'svg_colour',''),(66409,55551,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(66410,55551,'extra_variables',''),(66411,55551,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(66412,55551,'notes',''),(66413,55551,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(66414,55551,'enable_youtube_api',''),(66415,55551,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(66416,55551,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(66417,55551,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(66418,55551,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(66419,55551,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(66420,55551,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(66421,55551,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(66422,55551,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(66423,55551,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(66424,55551,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(66425,55551,'_enable_use_as_excerpt','field_67225a0b50411'),(66426,55551,'enable_transcript',''),(66427,55551,'_enable_transcript','field_6722088670e84'),(66428,55551,'enable_transcript_chatgpt',''),(66429,55551,'_enable_transcript_chatgpt','field_67223080dbaa5'),(66430,55551,'transcript_chatgpt_prompt','Focus on the climb-up part of the movement. Summarise the following transcript into three paragraphs and summarise with three key points. Never mention the speaker or the transcript. I want this to sound like I wrote the re