      ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1085,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 208,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 1293,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0aa8d3e20b\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"AFx3Awo5sdUdjuwo6UENlvNG0ZJaGEXSCPNXZJoBs8U-1735744534-1.0.1.1-Hmfv1fgP6oEKuZvma2lVFYSlIgxW3noF4H4zQB7op9j5Q8cm293wJNG8IqhPPDUGD8pI8YYA4VTg850uDuNt4w\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746334,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \".KJLgCDbMELOfBw8hBM2TH826n0L8_DZJSgVHqeKe5s-1735744534740-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(66666,55554,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(66667,55554,'video_transcript_chatgpt','In learning how to perform a wall run, one must eventually practice with walls that are at least double the height of their own. It\'s emphasized that finding the right foot position against the wall is essential. Ensuring that the hand used to grip the wall corresponds with the foot on the wall enhances the ability to reach higher and successfully navigate the wall.\r\n\r\nMomentum plays a critical role in executing the wall run effectively. The focus should be on converting sideways movement into upward momentum. Coordinating foot placement correctly on the wall will facilitate this translation, allowing for greater height when performing the maneuver.\r\n\r\nAfter practicing, one can attempt to run up a wall that poses a challenge, ideally one that is nearly double their height. The process highlighted is crucial for mastering the wall run and achieving a comfortable elevation.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. Proper foot and hand positioning is essential for effective wall runs.\r\n2. Building momentum is necessary to convert sideways movement into upward movement.\r\n3. Practicing on walls that are double one’s height helps in mastering the wall run technique.'),(66668,55554,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(66669,55554,'svg_id',''),(66670,55554,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(66671,55554,'svg_colour',''),(66672,55554,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(66673,55554,'extra_variables',''),(66674,55554,'_extra_variables','field_671615de0e542'),(66675,55554,'notes',''),(66676,55554,'_notes','field_6749f56647b9e'),(66677,55554,'enable_youtube_api',''),(66678,55554,'_enable_youtube_api','field_6721ddb5e8fdf'),(66679,55554,'enable_youtube_filter',''),(66680,55554,'_enable_youtube_filter','field_67225378495f0'),(66681,55554,'wordpress_filter_name','tutorial_filter'),(66682,55554,'_wordpress_filter_name','field_6722538b495f1'),(66683,55554,'enable_youtube_chatgpt',''),(66684,55554,'_enable_youtube_chatgpt','field_6721f22d49ffe'),(66685,55554,'youtube_chatgpt_prompt','Summarise the following description into three paragraphs :'),(66686,55554,'_youtube_chatgpt_prompt','field_67222f1d7722b'),(66687,55554,'enable_use_as_excerpt',''),(66688,55554,'_enable_