XvgxLjyrYotSzbAJcxrP1\",\r\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\r\n        \"created\": 1735744483,\r\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\r\n        \"choices\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"index\": 0,\r\n                \"message\": {\r\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n                    \"content\": \"The Splat Cat is a technique used when descending from a height by splatting against a wall before safely dropping onto the ground. Initially, it serves as a safety measure when one has attempted a jump but is unable to reach the top of the wall, allowing for a controlled descent from a lower position instead of risking an uncontrolled fall. The movement has evolved into a more advanced skill where one can ricochet off a lower wall to facilitate a descent from a greater height, enabling a safer drop.nnTo begin learning the Splat Cat, one should focus on making simultaneous contact with all four limbs against the wall. Practicing basic jumps while attempting to contact the wall with hands and feet is essential to build coordination and comfort with the technique. As proficiency increases, additional steps can be introduced, such as stepping back before jumping to increase the distance and control the impact upon landing.nnThe progression of mastering the Splat Cat involves starting with lower walls before gradually increasing height and complexity. Practitioners can eventually perform more advanced variants, including running jumps and larger drops. This technique is not only useful for safety while descending but also enhances overall agility and control during jumps and landings.nnKey points:n1. The Splat Cat is a safety technique for controlled descents from height, initially used to avoid falls when jumps are unsuccessful.n2. Coordination of all four limbs is crucial when practicing the Splat Cat, with a focus on skillfully landing to avoid injury.n3. Mastery involves progressing from lower walls to higher jumps and advanced variants, enhancing both agility and safety.\",\r\n                    \"refusal\": null\r\n                },\r\n                \"logprobs\": null,\r\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n            }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"usage\": {\r\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 3018,\r\n            \"completion_tokens\": 315,\r\n            \"total_tokens\": 3333,\r\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0\r\n            },\r\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\r\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"audio_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,\r\n                \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0\r\n            }\r\n        },\r\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_d02d531b47\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"YXd4W6OdT09eNvgKhR80TOgNM6oFnLPPP5oo3tVAZX4-1735744496-1.0.1.1-2OLlmY3if9Vqewu.qeRvpHGNvZxs_ICuw03JcncH4TxnfKWee0iOH2N.0R5YpBR4_tFzHKEK2bWt5obTbzHxpQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1735746296,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"yjt6Ldhm5VRrw79dLmOk3n.T0fDpG6snxOc8O6yoCQI-1735744496140-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(68231,55573,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(68232,55573,'video_transcript_chatgpt','The Splat Cat is a technique used when descending from a height by splatting against a wall before safely dropping onto the ground. Initially, it serves as a safety measure when one has attempted a jump but is unable to reach the top of the wall, allowing for a controlled descent from a lower position instead of risking an uncontrolled fall. The movement has evolved into a more advanced skill where one can ricochet off a lower wall to facilitate a descent from a greater height, enabling a safer drop.\r\n\r\nTo begin learning the Splat Cat, one should focus on making simultaneous contact with all four limbs against the wall. Practicing basic jumps while attempting to contact the wall with hands and feet is essential to build coordination and comfort with the technique. As proficiency increases, additional steps can be introduced, such as stepping back before jumping to increase the distance and control the impact upon landing.\r\n\r\nThe progression of mastering the Splat Cat involves starting with lower walls before gradually increasing height and complexity. Practitioners can eventually perform more advanced variants, including running jumps and larger drops. This technique is not only useful for safety while descending but also enhances overall agility and control during jumps and landings.\r\n\r\nKey points:\r\n1. The Splat Cat is a safety technique for controlled descents from height, initially used to avoid falls when jumps are unsuccessful.\r\n2. Coordination of all four limbs is crucial when practicing the Splat Cat, with a focus on skillfully landing to avoid injury.\r\n3. Mastery involves progressing from lower walls to higher jumps and advanced variants, enhancing both agility and safety.'),(68233,55573,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(68234,55573,'svg_id',''),(68235,55573,'_svg_id','field_67160c975525b'),(68236,55573,'svg_colour',''),(68237,55573,'_svg_colour','field_67161465e3b58'),(68238,55573,'extra_variabl