o tutorials and demonstrations. By joining their online community, followers can stay updated on new techniques and participate in discussions related to parkour.nnIn addition to their website and YouTube channel, London Parkour is active on Instagram, providing visual content and updates about their activities. Those looking to learn more or seek additional information can reach out via email. The organization is dedicated to expanding the parkour community and making the art of movement more accessible to everyone.\",n        \"refusal\": nulln      },n      \"logprobs\": null,n      \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"n    }n  ],n  \"usage\": {n    \"prompt_tokens\": 233,n    \"completion_tokens\": 205,n    \"total_tokens\": 438,n    \"prompt_tokens_details\": {n      \"cached_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0n    },n    \"completion_tokens_details\": {n      \"reasoning_tokens\": 0,n      \"audio_tokens\": 0,n      \"accepted_prediction_tokens\": 0,n      \"rejected_prediction_tokens\": 0n    }n  },n  \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0705bf87c0\"n}n\",\r\n    \"response\": {\r\n        \"code\": 200,\r\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"cookies\": [\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\r\n            \"value\": \"1nqJ8d8H5iz1I30nGMVPw9MHMITL1K5FAPNTRbRlMYY-1733213715-1.0.1.1-z9NDoEwyFhIxTAHTIVr_GGF57m1KHm111NQIyKd7KXGXsANiDkL3ql0yrigdhmOzQIcGwlIcc.N4SAPo2oMjLQ\",\r\n            \"expires\": 1733215515,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\r\n            \"value\": \"y8Iv2rowlD8oSZsm7_iqQYaAFwRx2hcf645H1_ApHKg-1733213715660-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\r\n            \"expires\": null,\r\n            \"path\": \"/\",\r\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\r\n            \"port\": null,\r\n            \"host_only\": false\r\n        }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"filename\": null,\r\n    \"http_response\": {\r\n        \"data\": null,\r\n        \"headers\": null,\r\n        \"status\": null\r\n    }\r\n}'),(69192,55582,'_video_chatgpt_response','field_67221dc82655d'),(69193,55582,'video_chatgpt_response_text','The provided link leads to London Parkour\'s official website, where enthusiasts can learn about parkour and its practical applications in movement. The site features a \"How To\" series, specifically focusing on the skill of balancing on a rail with one foot, which is an integral part of parkour training. This method emphasizes transforming not just physical movement but also the way individuals think and interact with their environment.\r\n\r\nLondon Parkour offers resources for both beginners and experienced practitioners, aiming to enhance their skills and understanding of parkour. The platform encourages users to subscribe to their YouTube channel for video tutorials and demonstrations. By joining their online community, followers can stay updated on new techniques and participate in discussions related to parkour.\r\n\r\nIn addition to their website and YouTube channel, London Parkour is active on Instagram, providing visual content and updates about their activities. Those looking to learn more or seek additional information can reach out via email. The organization is dedicated to expanding the parkour community and making the art of movement more accessible to everyone.'),(69194,55582,'_video_chatgpt_response_text','field_6722334bac798'),(69195,55582,'video_transcript_json','[\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"let\'s have a look at some balancing so\",\r\n        \"start\": 5.64,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.079\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"we\'re going to balance on the rail here\",\r\n        \"start\": 9.2,\r\n        \"duration\": 4.76\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\": \"the first thing I\'m going to do is get\",\r\n        \"start\": 11.719,\r\n        \"duration\": 6.081\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"text\"