chanics of your legs and how they impact your lift. By practicing the leg drive from a safe starting position like a box, you’ll be able to develop the muscle memory and strength you need for more significant jumps. Keep working on your techniques, and you’ll notice improvements in both your jumping ability and overall athleticism.nnHighlights:n- Practice jumping from a sturdy box to build technique and strength.n- Focus on using opposite leg drive to enhance momentum during jumps.n- Regularly working on your jumping mechanics leads to improved height and performance.\",\n                    \"refusal\": null\n                },\n                \"logprobs\": null,\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"usage\": {\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 295,\n            \"completion_tokens\": 286,\n            \"total_tokens\": 581,\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0\n            },\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0\n            }\n        },\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0ba0d124f1\"\n    },\n    \"response\": {\n        \"code\": 200,\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\n    },\n    \"cookies\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\n            \"value\": \"7iWc5_Gc6RnPVQ5VB6FGmAgu0UAbAYBe5bEFPyVN7xs-1730718194-1.0.1.1-YSa36T6VzlT4tPRWUGXVxdZ.EG35v29_vc2fHBxbMa4bFiDAKzPxFCf7ZpCIaUgu6DNGDw9O.dn1FD5bKLSo1Q\",\n            \"expires\": 1730719994,\n            \"path\": \"/\",\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\n            \"port\": null,\n            \"host_only\": false\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\n            \"value\": \"XaHl6TqU_7wiehMTgxlT3P.f8zn1pfb3UB7YMOVZYsk-1730718194050-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\n            \"expires\": null,\n            \"path\": \"/\",\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\n            \"port\": null,\n            \"host_only\": false\n        }\