your performance but also makes you feel more secure and confident in your movements. Take the time to practice until it becomes second nature, and you’ll notice a significant difference in your abilities and comfort level. Remember, the more you engage your muscles and maintain proper form, the more effective and safe your landings will be!\n\n- Land on the balls of your feet to absorb impact effectively.\n- Keep your knees bent and muscles contracted for stability.\n- Practice the proper position to enhance performance and reduce injury risk.'),(74918,55849,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(74919,55849,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"landing\",\n        \"start\": 0.44,\n        \"duration\": 4.96\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"position so let\'s talk about that just a\",\n        \"start\": 1.84,\n        \"duration\": 5.919\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"little bit so we got our Basics right\",\n        \"start\": 5.4,\n        \"duration\": 5.84\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"when you land you want to land on the\",\n        \"start\": 7.759,\n        \"duration\": 5.76\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"balls of the feet so the the front part\",\n        \"start\": 11.24,\n        \"duration\": 5.879\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"of your foot your knees want to be bent\",\n        \"start\": 13.519,\n        \"duration\": 6.76\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"and you want to be super contracted so\",\n        \"start\": 17.119,\n        \"duration\": 5.4\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"uh you want to contract your muscles\",\n        \"start\": 20.279,\n        \"duration\": 4.961\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"because they are what are going to take\",\n        \"start\": 22.519,\n        \"duration\": 4.401\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the impact they\'re going to take and\",\n        \"start\": 25.24,\n        \"duration\": 4.879\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"absorb the 