ith your muscle contraction and provide further control in maintaining the landing position.\n\nIn conclusion, mastering body tension is a simple yet powerful way to enhance your landing technique. By effectively engaging your muscles and focusing on strategic breathing, you can protect your spine and improve your overall balance. So next time you land, remember to squeeze as hard as you can and keep those core muscles engaged — your body will thank you for it!\n\n- Engage all major muscle groups when landing to absorb impact better.\n- Focus on squeezing your glutes and abs for spinal stability.\n- Exhale during landing to enhance muscle control and overall balance.'),(75084,55854,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(75085,55854,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"all right body tension so let\'s talk\",\n        \"start\": 0.24,\n        \"duration\": 6\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"about body tension when you\'re Landing\",\n        \"start\": 3,\n        \"duration\": 6.2\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you want to squeeze as hard as you can\",\n        \"start\": 6.24,\n        \"duration\": 6.6\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"when you land now similar to the takeoff\",\n        \"start\": 9.2,\n        \"duration\": 5.599\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the reason for this is you\'re supporting\",\n        \"start\": 12.84,\n        \"duration\": 3.88\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"your spine you\'re supporting your lower\",\n        \"start\": 14.799,\n        \"duration\": 7.081\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"back and you are trying to get all of\",\n        \"start\": 16.72,\n        \"duration\": 7.6\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the impact going through your muscles\",\n        \"start\": 21.88,\n        \"duration\": 4.559\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"not your joints especially your lower\",\n        \"start\": 24.32,\n        \"duration\": 5.4\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"