. So, if you find yourself struggling with a challenging jump, don\'t hesitate to practice the previous ones again. This regression reinforces your skills and helps solidify your foundation, making it easier to tackle the next level.\n\nUltimately, the key takeaway here is that in the journey of learning or improving a skill, taking a step back is not a setback. By regressing through the simpler stages, you allow yourself the opportunity to regain confidence and refine your technique. This strategy of \"regress to progress\" can provide a meaningful boost to your performance, enabling you to approach greater challenges with renewed confidence and skill.\n\n- Embrace regressing to build confidence and refine skills.\n- Review and practice simpler stages when facing challenges.\n- Regressive practice can be a powerful tool for long-term progress.'),(75254,55861,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(75255,55861,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"don\'t be afraid of regressing so as you\",\n        \"start\": 0.199,\n        \"duration\": 5.56\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"build up to\",\n        \"start\": 4.08,\n        \"duration\": 5.08\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"something don\'t get stuck on just the\",\n        \"start\": 5.759,\n        \"duration\": 4.92\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"jump that you\'re trying to do so if I\",\n        \"start\": 9.16,\n        \"duration\": 3.479\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"was trying to break this jump and I was\",\n        \"start\": 10.679,\n        \"duration\": 4.681\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"trying to overcome the distance but I\",\n        \"start\": 12.639,\n        \"duration\": 5.921\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"had worked up to it for with other jumps\",\n        \"start\": 15.36,\n        \"duration\": 5.4\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"maybe this one over here which is a bit\",\n        \"start\": 18.56,\n        \"duration\": 4.6\n 