','tutorial'),(75364,55866,'order_position','1'),(75365,55866,'originalJSON','{\"kind\":\"youtube#playlistItem\",\"etag\":\"5J1_APivbHBxGp1KXymLD1W0I-E\",\"id\":\"UExsSWQ4SDdOa3hUUGR1VnNvOXBnZWN2VkJzWmVQaUFhUC5BRjJDODk5REM0NjkzMUIy\",\"snippet\":{\"publishedAt\":\"2020-04-11T06:44:50Z\",\"channelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\",\"title\":\"How to Land #02 - Focus Parkour Tutorial. [059]\",\"description\":\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Land (Beginner) in Parkour - Focus.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Land Series. Episode #02nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Jumping #Focus #---nnFocal PointsnnKeep your eye on a specific point of the landing. This will help to eliminate outside distractions and the peripheral vision from pulling your attention away.nPractice the basics as if they\'re advanced. Maintain visual contact with your mark for the entire jump.nn When performing maximum-ability fear-based jumps, our attention will want to move from \'fight\' mode to \'flight\' mode. The flight mode will use any excuse to stop you from doing the jump. By using a focal point, you\'re reducing the amount of excuses your sympathetic nervous system can use.nnThere are occasions when you also jump and \'blackout\' for a fraction of a second as the fear goes to maximum. By having a focus point, you can negate this effect. nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/2Rcs8VenCat Leaps Tutorial u25b6 https://bit. Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/2S1yBTinUnderbar Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/34FM7yInSwinging Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cbcAbKnRolling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIuogAnJumping Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIfbMjnCrawling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vIT7qpnClimbing Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vNB6YinBalancing Demo u25b6 https://bit. to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COMnnud83dudd39 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.nnu26a1ufe0f https://pulse.localhost:8443nnud83euddea https://labs.localhost:8443nnud83dudd38 https://www.Instagram.com/london_parkournnud83dudd38 https://www.youtube.com/londonparkournnud83dudd38 contact@localhost:8443nnu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nnu3000u3000   video features Parkour performed either by professionals or under the supervision of professionals. All members of LondonParkour have been training since 2005 and insist that no one attempt to re-create or re-enact any ROOFTOP activities or movement AT HEIGHT performed in these videos. Do not use private property.nnu2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501n{{Tag:beginner}}{{PostType:Tutorial}}{{Tax:Jumping}}{{Series:Landing Tips}}\"\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AF5dFcJxnso/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AF5dFcJxnso/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AF5dFcJxnso/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AF5dFcJxnso/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AF5dFcJxnso/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}},\"channelTitle\":\"London Parkour\",\"playlistId\":\"PLlId8H7NkxTPduVso9pgecvVBsZePiAaP\",\"position\":1,\"resourceId\":{\"kind\":\"youtube#video\",\"videoId\":\"AF5dFcJxnso\"},\"videoOwnerChannelTitle\":\"London Parkour\",\"videoOwnerChannelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\"},\"index\":1}'),(75366,55866,'scrapeId','Tutorial - Landings'),(75367,55866,'authId','Auth1'),(75368,55866,'searchId','Tutorials - Landings'),(75369,55866,'filterId','none'),(75370,55866,'mapperId','YouTube - Playlist Items - Tutorial Videos'),(75371,55866,'importId','Tutorial Videos - Landings'),(75372,55866,'_edit_last','1'),(75373,55866,'video_transcript_chatgpt','When it comes to mastering jumps, whether for sports or other activities, focusing your gaze can make a significant difference in your performance. One common challenge many encounter is the fear or distraction that can arise when airborne. The trick to overcoming this mental hurdle lies in your ability to maintain a clear focal point both before and during the jump. This tutorial will guide you through the simple yet effective technique of using a focal point to enhance your jumping confidence and accuracy.\n\nTo begin, choose a specific spot or point on the jump. This is your focal point, and it\'s essential that you keep your eyes fixed on it throughout the entire jump. When you concentrate on this point, it helps block out any distractions or fears that may pop up while you’re in the air. Instead of letting your gaze wander and allowing anxiety to creep in, commit to keeping your focus sharp. As you take off, remind yourself to maintain that focus on your chosen spot, which will also assist you in landing as precisely as possible.\n\nIn summary, using a focal point during jumps can transform your experience, making it more controlled and confident. By keeping your eyes locked onto this point, you’ll be better equipped to manage any fear and execute your jump with greater precision. Embrace this technique, and you may find that jumps become not just manageable, but enjoyable as well. \n\n- Select a specific focal point on the jump to maintain focus and reduce distractions.\n- Keep your eyes on that point throughout the jump for better control.\n- Practice this technique to build confidence and improve landing accuracy.'),(75374,55866,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(75375,55866,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"everyone we\'re gonna have a look at\",\n        \"start\": 5.839,\n        \"duration\": 8.701\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"looking today so I want you to pick a\",\n        \"start\": 8.929,\n        \"duration\": 10.061\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"point on the jump and your eyes stay on\",\n        \"start\": 14.54,\n        \"duration\": 6.249\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"that point that it\'s gonna be your focal\",\n        \"start\": 18.99,\n        \"duration\": 4.199\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"point sometimes what happens is when we\",\n        \"start\": 20.789,\n        \"duration\": 4.381\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"jump if you start looking all over the\",\n        \"start\": 23.189,\n        \"duration\": 6.691\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"place and it doesn\'t become focused and\",\n        \"start\": 25.17,\n        \"duration\": 7.47\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you sometimes if you\'re doing big fear\",\n        \"start\": 29.88,\n        \"duration\": 6.019\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"jumps it\'s hard to block everything out\",\n        \"start\": 32.64,\n        \"duration\": 6.87\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"picking a point and a spot on there and\",\n        \"start\":