UR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Jumping #Barefoot #---nnBarefootnnTraining barefoot is hugely underrated. Shoes are masking the sensitivity of the feet and softening the environment for you. This makes the foot weaker and less sensitive. Get rid of the \'crutch\' of the shoe for a while and practice landing with nothing between you and the landing surface.nnYou foot is filled with nerves and receptors which you won\'t be using by padding them with the foam from a shoe. We\'ll cover shoes in another video, but for now, be aware that the reduced proprioception in the foot makes you less adaptable and weaker.nnFor continued reading on barefoot running, check out (@chrismcdougallauthor) Chris Mcdougall\'s \'Born to Run\' book. A fantastic read with a few friends of mine in it ud83dudcaa  with a chapter about parkour. It explains some interesting points about barefoot running and the history of trainers and how Nike has basically crippled everyone. Essential reading for anyone wanting to know about movement! nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/2Rcs8VenCat Leaps Tutorial u25b6 https://bit. Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/2S1yBTinUnderbar Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/34FM7yInSwinging Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cbcAbKnRolling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIuogAnJumping Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIfbMjnCrawling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vIT7qpnClimbing Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vNB6YinBalancing Demo u25b6 https://bit. to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COMnnud83dudd39 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.nnu26a1ufe0f https://pulse.localhost:8