,'GolxNNuW9Ys'),(75771,55883,'video_type','tutorial'),(75772,55883,'order_position','0'),(75773,55883,'originalJSON','{\"kind\":\"youtube#playlistItem\",\"etag\":\"_agZ6AcjProHcNrxfGJqj5toEWY\",\"id\":\"UExsSWQ4SDdOa3hUTWxYcURva0VoM2JOTzFCVzlMcm9UNy5EMEEwRUY5M0RDRTU3NDJC\",\"snippet\":{\"publishedAt\":\"2020-02-19T15:47:57Z\",\"channelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\",\"title\":\"How to Step Vault #1 - Introduction Parkour Tutorial. [114]\",\"description\":\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Step Vault (Beginner) in Parkour - Introduction.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Step Vault Series. Episode #1nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Vaulting #StepVault #---nnThe step vault, or safety vault, is one of the most used techniques within parkour. The purpose is to allow maximum confidence overcoming an obstacle safely and securely.nnIt is usually the vault that is taught first to beginners because it\'s pretty simple to understand, however the details of this particular vault are hugely under appreciated. There are many parts of the step vault that are regularly missed out on and will actually hinder the user, rather than help them.nnTry to take the vault slowly to begin with, trying to fully understand exactly what your body is doing and why.nnRemember, as always, to try both sides - left and right hand.nnThe key is control and security, so the more confidence you feel with this vault, the better. Very advanced practitioners will also utilise this vault, especially when they\'re feeling uncomfortable in the situation, so nailing this down to perfection is in your best interest.nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tu