 48.03,\n        \"duration\": 3.959\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"kind of start going straight to it but\",\n        \"start\": 49.98,\n        \"duration\": 3.93\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you really want to be careful at the\",\n        \"start\": 51.989,\n        \"duration\": 4.921\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"beginning so go higher and come down on\",\n        \"start\": 53.91,\n        \"duration\": 6.8\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"to it this is also going to come in too\",\n        \"start\": 56.91,\n        \"duration\": 3.8\n    }\n]'),(75904,55888,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(75905,55888,'video_transcript_srt','1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000\nall right so this is fault number two\n\n2\n00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000\nsometimes I see people trying to get\n\n3\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000\nonto the step vault and this is to do\n\n4\n00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000\nwith the foot the foot tends to go\n\n5\n00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000\ndirectly straight at the box so people\n\n6\n00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000\nput their hand on and they put their\n\n7\n00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000\nfoot straight up to it and it can catch\n\n8\n00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000\nif they don\'t get their leg high enough\n\n9\n00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000\nwell you actually want to do is try to\n\n10\n00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000\ngo higher than the box so you can come\n\n11\n00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000\ndown and place your foot onto it so the\n\n12\n00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000\ntrajectory is up and you come down not\n\n13\n00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000\nstraight up to it so what you actually\n\n14\n00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000\nwant to do is go hand over and then you\n\n15\n00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000\ncan come down onto it and step through\n\n16\n00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,000\nthis is going to eliminate any tripping\n\n17\n00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000\nup onto the wall and also the more you\n\n18\n00:00:48,000 --> 00:0