:\"2019-06-25T08:31:09Z\",\"channelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\",\"title\":\"How to Balance #01 - Introduction Parkour Tutorial. [001]\",\"description\":\"\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Balance (Beginner) in Parkour - Introduction.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Balance Series. Episode #01nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Balancing #Introduction #---nn## Balancing with arms straight.n nnMake sure your arms are at shoulder height and straight.n This can work for you on multiple levels.nn n- Having your arms straight and at shoulder height will help to keep a straighter posture and everything aligned along the bar.n n- Any wobble on the bar can be corrected easier by having finer control of the hips.n The arms being far away from the body will allow for finer control of where the hips can go.n n- This will also act as conditioning for your shoulders.n Getting comfortable in this position and strong in the shoulders will allow you to stay on the bar for longer and fight the fatigue.n Endurance for the win!nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/2Rcs8VenCat Leaps Tutorial u25b6 https://bit. Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/2S1yBTinUnderbar Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/34FM7yInSwinging Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cbcAbKnRolling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIuogAnJumping Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIfbMjnCrawling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vIT7qpnClimbing Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vNB6YinBalancing Demo u25b6 https://bit. to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COMnnud83dudd39 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.nnu26a1ufe0