 so today we\'re going to have a go\n\n2\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000\nat moving sideways particularly we\'re\n\n3\n00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000\ngoing to focus on the feet crossing over\n\n4\n00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000\nand then the next one coming out again\n\n5\n00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000\nthis is a little bit more tricky it\'s\n\n6\n00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000\ngoing to require a bit more strength and\n\n7\n00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000\ncontraction in the legs and to hold that\n\n8\n00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000\nbalance alright just persevere keep\n\n9\n00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:46,000\ntrying but make sure you don\'t rush it\n\n10\n00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:48,000\nevery step is nice and controlled okay\n\n11\n00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000\nso as you can see it\'s not rushed the\n\n12\n00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000\nidea is I\'m going on to the ball or foot\n\n13\n00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000\nevery time in the correct position and\n\n14\n00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000\nthen bringing that other foot away all\n\n15\n00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000\nright have some fun enjoy it good luck\n\n'),(76096,55896,'_video_transcript_srt','field_67224b69b74d7'),(76097,55896,'video_transcript_chatgpt_json','{\n    \"headers\": {},\n    \"body\": {\n        \"id\": \"chatcmpl-APp86fZbl4XEsJgQg26Id8ZEqyxlC\",\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion\",\n        \"created\": 1730718106,\n        \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18\",\n        \"choices\": [\n            {\n                \"index\": 0,\n                \"message\": {\n                    \"role\": \"assistant\",\n                    \"content\": \"If you\'re looking to enhance your lateral movement skills, you\'ve come to the right place! Sideways movement is not only essential for activities like sports or dance but can also improve your overall balance and coordination. In this tutorial, we\'re going to focus on a specific technique that involves crossing your feet over each other as you move sideways. This exercise helps build strength in your legs and improve your body control.nnTo start, remember that the key to successfully moving sideways is to take your time and maintain a controlled pace. Begin by shifting your weight onto the ball of one foot before bringing the other foot across it. Make sure to keep your movements deliberate and avoid rushing. As you step, aim to find your balance on the foot you\'ve just shifted to, allowing yourself to feel steady before bringing the other foot away again. This will not only help you develop muscle strength but also reinforce your ability to stay balanced during the motion. Keep practicing and don’t hesitate to have some fun with it!nnIn conclusion, mastering lateral foot movements can significantly improve your agility and stability. By focusing on controlled, deliberate steps and crossing your feet, you will strengthen your legs and enhance your balance. Just remember to be patient with yourself as you practice—consistent effort will lead to better results over time. Enjoy the process, and good luck with your training!nn- Move sideways by crossing your feet for better balance and strength.n- Take your time; controlled movements are crucial for success.n- Focus on your weight distribution to enhance stability while moving.\",\n                    \"refusal\": null\n                },\n                \"logprobs\": null,\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"usage\": {\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 324,\n            \"completion_tokens\": 301,\n            \"total_tokens\": 625,\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0\n            },\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0\n            }\n        },\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0ba0d124f1\"\n    },\n    \"response\": {\n        \"code\": 200,\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\n    },\n    \"cookies\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\n            \"value\": \"bPRlETavLYmlbnMelhoA5Sksg.H2RuXDzplsp3CBgik-1730718111-1.0.1.1-HdCEEtPeiHAsnEWp0jm9GNZBZMSfaUFN99q2NpN.Vvhp.36DO_rgpz.MrlvJqteqRm2Nx7zVm0scBqWTPxd0xQ\",\n            \"expires\": 1730719911,\n            \"path\": \"/\",\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\n            \"port\": null,\n            \"host_only\": false\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\n            \"value\": \"0uAtsGK7oKIYDlEJw3fW8pb6xRAnOLN7Xzr93865nP4-1730718111267-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\n            \"expires\": null,\n            \"path\": \"/\",\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\n            \"port\": null,\n            \"host_only\": false\n        }\n    ],\n    \"filename\": null,\n    \"http_response\": {\n        \"data\": null,\n        \"headers\": null,\n        \"status\": null\n    }\n}'),(76098,55896,'_video_transcript_chatgpt_json','field_67224645b19c3'),(76099,55896,'video_transcript_chatgpt','If you\'re looking to enhance your lateral movement skills, you\'ve come to the right place! Sideways movement is not only essential for activities like sports or dance but can also improve your overall balance and coordination. In this tutorial, we\'re going to focus on a specific technique that involves crossing your feet over each other as you move sideways. This exercise helps build strength in your legs and improve your body control.\n\nTo start, remember that the key to successfully moving sideways is to take your time and maintain a controlled pace. Begin by shifting your weight onto the ball of one foot before bringing the other foot across it. Make sure to keep your movements deliberate and avoid rushing. As you step, aim to find your balance on the foot you\'ve just shifted to, allowing yourself to feel steady before bringing the other foot away again. This will not only help you develop muscle strength but also reinforce your ability to stay balanced during the motion. Keep practicing and don’t hesitate to have some fun with it!\n\nIn conclusion, mastering lateral foot movements can significantly improve your agility and stability. By focusing on controlled, deliberate steps and crossing your feet, you will strengthen your legs and enhance your balance. Just remember to be patient with yourself as you practice—consistent effort will lead to better results over time. Enjoy the process, and good luck with your training!\n\n- Move sideways by crossing your feet for better balance and strength.\n- Take your time; controlled movements are crucial for success.\n- Focus on your weight distribution to enhance stability while moving.'),(76100,55896,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(76101,55896,'portrait_thumnbail_filename',''),(76102,55896,'_portrait_thumnbail_filename','field_682053ef408b7'),(76103,55896,'landscape_thumnbail_filename',''),(76104,55896,'_landscape_thumnbail_filename','field_68205408408b8'),(76105,55897,'_thumbnail_id','14268'),(76106,55897,'video_id','Zpb9Y7Czb5I'),(76107,55897,'video_type','tutorial'),(76108,55897,'order_position','7'),(76109,55897,'originalJSON','{\"kind\":\"youtube#playlistItem\",\"etag\":\"QrDsiRvd30LSa19XwOCTbWPTvMI\",\"id\":\"UExsSWQ4SDdOa3hUUF9IbVZpVVFKdnJvZnFhZ1pVWXRlRC41MzJCQjBCNDIyRkJDN0VD\",\"snippet\":{\"publishedAt\":\"2019-06-25T08:31:20Z\",\"channelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\",\"title\":\"How to Balance #08 - Alternative Sideways Parkour Tutorial. [008]\",\"description\":\"\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Balance (Beginner) in Parkour - Alternative Sideways.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Balance Series. Episode #08nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Balancing #AlternativeSideways #---nnAlternative Sideways Rail Movement.n n Trying out different intros.n This one should be better for reference on the Instagram feed.n Ok, so let\'s have a go at the \'behind the leg\' crossover walking on the 