wer pull-ups cultivate better control and strength, helping you to pinpoint your weaker areas for targeted improvement. As you continue to refine your form and increase the difficulty, you\'ll become more adept not just at pull-ups but also at adjusting your training style to suit different fitness goals. nn- Slowing down your pull-ups helps improve control and strength.n- Start with a manageable tempo and gradually increase the time to enhance difficulty.n- Use this technique to identify and develop your weaker points in pull-up mechanics.\",\n                    \"refusal\": null\n                },\n                \"logprobs\": null,\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"usage\": {\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1113,\n            \"completion_tokens\": 327,\n            \"total_tokens\": 1440,\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0\n            },\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0\n            }\n        },\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0ba0d124f1\"\n    },\n    \"response\": {\n        \"code\": 200,\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\n    },\n    \"cookies\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\n            \"value\": \"LNmVsJ1SLKDn0Y29j.3nBw1Ik.PIkQT_FG25jNqVdMg-1730722270-1.0.1.1-pOQO1o7VAiqHfLWy5EFEDeSRDLHoyl8R4hM8MHtinnRTD4WownO40x23CJnpUPc.KBAk1BczQfZ5wnjvWZiMXQ\",\n            \"expires\": 1730724070,\n            \"path\": \"/\",\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\n            \"port\": null,\n            \"host_only\": false\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"_cfuvid\",\n            \"value\": \"NBdnWNHIXgwRVZItJQU4f.MWwypRA0lospV8nD282FE-1730722270776-0.0.1.1-604800000\",\n            \"expires\": null,\n            \"path\": \"/\",\n            \"domain\": \"api.openai.com\",\n            \"port\": null,\n            \"host_only\": false\n        }\n    ],\n    \"filename\":