 against, turning your hands 90 degrees and twisting through your body. A resistance band can also be useful: with one arm through the band, step back, and let your body weight stretch the latissimus dorsi. Finally, to gently stretch your abs, lie on the floor and arch your back while looking up. Although it can be challenging to stretch the abs deeply, this motion will help release tension in that area. Prioritizing these recovery exercises will help you bounce back faster and keep you in peak condition for your next session.nnIn summary, incorporating targeted stretches and relief techniques into your post-training routine will keep your muscles healthy and enhance your performance in future workouts. Listen to your body, focus on the areas you’ve worked, and give yourself the care needed to recover effectively. nn- Start with stretches for your forearms to alleviate lactic acid buildup.n- Perform shoulder stretches with proper alignment to maximize benefits.n- Use resistance bands for effective lats stretching and maintain a focus on overall recovery.\",\n                    \"refusal\": null\n                },\n                \"logprobs\": null,\n                \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n            }\n        ],\n        \"usage\": {\n            \"prompt_tokens\": 1698,\n            \"completion_tokens\": 450,\n            \"total_tokens\": 2148,\n            \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\n                \"cached_tokens\": 0\n            },\n            \"completion_tokens_details\": {\n                \"reasoning_tokens\": 0\n            }\n        },\n        \"system_fingerprint\": \"fp_0ba0d124f1\"\n    },\n    \"response\": {\n        \"code\": 200,\n        \"message\": \"OK\"\n    },\n    \"cookies\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"__cf_bm\",\n            \"value\": \"ckZ28SUdag5i5JTepxJttPCkSwo8i4_a7RQQ8SFFItM-1730722392-1.0.1.1-klLpNAm.QLmE8det4jgCfGxkWnh6kkxpdrqY2qofTFJWH9aXj.QqJQYlRSMRAE3crfafVUWZWAJjjsW0uB0q1Q\",\n            \"expires\