rail, keeping your movements smooth and controlled.\n\nIn summary, stepping over a rail or fence doesn’t have to be intimidating. By starting in the right position, using one hand for support, and maintaining your balance with each step, you can easily navigate obstacles in your way. Remember to take your time with the movement, as mastering this technique will increase your confidence and ability in various environments.\n\nHighlights:\n- Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart for better balance.\n- Use one hand on the rail for support while stepping over.\n- Focus on smooth, controlled movements to ensure safety.'),(77320,55944,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77321,55944,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"so today we\'re going to have a look at\",\n        \"start\": 2.899,\n        \"duration\": 5.431\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"just starting to step over or up onto\",\n        \"start\": 5.09,\n        \"duration\": 5.01\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the rail with our same hand position\",\n        \"start\": 8.33,\n        \"duration\": 4.139\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"okay so you start in this position you\",\n        \"start\": 10.1,\n        \"duration\": 5.13\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"have a low rail or a fence or whatever\",\n        \"start\": 12.469,\n        \"duration\": 4.861\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you\'re trying to get over and you\'re\",\n        \"start\": 15.23,\n        \"duration\": 4.49\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"gonna put\",\n        \"start\": 17.33,\n        \"duration\": 2.39\n    }\n]'),(77322,55944,'_video_transcript_json','field_67221da62655b'),(77323,55944,'video_transcript_srt','1\n00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,000\nso today we\'re going to have a look at\n\n2\n00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000\njust starting to step over or up onto\n\n3\n00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000\nthe rail with our same hand position\n\n4\n00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000\nokay 