cticing for a sport or just want to enhance your skills, the goal is to build on what we learned previously. Don’t stress about the exact direction of your landing or how your hands will come down; instead, concentrate on getting over the bar with momentum. This will help you build confidence and improve your technique.\n\nTo start, choose a bar height that feels comfortable for you, whether it’s low or high. The key is to maintain a balance of effort and focus. As you approach the bar, build up some momentum to give you that extra lift. Remember, it’s all about feeling that push and believing in your ability to clear the obstacle. As you practice, pay attention to your takeoff and landing—try to land softly on both feet while maintaining control.\n\nBy consistently practicing this approach, you’ll gradually enhance your jumping ability and overall performance. Remember, the emphasis today is not solely on your final landing but on the entire jumping process. Focus on your momentum and enjoy the thrill of gradually mastering this skill!\n\nHighlights:\n- Focus on building momentum to improve your jump.\n- Choose a comfortable bar height to practice.\n- Concentrate on the overall jumping technique rather than the final landing.'),(77416,55948,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77417,55948,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"so today we\'re gonna build on yesterday\",\n        \"start\": 3.19,\n        \"duration\": 5.01\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"again the idea is that we\'re gonna try\",\n        \"start\": 5.62,\n        \"duration\": 4.95\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"and get one leg we\'re gonna land on both\",\n        \"start\": 8.2,\n        \"duration\": 4.83\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"feet today okay then don\'t worry about\",\n        \"start\": 10.57,\n        \"duration\": 5.04\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"where you\'re landing in direction and\",\n        \"start\": 13.03,\n        \"dura