cing your hand placements and foot positioning. The goal is to land optimally to enhance your performance and reduce the risk of injury. With a little dedication and consistent practice, you’ll find that landing with both feet in the right direction will become second nature, making your movements more fluid and safe.\n\n- Focus on keeping your hands in the correct position before landing to help maintain balance.\n- Practice turning your body so that your feet end up facing the opposite direction upon landing.\n- Don’t worry about immediate perfection; even imperfect landings are part of the learning process.'),(77584,55955,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77585,55955,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"worked on the defeat going over the bar\",\n        \"start\": 2.929,\n        \"duration\": 5.671\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"hands in the right position now we\'re\",\n        \"start\": 6.08,\n        \"duration\": 4.77\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"going to land in the correct position so\",\n        \"start\": 8.6,\n        \"duration\": 4.079\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"after Pete I\'ve got to the other side\",\n        \"start\": 10.85,\n        \"duration\": 5.159\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"but we\'re going to try to turn and land\",\n        \"start\": 12.679,\n        \"duration\": 5.311\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"with both feet facing in the opposite\",\n        \"start\": 16.009,\n        \"duration\": 4.441\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"direction okay this is give it a go you\",\n        \"start\": 17.99,\n        \"duration\": 23.4\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"just keep Pietra Pete brookey and okay\",\n        \"start\": 20.45,\n        \"duration\": 23.039\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you\'ll notice I am not worrying about\",\n        \"start\": 41.39,\n        \"duration\": 4.109\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"hands and they\'re actually landing\",\