t way to practice this is through a specific drill that emphasizes height—keep jumping high, concentrating on that upward motion, which is critical for developing your space and control in the air. Practice this consistently, and you’ll start to notice improvements in your jumping technique.\n\nIn summary, focusing on your vertical jump while maintaining a proper hip position is essential for mastering your movement. By visualizing the jump’s elliptical shape and incorporating high jump drills, you can enhance both your vertical reach and overall control. Remember, it’s not just about how high you can jump; it’s also about how effectively you can transition during your movement.\n\n- Visualize your jumps as an elliptical motion for better technique.\n- Keep your hips low and focus on creating space during your jump.\n- Incorporate high jump drills to boost your height and control.'),(77632,55957,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77633,55957,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"try and fix a couple of faults today the\",\n        \"start\": 2.909,\n        \"duration\": 6.451\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"idea is that like I\'ve said before we\",\n        \"start\": 6.42,\n        \"duration\": 5.49\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"want to go up you want to turn at the\",\n        \"start\": 9.36,\n        \"duration\": 4.859\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"top and come back down so it\'s kind of\",\n        \"start\": 11.91,\n        \"duration\": 10.47\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"going out and back okay so it becomes\",\n        \"start\": 14.219,\n        \"duration\": 10.201\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"kind of this elite elliptical kind of\",\n        \"start\": 22.38,\n        \"duration\": 2.82\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"shape all right\",\n        \"start\": 24.42,\n        \"duration\": 2.91\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you want to go up tight little turn and\",\n        \"start\