re you\'re arching properly. Practicing this way not only builds core strength but also ingrains the correct posture and technique for your cat pass and Kong.\n\nIn summary, mastering the cat pass or Kong relies heavily on getting your hips up high, and practicing bouncing exercises can significantly aid in achieving this lift. Focus on creating an upward motion with your whole body, and soon enough, you’ll find that space under you increasing, making these moves feel much more accessible. Keep a consistent practice, and you’ll notice improvements in no time.\n\n- Elevate your hips to create space for techniques like the cat pass and Kong.\n- Use bouncing exercises to build the strength and flexibility required for the lift.\n- Engage both arms and legs during practice to maximize upward momentum.'),(77776,55963,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77777,55963,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"okay so today\'s is basically trying to\",\n        \"start\": 7.4,\n        \"duration\": 5.98\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"get your hips up nice and high so for\",\n        \"start\": 11.219,\n        \"duration\": 4.951\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the cat pass or the Kong you want to\",\n        \"start\": 13.38,\n        \"duration\": 5.729\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"create room underneath you and to do\",\n        \"start\": 16.17,\n        \"duration\": 4.38\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"that you want to get your hips nice and\",\n        \"start\": 19.109,\n        \"duration\": 3.541\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"high so this little exercise of just\",\n        \"start\": 20.55,\n        \"duration\": 3.989\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"bouncing up trying to get the hips as\",\n        \"start\": 22.65,\n        \"duration\": 3.78\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"high as you possibly can is going to\",\n        \"start\": 24.539,\n        \"duration\": 3.271\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\