ercise is an excellent way to build strength and improve your technique in your chosen activity. By pushing your feet further along the surface, you’ll not only enhance your reach but also develop better power and efficiency in your performance. Keep practicing, and you\'ll soon notice the benefits in your skills and overall endurance.\n\nKey highlights:\n- Focus on pushing your feet further down a box or wall to increase power.\n- Engage your core and legs for better performance.\n- Keep challenging yourself to reach new distances for improved strength.'),(77848,55966,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77849,55966,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"okay so very slight difference today and\",\n        \"start\": 11.2,\n        \"duration\": 6.34\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"with this one essentially you\'re trying\",\n        \"start\": 16.009,\n        \"duration\": 3.481\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"to do exactly the same as getting the\",\n        \"start\": 17.54,\n        \"duration\": 3.69\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"feet on but now you\'re trying to work\",\n        \"start\": 19.49,\n        \"duration\": 3.48\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the feet further along the box or the\",\n        \"start\": 21.23,\n        \"duration\": 3.599\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"wall you\'re trying to work towards that\",\n        \"start\": 22.97,\n        \"duration\": 5.07\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"back edge getting more power to push you\",\n        \"start\": 24.829,\n        \"duration\": 14.791\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"through okay all right that\'s it\",\n        \"start\": 28.04,\n        \"duration\": 13.74\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"just try and keep pushing and see how\",\n        \"start\": 39.62,\n        \"duration\": 5.36\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"far you can get good luck\",\n        \"start\": 41.78,\n        \"duration\": 3.2\n    }\n]'),(77850,