focus on both foot positions, you\'ll see progress in your jumping technique in no time.\n\n- Practice your jumps with a staggered foot placement for better power.\n- Train both sides by alternating which foot is in front to improve balance.\n- Consistency in practice will lead to better jumping technique and skill enhancement.'),(77896,55968,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(77897,55968,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"[Music]\",\n        \"start\": 5.5,\n        \"duration\": 7.029\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"all right so today we\'re going to now\",\n        \"start\": 13.99,\n        \"duration\": 5.32\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"focus on trying to do split foot so\",\n        \"start\": 16.64,\n        \"duration\": 4.86\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you\'re not taking off with both feet at\",\n        \"start\": 19.31,\n        \"duration\": 4.86\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"the same time parallel you\'re trying to\",\n        \"start\": 21.5,\n        \"duration\": 4.83\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"ultimate the feet so one is ahead of the\",\n        \"start\": 24.17,\n        \"duration\": 4.14\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"other this is going to help when you\'re\",\n        \"start\": 26.33,\n        \"duration\": 4.8\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"running into the cat puss and you\'re\",\n        \"start\": 28.31,\n        \"duration\": 4.109\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"going to be able to get over and create\",\n        \"start\": 31.13,\n        \"duration\": 3.54\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"more power to get over it okay so start\",\n        \"start\": 32.419,\n        \"duration\": 3.901\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"with your feet staggered and we\'ll go\",\n        \"start\": 34.67,\n        \"duration\": 3.69\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"back to the first version of just trying\",\n        \"start\": 36.32,\n        \"duration\": 5.80