4NTIzM0Y5\",\"snippet\":{\"publishedAt\":\"2019-06-25T09:13:36Z\",\"channelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\",\"title\":\"How to Cat Pass #07 - Split Foot Step Parkour Tutorial. [031]\",\"description\":\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Cat Pass (Beginner) in Parkour - Split Foot Step.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Cat Pass Series. Episode #07nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Vaulting #SplitFootStep #---nnSplit foot ud83dudc63 take-off progression 2.nnNow we are starting to look at the steps into a running Cat-Pass. Let\'s focus on one step at a time and try to understand how our feet step into the correct position before takeoff.nn1. Make sure you try both sides. This is always super important. The environment always dictates how you can move, so if you\'re unable to do one side, this makes you less functional as a practitioner and human being!nn2. Try to see how much momentum you can generate and USE for this variation. There\'s a difference between stepping in and stepping in while transfering the momentum into the vault.nnTry spending a good half hour on each side and get used to that split foot position .nnHave fun!n nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/2Rcs8VenCat Leaps Tutorial u25b6 https://bit. Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/2S1yBTinUnderbar Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/34FM7yInSwinging Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cbcAbKnRolling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIuogAnJumping Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIfbMjnCrawling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vIT7qpnClimbing Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vNB6YinBalancing Demo u25b6 https://bit. to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_  https:/