ion\":\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Cat Pass (Beginner) in Parkour - Split Foot, 2 Step.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Cat Pass Series. Episode #08nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Vaulting #SplitFoot,2Step #---nnSplit foot ud83dudc63 Cat-Pass ud83dudc08 Progression 3.nnAlright, we are getting closer to running into the Cat-Pass now. Let\'s start taking two steps into the takeoff position before the vault.nn1. The distance you step back will probably be less than when you go forward and therefore you will feel like you have to do a small little skip to get into position. This is ok as long as you start getting into the correct takeoff position.nn2. Go slow to begin with and start to speed up as you get more comfortable with where your feet are going.nn3. Make sure you do both sides!nn4. Try to think less about where your feet have to go. Just step forwards with the first step and your body will go into default mode and figure out the step pattern itself.nnHave a great weekend and get out there are start training!nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/2Rcs8VenCat Leaps Tutorial u25b6 https://bit. Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/2S1yBTinUnderbar Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/34FM7yInSwinging Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cbcAbKnRolling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIuogAnJumping Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIfbMjnCrawling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vIT7qpnClimbing Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vNB6YinBalancing Demo u25b6 https://bit. to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COMnnud83dudd39 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.nnu