s. Episode #13nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Vaulting #RunningTwoFoot #---nnRunning two-foot Cat-PassnnGoing back to the Cat-Pass for a minute, we\'re looking at the running trajectory of the run up.nnThe key point is to NOT hop or jump into a two foot position before the Cat-Pass. This will mess up your trajectory, momentum and positioning.nn1.Don\'t hop into the two-foot position. Instead, you need to bend down and change you body position height to be lower, so that you have an upwards trajectory coming UP to the box.nn2. Lower yourself by bending the knees a little as you approach the Cat-Pass. This puts you in the same lower position as if you had jumped into it (the wrong way). nn3. The main way to tell if you\'re doing it right is that you can feel that the momentum from the run up is actually being used into the Cat-Pass.nn4. Lastly, you should feel like you can take off further back, and quicker... Keep practicing and enjoy! This one is a little trickier to master, but keep at it.nn--- Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fX1d8knStep Vault Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3wV3ckvnBalancing Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cdWrlTnPullups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3g3cX9hnTurn Vaults Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3yUnM6cnCat Pass Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fG9qyEnClimbups Tutorial u25b6 https://bit.ly/2Rcs8VenCat Leaps Tutorial u25b6 https://bit. Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/2S1yBTinUnderbar Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/34FM7yInSwinging Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3cbcAbKnRolling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIuogAnJumping Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3fIfbMjnCrawling Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vIT7qpnClimbing Demo u25b6 https://bit.ly/3vNB6YinBalancing Demo u25b6 https://bit. to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COMnnud83dudd39 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.nnu26a1ufe0f https://