wrists above the water and pivoting accordingly, you’ll find it easier to control your movements and maintain a smooth flow. This small adjustment can lead to better performance and a more enjoyable experience on the water, whether you\'re swimming, kayaking, or engaging in any water-based activity.\n\n- Keep your hands flat and focused around the pivot point when entering the water.\n- Raise your wrists above the water for better control and positioning.\n- Practice transitioning smoothly from your initial wrist position to enhance your technique.'),(78137,55978,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(78138,55978,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"okay so today\'s tip is trying to get\",\n        \"start\": 11.63,\n        \"duration\": 7.3\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"your hands from the edge of the water so\",\n        \"start\": 15.42,\n        \"duration\": 7.71\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"flat on the pivot point raise your wrist\",\n        \"start\": 18.93,\n        \"duration\": 7.65\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"so the wrist is below the war is going\",\n        \"start\": 23.13,\n        \"duration\": 5.25\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"to be very hard to get your arm above it\",\n        \"start\": 26.58,\n        \"duration\": 3.449\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"so what we\'re trying to do is get the\",\n        \"start\": 28.38,\n        \"duration\": 3.809\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"wrist above the water so then we can\",\n        \"start\": 30.029,\n        \"duration\": 5.19\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"pivot up and get our body up on top okay\",\n        \"start\": 32.189,\n        \"duration\": 10.381\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"so I\'m gonna zoom here you\'re starting\",\n        \"start\": 35.219,\n        \"duration\": 9.75\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"with the wrist below and then you\'ll get\",\n        \"start\": 42.57,\n        \"duration\": 4.14\n