or while keeping your biomechanics on point. The right use of a slope can make your training not only easier but also more effective, helping you to develop a solid foundation in climbing. Stay mindful of your form, and enjoy the benefits that this approach brings to your practice!\n\nHighlights:\n- Use a slope to enhance your climbing technique and keep correct biomechanics.\n- Focus on maintaining good form to avoid strain and increase effectiveness.\n- Practicing on a slope can improve muscle engagement and overall climbing skills.'),(78313,55985,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(78314,55985,'portrait_thumnbail_filename',''),(78315,55985,'_portrait_thumnbail_filename','field_682053ef408b7'),(78316,55985,'landscape_thumnbail_filename',''),(78317,55985,'_landscape_thumnbail_filename','field_68205408408b8'),(78318,55986,'_thumbnail_id','14010'),(78319,55986,'video_id','raXXAPW9gDs'),(78320,55986,'video_type','tutorial'),(78321,55986,'order_position','8'),(78322,55986,'originalJSON','{\"kind\":\"youtube#playlistItem\",\"etag\":\"0kXwDnrcXtht87X7QKAmJABeDbQ\",\"id\":\"UExsSWQ4SDdOa3hUTktJVUhMckdzRTkwTXU5VXJZaERxTC4wMTcyMDhGQUE4NTIzM0Y5\",\"snippet\":{\"publishedAt\":\"2019-06-25T09:08:34Z\",\"channelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\",\"title\":\"How to Climbup #09 - Slope Progression Parkour Tutorial. [048]\",\"description\":\"ud83cudf93 A Tutorial on how to Climbup (Beginner) in Parkour - Slope Progression.nud83eudd77 The Parkour Climbup Series. Episode #09nu25e3u25e5 https://LONDONPARKOUR.comnnu2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2571u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572u2572nu2003u2003#Climbing #SlopeProgression #---nnClimbupsu2197 - Slope Progression ud83dudd3ann+ Using the slope again. nSuper useful tool for helping out the climbup.nn1. Being able to make the slope a very granular variable within the climbup training is a great way to make this exercise scalable.nn2. Go slow and try to record down the angle of the slope (or dista