at will transform the way you think, move and feel.nnu26a1ufe0f https://pulse.localhost:8443nnud83euddea https://labs.localhost:8443nnud83dudd38 https://www.Instagram.com/london_parkournnud83dudd38 https://www.youtube.com/londonparkournnud83dudd38 contact@localhost:8443nnu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nu2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u25e3 u25e5u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588u2588nnu3000u3000   video features Parkour performed either by professionals or under the supervision of professionals. All members of LondonParkour have been training since 2005 and insist that no one attempt to re-create or re-enact any ROOFTOP activities or movement AT HEIGHT performed in these videos. Do not use private property.nnu2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501u2501n{{Tag:beginner}}{{PostType:Tutorial}}{{Tax:Climbing}}{{Series:Climbups Tips}}\"\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z3lu3zXuHvQ/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z3lu3zXuHvQ/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z3lu3zXuHvQ/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z3lu3zXuHvQ/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Z3lu3zXuHvQ/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}},\"channelTitle\":\"London Parkour\",\"playlistId\":\"PLlId8H7NkxTNKIUHLrGsE90Mu9UrYhDqL\",\"position\":17,\"resourceId\":{\"kind\":\"youtube#video\",\"videoId\":\"Z3lu3zXuHvQ\"},\"videoOwnerChannelTitle\":\"London Parkour\",\"videoOwnerChannelId\":\"UCufdBIaXEIQwIX0CMGbXdAw\"},\"index\":17}'),(78539,55995,'scrapeId','Tutorial - Climbups'),(78540,55995,'authId','Auth1'),(78541,55995,'searchId','Tutorials - Climbups'),(78542,55995,'filterId','none'),(78543,55995,'mapperId','YouTube - Playlist Items - Tutorial Videos'),(78544,55995,'importId','Tutorial Videos - Climbups'),(78545,55995,'_edit_last','1'),(78546,55995,'video_transcript_chatgpt','If you\'re looking to add some excitement to your climbing routine, you\'ve come to the right place! This tutorial introduces a unique climbing move that not only spices up your ascent but also enhances your skills in a fun way. The aim is to execute a \"cook screw\" climb, which challenges your coordination and body control while navigating your way up the route.\n\nTo perform this move, start by positioning yourself at the base of the climb. From there, face the wall, then turn away to create a unique angle for your ascent. Begin with one arm extended outward while the other reaches around to grab behind you at the top. This motion may feel a bit unusual at first, but that\'s all part of the challenge! As you secure your hold, drive one leg upward to help propel your body into position. Keep your movements smooth, and don’t forget to enjoy the process!\n\nIn wrapping up, this cook screw move is an excellent way to break away from traditional climbing styles and build your climbing repertoire. Not only does it test your flexibility and strength, but it also brings a fresh approach to your climbing sessions. So, the next time you hit the climbing wall, give this technique a try and see how it takes your skills to new heights!\n\n- Start the climb by facing away from the wall and extending one arm outward.\n- Secure your grip by bringing the other arm behind you at the top position.\n- Drive one leg up while maintaining balance for a successful cook screw ascent.'),(78547,55995,'_video_transcript_chatgpt','field_67221db82655c'),(78548,55995,'video_transcript_json','[\n    {\n        \"text\": \"we\'re gonna have a look at a bit of a\",\n        \"start\": 2.6,\n        \"duration\": 5.15\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"weird climb up but it\'s kind of fun and\",\n        \"start\": 4.939,\n        \"duration\": 5.191\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"essentially something he just have a\",\n        \"start\": 7.75,\n        \"duration\": 4.36\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"little bit of spice to the climb up the\",\n        \"start\": 10.13,\n        \"duration\": 4.44\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"idea is we\'re gonna cook screw up on the\",\n        \"start\": 12.11,\n        \"duration\": 4.109\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"climber so you can start on the front\",\n        \"start\": 14.57,\n        \"duration\": 3.93\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"you\'re gonna turn away from the wall and\",\n        \"start\": 16.219,\n        \"duration\": 5.491\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"make your way up into the top position\",\n        \"start\": 18.5,\n        \"duration\": 6.66\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"okay a bit weird but it\'s kind of fun\",\n        \"start\": 21.71,\n        \"duration\": 6.22\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"and yeah try it out\",\n        \"start\": 25.16,\n        \"duration\": 8.419\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"[Music]\",\n        \"start\": 27.93,\n        \"duration\": 5.649\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"okay please stop from the front you just\",\n        \"start\": 41.78,\n        \"duration\": 6.13\n    },\n    {\n        \"text\": \"whisked out onto one arms and the other\",\n        \"start\": 44.969,\n        \"duration\": 7.891\n    },\n    {\n      