ill help with the whole process.\n\n3. Try to reverse the negative exactly. So try to get your belly on top of the wall on the way down AND up.\n\n4. Remember to practice steeping up with both legs! Try the weakest side first and see how it goes... \n \n \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vIT7qp\nClimbing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vNB6Yi\nBalancing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fFoQmX\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃    ＳＵＢＳＣＲＩＢＥ     ┃┃  🔔  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nSubscribe to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_confirmation=1\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ   ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\n🔹  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COM\n\n🔹 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.\n\n⚡️ https://pulse.localhost:8443\n\n🧪 https://labs.localhost:8443\n\n🔸 https://www.Instagram.com/london_parkour\n\n🔸 https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour\n\n🔸 contact@localhost:8443\n\n████████◣ ◥██████████████\n█████████◣ ◥█████████████\n██████████◣ ◥████████████\n███████████◣ ◥███████████\n████████████◣ ◥██████████\n█████████████◣ ◥█████████\n\n　　  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ\n\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃    ＤＩＳＣＬＡＩＭＥＲ    ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\nThis video features Parkour performed either by professionals or under the supervision of professionals. All members of LondonParkour have been training since 2005 and insist that no one attempt to re-create or re-enact any ROOFTOP activities or movement AT HEIGHT performed in these videos. Do not use private property.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{Tag:beginner}}{{PostType:Tutorial}}{{Tax:Climbing}}{{Series:Climbups Tips}}\" Climbups','How to Climbup #10 - Negatives + Pull Parkour Tutorial. [049] image','','inherit','open','closed','','how-to-climbup-10-negatives-pull-parkour-tutorial-049-image','','','2024-10-21 16:27:53','2024-10-21 16:27:53','',0,'http://localhost:8102/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/ntGwWorOYBE.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(14014,1,'2024-10-21 16:27:53','2024-10-21 16:27:53','🎓 A Tutorial on how to Climbup (Beginner) in Parkour - Front Grip + Pulling.\n🥷 The Parkour Climbup Series. Episode #11\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Climbing #FrontGrip+Pulling #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nClimbups - Front Grip + Pulling.\n\nThis progression is now going to incorporate a front grip only into the pulling action. \n\n1. If you keep defaulting to an overgrip, find a wall (or roof!) Where there isn\'t any Overgrip to use and take the opportunity out of the equation.\n\n2. Don\'t forget you can combine the slope with any of these progressions to help make it easier.\n\n3. Make sure that both elbows go down and up at the same time.\n\n4. Try to step up with the lower leg and ensure that you practice both sides!\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vIT7qp\nClimbing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vNB6Yi\nBalancing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fFoQmX\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃    ＳＵＢＳＣＲＩＢＥ     ┃┃  🔔  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nSubscribe to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_confirmation=1\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ   ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\n🔹  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COM\n\n🔹 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.\n\n⚡️ https://pulse.localhost:8443\n\n🧪 https://labs.localhost:8443\n\n🔸 https://www.Instagram.com/london_parkour\n\n🔸 https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour\n\n🔸 contact@localhost:8443\n\n████████◣ ◥██████████████\n█████████◣ ◥█████████████\n██████████◣ ◥████████████\n███████████◣ ◥███████████\n████████████◣ ◥██████████\n█████████████◣ ◥█████████\n\n　　  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ\n\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃    ＤＩＳＣＬＡＩＭＥＲ    ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\nThis video features Parkour performed either by professionals or under the supervision of professionals. All members of LondonParkour have been training since 2005 and insist that no one attempt to re-create or re-enact any ROOFTOP activities or movement AT HEIGHT performed in these videos. Do not use private property.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{Tag:beginner}}{{PostType:Tutorial}}{{Tax:Climbing}}{{Series:Climbups Tips}}\" Climbups','How to Climbup #11 - Front Grip + Pulling Parkour Tutorial. [050] image','','inherit','open','closed','','how-to-climbup-11-front-grip-pulling-parkour-tutorial-050-image','','','2024-10-21 16:27:53','2024-10-21 16:27:53','',0,'http://localhost:8102/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/hTZ7RBSt1HY.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(14016,1,'2024-10-21 16:27:53','2024-10-21 16:27:53','🎓 A Tutorial on how to Climbup (Beginner) in Parkour - Overgrip Pull.\n🥷 The Parkour Climbup Series. Episode #12\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Climbing #OvergripPull #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nClimbups - Overgrip Pull!\n\nToday we are just trying to pull without the negative. Using an overgrip and no slope now.\n\n1. Try to keep close to the wall as much as possible. You shouldn\'t be going away and then back in again. This is an indication that you\'re not using your arms enough to keep you towards the wall.\n\n2. Don\'t worry if you can\'t do this yet, there are plenty of progressions we\'ve gone through that will help you.\n\n3. ABSOLUTELY make sure both elbows are going up together. Remember correctly technique trumps EVERYTHING ELSE. It\'s better to not be able to get on than do it badly. We will be working strength exercises at some point, so don\'t worry. Just focus on technique!\n\n4. Remember to keep that foot high and I\'ve realised that it should be close to level with your hip, which logically makes sense if you want to push towards rather than down. \n \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vIT7qp\nClimbing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vNB6Yi\nBalancing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fFoQmX\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃    ＳＵＢＳＣＲＩＢＥ     ┃┃  🔔  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nSubscribe to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_confirmation=1\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ   ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\n🔹  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COM\n\n🔹 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.\n\n⚡️ https://pulse.localhost:8443\n\n🧪 https://labs.localhost:8443\n\n🔸 https://www.Instagram.com/london_parkour\n\n🔸 https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour\n\n🔸 contact@localhost:8443\n\n████████◣ ◥██████████████\n█████████◣ ◥█████████████\n██████████◣ ◥████████████\n███████████◣ ◥███████████\n████████████◣ ◥██████████\n█████████████◣ ◥█████████\n\n　　  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ\n\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃    ＤＩＳＣＬＡＩＭＥＲ    ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\nThis video features Parkour performed either by professionals or under the supervision of professionals. All members of LondonParkour have been training since 2005 and insist that no one attempt to re-create or re-enact any ROOFTOP activities or movement AT HEIGHT performed in these videos. Do not use private property.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{Tag:beginner}}{{PostType:Tutorial}}{{Tax:Climbing}}{{Series:Climbups Tips}}\" Climbups','How to Climbup #12 - Overgrip Pull Parkour Tutorial. [051] image','','inherit','open','closed','','how-to-climbup-12-overgrip-pull-parkour-tutorial-051-image','','','2024-10-21 16:27:53','2024-10-21 16:27:53','',0,'http://localhost:8102/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/VX4kdy51-dk.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(14018,1,'2024-10-21 16:27:54','2024-10-21 16:27:54','🎓 A Tutorial on how to Climbup (Beginner) in Parkour - Full.\n🥷 The Parkour Climbup Series. Episode #13\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Climbing #Full #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nCLIMBUPS!!! ⬆👆👍🐒🔼⏫⏏🔺⛰🛫🚀 \n\nSo the previous dozen or so videos have all been leading up to this... A proper climbup!\n\nMy aim of all these videos was to show you how this technique can be scaled to any ability level and allow anyone to start structuring their training to overcome this movement.\n\nIt\'s a particularly tricky movement to master and getting the correct mechanics and strength levels to do it will take time... But is achievable for ANYONE. Yes, that means YOU!\n\nSide note... I always chuckle at movies that have the hero dangling from one arm of a building/cliff, holding someone else in the other and they manage to do a climbup with that other person on them... Pffff... Do they KNOW how hard that would be?!? Anyway, make sure that you maintain the strict technique.. no one elbow and then the other... You\'re just fooling yourself, no one else.\n\nHave fun and enjoy the climbups! \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vIT7qp\nClimbing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vNB6Yi\nBalancing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fFoQmX\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃    ＳＵＢＳＣＲＩＢＥ     ┃┃  🔔  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nSubscribe to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_confirmation=1\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃ 