Tips}}\" Climbups','How to Climbup #14 - No Overgrip Parkour Tutorial. [053] image','','inherit','open','closed','','how-to-climbup-14-no-overgrip-parkour-tutorial-053-image','','','2024-10-21 16:27:54','2024-10-21 16:27:54','',0,'http://localhost:8102/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/psDeB85sATY.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(14022,1,'2024-10-21 16:27:54','2024-10-21 16:27:54','🎓 A Tutorial on how to Climbup (Beginner) in Parkour - Two Foot Crane.\n🥷 The Parkour Climbup Series. Episode #15\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Climbing #TwoFootCrane #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nClimbups - Two Foot Crane.\n\nA little bit more advanced today. We\'re trying to get into a crane position with two steps on the wall. This means the climbup becomes more effective and quicker to continue your path.\n\n1. All that foot positioning should now pay off. If you\'ve been practicing getting the feet in the right place and stepping up high enough, then this is the next step.\n\n2. Remember to try both sides!\n\n3. This may take a little while to accomplish, but keep persevering and get that foot higher and higher on the wall. \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ 