our Cat Pass Series. Episode #02\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Vaulting #OneFootUp #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nCat-Pass Progression 1.\n\nSo we\'re working on making further progress with the Cat-Pass/Kong. Let\'s try to maintain getting the hips high, but now you want to try and get one foot onto the box too.\n\nMake sure you do not try to keep the hands on the box when the foot is on.\n\nSpend some time working both sides too. You\'ll need it for the next progression.\n\nGood luck!\n \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vIT7qp\nClimbing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vNB6Yi\nBalancing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fFoQmX\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃    ＳＵＢＳＣＲＩＢＥ     ┃┃  🔔  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nSubscribe to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_confirmation=1\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ   ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\n🔹  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COM\n\n🔹 Practical movement that will transform the way you think, move and feel.\n\n⚡️ https://pulse.localhost:8443\n\n🧪 https://labs.localhost:8443\n\n🔸 https://www.Instagram.com/london_parkour\n\n🔸 https://www.youtube.com/londonparkour\n\n🔸 contact@localhost:8443\n\n████████◣ ◥██████████████\n█████████◣ ◥█████████████\n██████████◣ ◥████████████\n███████████◣ ◥███████████\n████████████◣ ◥██████████\n█████████████◣ ◥█████████\n\n　　  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ\n\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃    ＤＩＳＣＬＡＩＭＥＲ    ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\nThis video features Parkour performed either by professionals or under the supervision of professionals. All members of LondonParkour have been training since 2005 and insist that no one attempt to re-create or re-enact any ROOFTOP activities or movement AT HEIGHT performed in these videos. Do not use private property.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n{{Tag:beginner}}{{PostType:Tutorial}}{{Tax:Vaulting}}{{Series:Cat Pass Tips}}\" Cat-Pass','How to Cat Pass #02 - One Foot Up Parkour Tutorial. [026] image','','inherit','open','closed','','how-to-cat-pass-02-one-foot-up-parkour-tutorial-026-image','','','2024-10-21 16:32:56','2024-10-21 16:32:56','',0,'http://localhost:8102/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/aJw6UeI2EEQ.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(14110,1,'2024-10-21 16:32:57','2024-10-21 16:32:57','🎓 A Tutorial on how to Cat Pass (Beginner) in Parkour - Two Feet Up.\n🥷 The Parkour Cat Pass Series. Episode #03\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Vaulting #TwoFeetUp #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nCat-Pass Progression 3.\n\nSo the Kong/Cat-Pass is starting to take shape now and we\'re driving BOTH feet up onto the box at the same time now. ⛔ BEWARE! Do NOT twist and lean over one side and get the feet onto the box while using one arm still on the box. This will not help you and actually make it harder to get the Cat-Pass.\n\nYou need to absolutely make sure your knees are coming through the middle, between your arms. Hips are always facing forwards, do not twist them.\n\nEnsuring you are still getting hips high, generating space, and taking the hands off the wall as the feet land.\n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━