rial}}{{Tax:Balancing}}{{Series:Rail Balance Tips}}\" Rail Balancing','How to Balance #11 - Squat Without Arms Parkour Tutorial. [011] image','','inherit','open','closed','','how-to-balance-11-squat-without-arms-parkour-tutorial-011-image','','','2024-10-21 16:35:28','2024-10-21 16:35:28','',0,'http://localhost:8102/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/SUzGxEdv5aw.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(14276,1,'2024-10-21 16:35:28','2024-10-21 16:35:28','\"🎓 A Tutorial on how to Balance (Beginner) in Parkour - Pelvic Tilt.\n🥷 The Parkour Balance Series. Episode #12\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Balancing #PelvicTilt #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nPelvic Tilt Position.\n \n Super important topic today. Pelvis position.\n Every movement to do has something to do with the hips and where they sit will make a big impact.\n - Day to Day sitting will cause a bad exposition on the pelvis. Correcting it and stacking your spine correctly will make you more stable.\n - Squeeze your butt, engage the abs about 20% to keep the pelvis in the correct position.\n - Film yourself for feedback and look at your spine position.\n - Correcting this is a never-ending challenge! Good luck amigos! \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuog