,0),(14300,1,'2024-10-21 16:35:52','2024-10-21 16:35:52','🎓 A Tutorial on how to Land (Beginner) in Parkour - Ball Of Foot.\n🥷 The Parkour Land Series. Episode #03\n◣◥ https://LONDONPARKOUR.com\n\n╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲\n  #Jumping #BallOfFoot #Parkour\n╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╲╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱╱\n\n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n┃   ＤＥＳＣＲＩＰＴＩＯＮ    ┃\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n\n---\n\nTutorial Series - Landings - Foot\n\nI know, it\'s the same video as the intro video... but not really. here\'s some extra bits to know.\n\nWHY use the balls of the foot? Muscular contraction and engagement. Also help keep your balance by stabilising your center of gravity from extra motion to throw you off.\n\nDo NOT use the heel of the foot (or arch of the foot) to land on, as this will cause damage to the foot, ankle and all joints up the body... through to the hips and spine.\n \n\n---\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃ ＴＵＴＯＲＩＡＬ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ  ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nLanding Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fX1d8k\nStep Vault Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3wV3ckv\nBalancing Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3cdWrlT\nPullups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3g3cX9h\nTurn Vaults Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3yUnM6c\nCat Pass Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fG9qyE\nClimbups Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/2Rcs8Ve\nCat Leaps Tutorial ▶ https://bit.ly/3fY2EmW\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃   ＤＥＭＯ　ＳＥＲＩＥＳ    ┃┃  ▶  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nVaulting Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/2S1yBTi\nUnderbar Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/34FM7yI\nSwinging Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3cbcAbK\nRolling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIuogA\nJumping Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fIfbMj\nCrawling Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vIT7qp\nClimbing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3vNB6Yi\nBalancing Demo ▶ https://bit.ly/3fFoQmX\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮╭━━━━━╮\n┃    ＳＵＢＳＣＲＩＢＥ     ┃┃  🔔  ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯╰━━━━━╯\n\nSubscribe to channel: https://youtube.com/londonparkour?sub_confirmation=1\n\n\n\n╭━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╮\n┃  ＬＯＮＤＯＮＰＡＲＫＯＵＲ   ┃\n╰━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╯\n\n🔹  https://LONDONPARKOUR.COM\n\n🔹 Practica